ached to the work\n+      (an example is provided in the Appendix below).\n+\n+      \"Derivative Works\" shall mean any work, whether in Source or Object\n+      form, that is based on (or derived from) the Work and for which the\n+      editorial revisions, annotations, elaborations, or other modifications\n+      represent, as a whole, an original work of authorship. For the purposes\n+      of this License, Derivative Works shall not include works that remain\n+      separable from, or merely link (or bind by name) to the interfaces of,\n+      the Work and Derivative Works thereof.\n+\n+      \"Contribution\" shall mean any work of authorship, including\n+      the original version of the Work and any modifications or additions\n+      to that Work or Derivative Works thereof, that is intentionally\n+      submitted to the Licensor for inclusion in the Work by the copyright\n+      owner or by an individual or Legal Entity authorized to submit on behalf\n+      of the copyright owner. For the purposes of this definition, \"submitted\"\n+      means any form of electronic, verbal, or written communication sent\n+      to the Licensor or its representatives, including but not limited to\n+      communication on electronic mailing lists, source code control systems,\n+      and issue tracking systems that are managed by, or on behalf of, the\n+      Licensor for the purpose of discussing and improving the Work, but\n+      excluding communication that is conspicuously marked or otherwise\n+      designated in writing by the copyright owner as \"Not a Contribution.\"\n+\n+      \"Contributor\" shall mean Licensor and any individual or Legal Entity\n+      on behalf of whom a Contribution has been received by Licensor and\n+      subsequently incorporated within the Work.\n+\n+   2. Grant of Copyright License. Subject to the terms and conditions of\n+      this License, each Contributor hereby grants to You a perpetual,\n+      worldwide, non-exclusive, no-charge, royalty-free, irrevocable\n+      copyright license to reproduce, prepare Derivative Works of,\n+      publicly display, publicly perform, sublicense, and distribute the\n+      Work and such Derivative Works in Source or Object form.\n+\n+   3. Grant of Patent License. Subject to the terms and conditions of\n+      this License, each Contributor hereby grants to You a perpetual,\n+      worldwide, non-exclusive, no-charge, royalty-free, irrevocable\n+      (except as stated in this section) patent license to make, have made,\n+      use, offer to sell, sell, import, and otherwise transfer the Work,\n+      where such license applies only to those patent claims licensable\n+      by such Contributor that are necessarily infringed by their\n+      Contribution(s) alone or by combination of their Contribution(s)\n+      with the Work to which such Contribution(s) was submitted. If You\n+      institute patent litigation against any entity (including a\n+      cross-claim or counterclaim in a lawsuit) alleging that the Work\n+      or a Contribution incorporated within the Work constitutes direct\n+      or contributory patent infringement, then any patent licenses\n+      granted to You under this License for that Work shall terminate\n+      as of the date such litigation is filed.\n+\n+   4. Redistribution. You may reproduce and distribute copies of the\n+      Work or Derivative Works thereof in any medium, with or without\n+      modifications, and in Source or Object form, provided that You\n+      meet the following conditions:\n+\n+      (a) You must give any other recipients of the Work or\n+          Derivative Works a copy of this License; and\n+\n+      (b) You must cause any modified files to carry prominent notices\n+          stating that You changed the files; and\n+\n+      (c) You must retain, in the Source form of any Derivative Works\n+          that You distribute, all copyright, patent, trademark, and\n+          attribution notices from the Source form of the Work,\n+          excluding those notices that do not pertain to any part of\n+          the Derivative Works; and\n+\n+      (d) If the Work includes a \"NOTICE\" text file as part of its\n+          distribution, then any Derivative Works that You distribute must\n+          include a readable copy of the attribution notices contained\n+          within such NOTICE file, excluding those notices that do not\n+          pertain to any part of the Derivative Works, in at least one\n+          of the following places: within a NOTICE text file distributed\n+          as part of the Derivative Works; within the Source form or\n+          documentation, if provided along with the Derivative Works; or,\n+          within a display generated by the Derivative Works, if and\n+          wherever such third-party notices normally appear. The contents\n+          of the NOTICE file are for informational purposes only and\n+          do not modify the License. You may add Your own attribution\n+          notices within Derivative Works that You distribute, alongside\n+          or as an addendum to the NOTICE text from the Work, provided\n+          that such additional attribution notices cannot be construed\n+          as modifying the License.\n+\n+      You may add Your own copyright statement to Your modifications and\n+      may provide additional or different license terms and conditions\n+      for use, reproduction, or distribution of Your modifications, or\n+      for any such Derivative Works as a whole, provided Your use,\n+      reproduction, and distribution of the Work otherwise complies with\n+      the conditions stated in this License.\n+\n+   5. Submission of Contributions. Unless You explicitly state otherwise,\n+      any Contribution intentionally submitted for inclusion in the Work\n+      by You to the Licensor shall be under the terms and conditions of\n+      this License, without any additional terms or conditions.\n+      Notwithstanding the above, nothing herein shall supersede or modify\n+      the terms of any separate license agreement you may have executed\n+      with Licensor regarding such Contributions.\n+\n+   6. Trademarks. This License does not grant permission to use the trade\n+      names, trademarks, service marks, or product names of the Licensor,\n+      except as required for reasonable and customary use in describing the\n+      origin of the Work and reproducing the content of the NOTICE file.\n+\n+   7. Disclaimer of Warranty. Unless required by applicable law or\n+      agreed to in writing, Licensor provides the Work (and each\n+      Contributor provides its Contributions) on an \"AS IS\" BASIS,\n+      WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or\n+      implied, including, without limitation, any warranties or conditions\n+      of TITLE, NON-INFRINGEMENT, MERCHANTABILITY, or FITNESS FOR A\n+      PARTICULAR PURPOSE. You are solely responsible for determining the\n+      appropriateness of using or redistributing the Work and assume any\n+      risks associated with Your exercise of permissions under this License.\n+\n+   8. Limitation of Liability. In no event and under no legal theory,\n+      whether in tort (including negligence), contract, or otherwise,\n+      unless required by applicable law (such as deliberate and grossly\n+      negligent acts) or agreed to in writing, shall any Contributor be\n+      liable to You for damages, including any direct, indirect, special,\n+      incidental, or consequential damages of any character arising as a\n+      result of this License or out of the use or inability to use the\n+      Work (including but not limited to damages for loss of goodwill,\n+      work stoppage, computer failure or malfunction, or any and all\n+      other commercial damages or losses), even if such Contributor\n+      has been advised of the possibility of such damages.\n+\n+   9. Accepting Warranty or Additional Liability. While redistributing\n+      the Work or Derivative Works thereof, You may choose to offer,\n+      and charge a fee for, acceptance of support, warranty, indemnity,\n+      or other liability obligations and/or rights consistent with this\n+      License. However, in accepting such obligations, You may act only\n+      on Your own behalf and on Your sole responsibility, not on behalf\n+      of any other Contributor, and only if You agree to indemnify,\n+      defend, and hold each Contributor harmless for any liability\n+      incurred by, or claims asserted against, such Contributor by reason\n+      of your accepting any such warranty or additional liability.\n+\n+   END OF TERMS AND CONDITIONS\n+\n+---\n+\n+MIT License\n+\n+Copyright (c) 2024-2025 Model Context Protocol a Series of LF Projects, LLC.\n+\n+Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n+of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n+in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n+to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n+copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n+furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n+\n+The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n+copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n+\n+THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n+IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n+FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n+AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n+LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n+OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n+SOFTWARE.\n+\n+---\n+\n+Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)\n+\n+Documentation in this project (excluding specifications) is licensed under\n+CC-BY-4.0. See https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode for\n+the full license text.\n+\n+---\n+\n+License notice for Zod\n+\n+MIT License\n+\n+Copyright (c) 2025 Colin McDonnell\n+\n+Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n+of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n+in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n+to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n+copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n+furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n+\n+The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n+copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n+\n+THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n+IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n+FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n+AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n+LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n+OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n+SOFTWARE."},{"sha":"fc84d8c51a8465ea5d3f3f0bd14ba3aa5c9197cd","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/DependencyInjection/McpComponentServiceCollectionExtensions.cs","status":"added","additions":82,"deletions":0,"changes":82,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FDependencyInjection%2FMcpComponentServiceCollectionExtensions.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FDependencyInjection%2FMcpComponentServiceCollectionExtensions.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FDependencyInjection%2FMcpComponentServiceCollectionExtensions.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,82 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Linq;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Authorization;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Endpoints.FormMapping;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Endpoints;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Forms.Mapping;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.FormMapping;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Hosting;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Extensions;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Logging;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Options;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.DependencyInjection;\n+\n+internal static class McpComponentServiceCollectionExtensions\n+{\n+    private static readonly object HttpDefaultServiceKey = new();\n+\n+    public static void AddMcpComponentServices(this IServiceCollection services)\n+    {\n+        if (services.Any(descriptor => descriptor.ServiceType == typeof(McpServicesMarker)))\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        services.AddRazorComponents();\n+        services.AddCascadingAuthenticationState();\n+        services.AddSingleton<McpServicesMarker>();\n+        services.AddScoped<McpOperationContext>();\n+        services.AddScoped<McpComponentHost>();\n+        services.AddScoped(provider => new McpComponentRequestContext(provider.GetRequiredService<McpOperationContext>()));\n+        services.AddCascadingValue(provider => provider.GetRequiredService<McpComponentRequestContext>());\n+        services.AddScoped<McpFormDataProvider>();\n+        services.AddScoped(provider =>\n+        {\n+            var options = provider.GetRequiredService<IOptions<RazorComponentsServiceOptions>>().Value;\n+            return new FormDataMapperOptions(provider.GetRequiredService<ILoggerFactory>())\n+            {\n+                MaxRecursionDepth = options.MaxFormMappingRecursionDepth,\n+                MaxErrorCount = options.MaxFormMappingErrorCount,\n+                MaxCollectionSize = options.MaxFormMappingCollectionSize,\n+                MaxKeyBufferSize = options.MaxFormMappingKeySize,\n+            };\n+        });\n+        AddOperationService<NavigationManager, McpNavigationManager>(services);\n+        AddOperationService<IFormValueMapper, McpFormValueMapper>(services);\n+        AddOperationService<AuthenticationStateProvider, McpAuthenticationStateProvider>(services);\n+    }\n+\n+    private static void AddOperationService<TService, TImplementation>(IServiceCollection services)\n+        where TService : class\n+        where TImplementation : class, TService\n+    {\n+        var original = services.Last(descriptor => !descriptor.IsKeyedService && descriptor.ServiceType == typeof(TService));\n+        if (original.Lifetime != ServiceLifetime.Scoped)\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException($\"The component service '{typeof(TService)}' must be scoped to support independent HTTP and MCP rendering operations.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        services.Remove(original);\n+        if (original.ImplementationType is { } implementationType)\n+        {\n+            services.Add(new ServiceDescriptor(typeof(TService), HttpDefaultServiceKey, implementationType, original.Lifetime));\n+        }\n+        else\n+        {\n+            var factory = original.ImplementationFactory\n+                ?? throw new InvalidOperationException($\"The scoped component service '{typeof(TService)}' has no implementation factory.\");\n+            services.Add(new ServiceDescriptor(typeof(TService), HttpDefaultServiceKey, (provider, _) => factory(provider), original.Lifetime));\n+        }\n+\n+        services.TryAddScoped<TImplementation>();\n+        services.AddScoped<TService>(provider => provider.GetRequiredService<McpOperationContext>().IsActive\n+            ? provider.GetRequiredService<TImplementation>()\n+            : provider.GetRequiredKeyedService<TService>(HttpDefaultServiceKey));\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class McpServicesMarker;\n+}"},{"sha":"a91eb9d22ca24d7e2617ffdc9259bfc54df26917","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/DependencyInjection/RazorComponentMcpServerBuilderExtensions.cs","status":"added","additions":138,"deletions":0,"changes":138,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FDependencyInjection%2FRazorComponentMcpServerBuilderExtensions.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FDependencyInjection%2FRazorComponentMcpServerBuilderExtensions.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FDependencyInjection%2FRazorComponentMcpServerBuilderExtensions.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,138 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis;\n+using System.Linq;\n+using System.Text.Json.Nodes;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.DependencyInjection;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Protocol;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Hosting;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Options;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Protocol;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Server;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n+\n+/// <summary>\n+/// Provides methods for exposing Razor component applications through an MCP server.\n+/// </summary>\n+public static class RazorComponentMcpServerBuilderExtensions\n+{\n+    /// <summary>\n+    /// Adds a statically rendered Razor component application and its MCP Apps tools and resource.\n+    /// </summary>\n+    /// <typeparam name=\"TRootComponent\">The application root component.</typeparam>\n+    /// <param name=\"builder\">The MCP server builder.</param>\n+    /// <param name=\"configure\">Configures the application name, base URI, and initial location.</param>\n+    /// <returns>The supplied MCP server builder.</returns>\n+    /// <remarks>\n+    /// Register the MCP application after other component hosting services, including\n+    /// <c>AddInteractiveServerComponents</c>, so that each rendering scope selects its host's services.\n+    /// </remarks>\n+    /// <example>\n+    /// <code>\n+    /// builder.Services.AddMcpServer()\n+    ///     .WithRazorComponents&lt;App&gt;(options =&gt;\n+    ///     {\n+    ///         options.Name = \"sample\";\n+    ///         options.BaseUri = new Uri(\"https://example.com/\");\n+    ///     })\n+    ///     .WithHttpTransport();\n+    /// </code>\n+    /// </example>\n+    [RequiresUnreferencedCode(\"Razor component rendering and form mapping do not support trimming.\")]\n+    [RequiresDynamicCode(\"Razor component form mapping requires dynamic code.\")]\n+    public static IMcpServerBuilder WithRazorComponents<[DynamicallyAccessedMembers(DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.All)] TRootComponent>(\n+        this IMcpServerBuilder builder,\n+        Action<RazorComponentMcpOptions> configure) where TRootComponent : IComponent\n+        => AddApplication<TRootComponent>(builder, configure, openingToolName: null, initialParametersFactory: null);\n+\n+    /// <summary>\n+    /// Associates an existing MCP SDK tool with a statically rendered Razor component application.\n+    /// </summary>\n+    /// <typeparam name=\"TRootComponent\">The application root component.</typeparam>\n+    /// <param name=\"builder\">The MCP server builder.</param>\n+    /// <param name=\"openingToolName\">The name of a tool registered with the MCP SDK.</param>\n+    /// <param name=\"initialParametersFactory\">Projects a successful opening tool result into serializable root component parameters.</param>\n+    /// <param name=\"configure\">Configures the application and its browser runtime.</param>\n+    /// <returns>The supplied MCP server builder.</returns>\n+    /// <remarks>\n+    /// The SDK retains the tool's input schema, metadata, and invocation pipeline.\n+    /// The opening tool runs once; later form submissions reconstruct fresh parameter values\n+    /// without invoking it again. Error results do not invoke the parameter factory or render the application.\n+    /// </remarks>\n+    [RequiresUnreferencedCode(\"Razor component rendering and form mapping do not support trimming.\")]\n+    [RequiresDynamicCode(\"Razor component form mapping requires dynamic code.\")]\n+    public static IMcpServerBuilder WithRazorComponents<[DynamicallyAccessedMembers(DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.All)] TRootComponent>(\n+        this IMcpServerBuilder builder,\n+        string openingToolName,\n+        Func<CallToolResult, IReadOnlyDictionary<string, object?>> initialParametersFactory,\n+        Action<RazorComponentMcpOptions> configure) where TRootComponent : IComponent\n+    {\n+        ArgumentException.ThrowIfNullOrEmpty(openingToolName);\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(initialParametersFactory);\n+        return AddApplication<TRootComponent>(builder, configure, openingToolName, initialParametersFactory);\n+    }\n+\n+    private static IMcpServerBuilder AddApplication<[DynamicallyAccessedMembers(DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.All)] TRootComponent>(\n+        IMcpServerBuilder builder,\n+        Action<RazorComponentMcpOptions> configure,\n+        string? openingToolName,\n+        Func<CallToolResult, IReadOnlyDictionary<string, object?>>? initialParametersFactory) where TRootComponent : IComponent\n+    {\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(builder);\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(configure);\n+        var options = new RazorComponentMcpOptions { Name = openingToolName ?? \"blazor\" };\n+        configure(options);\n+        ArgumentException.ThrowIfNullOrEmpty(options.Name);\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(options.BaseUri);\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(options.InitialPath);\n+        if (!Enum.IsDefined(options.LogLevel))\n+        {\n+            throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException(nameof(configure), \"The MCP browser log level is invalid.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        if (!options.BaseUri.IsAbsoluteUri || !options.BaseUri.AbsoluteUri.EndsWith('/'))\n+        {\n+            throw new ArgumentException(\"The application base URI must be absolute and end with a slash.\", nameof(configure));\n+        }\n+\n+        var initialLocation = new Uri(options.BaseUri, options.InitialPath);\n+        if (!options.BaseUri.IsBaseOf(initialLocation))\n+        {\n+            throw new ArgumentException(\"The initial location must be within the application base URI.\", nameof(configure));\n+        }\n+\n+        var application = new McpComponentApplication(options.Name, typeof(TRootComponent), options.BaseUri, initialLocation,\n+            preserveDom: options.PreserveDom, logLevel: options.LogLevel, openingToolName, initialParametersFactory);\n+        if (builder.Services.Any(descriptor => descriptor.ImplementationInstance is McpComponentApplication other\n+            && (other.Name == application.Name || other.OpeningToolName == application.OpeningToolName)))\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException($\"A component application is already registered with the application or opening tool name '{application.Name}'.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        builder.Services.AddMcpComponentServices();\n+        builder.Services.AddSingleton(application);\n+        builder.Services.AddKeyedScoped<McpComponentInvoker>(application, (services, _) => new McpComponentInvoker(\n+            application, services.GetRequiredService<McpComponentHost>(), services.GetRequiredService<IServiceScopeFactory>()));\n+        if (openingToolName is null)\n+        {\n+            builder.Services.AddSingleton<McpServerTool>(services => new McpComponentTool(application, services.GetRequiredService<IServiceScopeFactory>(), dispatch: false));\n+        }\n+\n+        builder.Services.AddSingleton<McpServerTool>(services => new McpComponentTool(application, services.GetRequiredService<IServiceScopeFactory>(), dispatch: true));\n+        builder.Services.AddSingleton<McpServerResource>(services => new McpComponentResource(application, services.GetRequiredService<IServiceScopeFactory>()));\n+        builder.Services.AddSingleton<IPostConfigureOptions<McpServerOptions>>(services => new McpComponentOptionsSetup(\n+            application, services.GetServices<McpServerTool>(), services.GetServices<McpServerResource>(),\n+            services.GetRequiredService<IServiceScopeFactory>()));\n+        builder.Services.Configure<McpServerOptions>(serverOptions =>\n+        {\n+            serverOptions.Capabilities ??= new();\n+            serverOptions.Capabilities.Extensions ??= new Dictionary<string, object>();\n+            serverOptions.Capabilities.Extensions.TryAdd(\"io.modelcontextprotocol/ui\", new JsonObject());\n+        });\n+        return builder;\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"3d907d1eec77683b71bc66757d262e6716b35413","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/FormMapping/McpFormDataProvider.cs","status":"added","additions":37,"deletions":0,"changes":37,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FFormMapping%2FMcpFormDataProvider.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FFormMapping%2FMcpFormDataProvider.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FFormMapping%2FMcpFormDataProvider.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,37 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Collections.ObjectModel;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.FormMapping;\n+\n+internal sealed class McpFormDataProvider\n+{\n+    public string? HandlerName { get; private set; }\n+\n+    public IReadOnlyDictionary<string, StringValues> Entries { get; private set; }\n+        = ReadOnlyDictionary<string, StringValues>.Empty;\n+\n+    public IFormFileCollection Files { get; private set; } = new FormFileCollection();\n+\n+    public void Initialize(\n+        string handlerName,\n+        IReadOnlyDictionary<string, StringValues> entries,\n+        IFormFileCollection files)\n+    {\n+        ArgumentException.ThrowIfNullOrEmpty(handlerName);\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(entries);\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(files);\n+\n+        if (HandlerName is not null)\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException(\"Form data has already been initialized for this rendering operation.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        HandlerName = handlerName;\n+        Entries = entries;\n+        Files = files;\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"194d73701c92e896e234da30ab9372d5798f4f29","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/FormMapping/McpFormValueMapper.cs","status":"added","additions":119,"deletions":0,"changes":119,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FFormMapping%2FMcpFormValueMapper.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FFormMapping%2FMcpFormValueMapper.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FFormMapping%2FMcpFormValueMapper.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,119 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Buffers;\n+using System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis;\n+using System.Globalization;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Endpoints.FormMapping;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Forms.Mapping;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.FormMapping;\n+\n+internal sealed class McpFormValueMapper(McpFormDataProvider formData, FormDataMapperOptions options) : IFormValueMapper\n+{\n+    private readonly Dictionary<Type, FormValueSupplier> _suppliers = new();\n+\n+    public bool CanMap(Type valueType, string scopeName, string? formName)\n+    {\n+        if (formData.HandlerName is not { } handlerName\n+            || !MatchesScope(handlerName, scopeName, out var incomingFormName))\n+        {\n+            return false;\n+        }\n+\n+        if (formName is not null && !incomingFormName.Equals(formName, StringComparison.Ordinal))\n+        {\n+            return false;\n+        }\n+\n+        return options.ResolveConverter(valueType) is not null;\n+    }\n+\n+    public void Map(FormValueMappingContext context)\n+    {\n+        if (!CanMap(context.ValueType, context.AcceptMappingScopeName, context.AcceptFormName))\n+        {\n+            context.SetResult(null);\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        if (!_suppliers.TryGetValue(context.ValueType, out var supplier))\n+        {\n+            supplier = (FormValueSupplier)Activator.CreateInstance(\n+                typeof(FormValueSupplier<>).MakeGenericType(context.ValueType))!;\n+            _suppliers.Add(context.ValueType, supplier);\n+        }\n+\n+        supplier.Deserialize(context, options, formData);\n+    }\n+\n+    private static bool MatchesScope(string handlerName, string scopeName, out ReadOnlySpan<char> formName)\n+    {\n+        if (handlerName.StartsWith('['))\n+        {\n+            var handlerSpan = handlerName.AsSpan();\n+            if (handlerSpan[1..].StartsWith(scopeName, StringComparison.Ordinal)\n+                && handlerName.Length >= scopeName.Length + 2\n+                && handlerName[scopeName.Length + 1] == ']')\n+            {\n+                formName = handlerSpan[(scopeName.Length + 2)..];\n+                return true;\n+            }\n+        }\n+        else if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(scopeName))\n+        {\n+            formName = handlerName;\n+            return true;\n+        }\n+\n+        formName = default;\n+        return false;\n+    }\n+\n+    private abstract class FormValueSupplier\n+    {\n+        [RequiresDynamicCode(FormMappingHelpers.RequiresDynamicCodeMessage)]\n+        [RequiresUnreferencedCode(FormMappingHelpers.RequiresUnreferencedCodeMessage)]\n+        public abstract void Deserialize(FormValueMappingContext context, FormDataMapperOptions options, McpFormDataProvider formData);\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class FormValueSupplier<T> : FormValueSupplier\n+    {\n+        [RequiresDynamicCode(FormMappingHelpers.RequiresDynamicCodeMessage)]\n+        [RequiresUnreferencedCode(FormMappingHelpers.RequiresUnreferencedCodeMessage)]\n+        public override void Deserialize(FormValueMappingContext context, FormDataMapperOptions options, McpFormDataProvider formData)\n+        {\n+            if (formData.Entries.Count == 0)\n+            {\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            var dictionary = new Dictionary<FormKey, Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives.StringValues>();\n+            foreach (var (key, value) in formData.Entries)\n+            {\n+                dictionary.Add(new FormKey(key.AsMemory()), value);\n+            }\n+\n+            var buffer = ArrayPool<char>.Shared.Rent(options.MaxKeyBufferSize);\n+            try\n+            {\n+                using var reader = new FormDataReader(\n+                    dictionary, CultureInfo.InvariantCulture, buffer.AsMemory(0, options.MaxKeyBufferSize), formData.Files)\n+                {\n+                    ErrorHandler = context.OnError,\n+                    AttachInstanceToErrorsHandler = context.MapErrorToContainer,\n+                    MaxRecursionDepth = options.MaxRecursionDepth,\n+                    MaxErrorCount = options.MaxErrorCount,\n+                    MaxCollectionSize = options.MaxCollectionSize\n+                };\n+\n+                reader.PushPrefix(context.ParameterName);\n+                context.SetResult(FormDataMapper.Map<T>(reader, options));\n+            }\n+            finally\n+            {\n+                ArrayPool<char>.Shared.Return(buffer);\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"3b405ac5f63f12628cfa91972230394d702ca229","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Hosting/McpAuthenticationStateProvider.cs","status":"added","additions":12,"deletions":0,"changes":12,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpAuthenticationStateProvider.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpAuthenticationStateProvider.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpAuthenticationStateProvider.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Authorization;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Hosting;\n+\n+internal sealed class McpAuthenticationStateProvider(McpOperationContext context) : AuthenticationStateProvider\n+{\n+    public override Task<AuthenticationState> GetAuthenticationStateAsync()\n+        => Task.FromResult(new AuthenticationState(context.Request.User));\n+}"},{"sha":"03fca1acf8931fb961629bfb453d8ce25a0261f2","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Hosting/McpComponentHost.cs","status":"added","additions":90,"deletions":0,"changes":90,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpComponentHost.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpComponentHost.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpComponentHost.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,90 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.FormMapping;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Rendering;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Logging;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Protocol;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Hosting;\n+\n+internal sealed class McpComponentHost\n+{\n+    private readonly IServiceProvider _services;\n+\n+    public McpComponentHost(IServiceProvider services)\n+    {\n+        _services = services;\n+    }\n+\n+    public Task<McpRenderResult> RenderAsync(\n+        McpComponentApplication application,\n+        McpComponentRequest request,\n+        CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n+        => RenderAsync(application, request, McpComponentParameters.Empty, cancellationToken);\n+\n+    public async Task<McpRenderResult> RenderAsync(\n+        McpComponentApplication application,\n+        McpComponentRequest request,\n+        McpComponentParameters parameters,\n+        CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n+    {\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(request);\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(request.User);\n+        if (!request.Location.IsAbsoluteUri || !application.BaseUri.IsBaseOf(request.Location))\n+        {\n+            throw new ArgumentException(\"The component location must be within the registered application base URI.\", nameof(request));\n+        }\n+\n+        cancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n+        var services = _services;\n+        var context = services.GetRequiredService<McpOperationContext>();\n+        context.Initialize(request, application.BaseUri, cancellationToken);\n+        if (request.HandlerName is { } handler)\n+        {\n+            services.GetRequiredService<McpFormDataProvider>().Initialize(\n+                handler,\n+                request.Form ?? new Dictionary<string, StringValues>(),\n+                request.Files ?? new FormFileCollection());\n+        }\n+\n+        await using var renderer = new McpHtmlRenderer(services, services.GetRequiredService<ILoggerFactory>());\n+        if (services.GetRequiredService<NavigationManager>() is not McpNavigationManager)\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException(\"The MCP component navigation service was replaced. Register WithRazorComponents after other component hosting services, including AddInteractiveServerComponents.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        try\n+        {\n+            return await renderer.Dispatcher.InvokeAsync(async () =>\n+            {\n+                var root = renderer.BeginRenderingComponent(application.ComponentType, ParameterView.FromDictionary(parameters.Restore()));\n+                await root.QuiescenceTask;\n+                cancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n+                if (context.Redirect is null && request.HandlerName is { } handlerName)\n+                {\n+                    await renderer.DispatchSubmitAsync(handlerName);\n+                    cancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n+                }\n+\n+                return context.Redirect is { } redirect\n+                    ? McpRenderResult.ForRedirect(redirect, context.ReplaceHistory)\n+                    : McpRenderResult.ForDocument(root.ToHtmlString());\n+            });\n+        }\n+        catch (NavigationException exception)\n+        {\n+            cancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n+            return McpRenderResult.ForRedirect(new Uri(exception.Location), context.ReplaceHistory);\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+internal sealed record McpRenderResult(string? Html, Uri? Redirect, bool ReplaceHistory)\n+{\n+    public static McpRenderResult ForDocument(string html) => new(html, null, false);\n+    public static McpRenderResult ForRedirect(Uri location, bool replaceHistory) => new(null, location, replaceHistory);\n+}"},{"sha":"78883ae5249f15a59be9ffff08e354ec61c30077","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Hosting/McpComponentRequest.cs","status":"added","additions":42,"deletions":0,"changes":42,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpComponentRequest.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpComponentRequest.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpComponentRequest.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,42 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Security.Claims;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Hosting;\n+\n+internal sealed record McpComponentRequest(\n+    Uri Location,\n+    ClaimsPrincipal User,\n+    string? HandlerName = null,\n+    IReadOnlyDictionary<string, StringValues>? Form = null,\n+    IFormFileCollection? Files = null,\n+    bool IsShellRendering = false);\n+\n+internal sealed class McpOperationContext\n+{\n+    private McpComponentRequest? _request;\n+\n+    public bool IsActive => _request is not null;\n+    public bool IsShellRendering { get; private set; }\n+    public McpComponentRequest Request => _request ?? throw new InvalidOperationException(\"No MCP component rendering operation is active in this scope.\");\n+    public Uri BaseUri { get; private set; } = default!;\n+    public CancellationToken CancellationToken { get; private set; }\n+    public Uri? Redirect { get; set; }\n+    public bool ReplaceHistory { get; set; }\n+\n+    public void Initialize(McpComponentRequest request, Uri baseUri, CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n+    {\n+        if (IsActive)\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException(\"The rendering operation has already been initialized.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        _request = request;\n+        IsShellRendering = request.IsShellRendering;\n+        BaseUri = baseUri;\n+        CancellationToken = cancellationToken;\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"b43b4b1ec37ebf7c117c95f0db0ed8ba57067d9e","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Hosting/McpComponentRequestContext.cs","status":"added","additions":53,"deletions":0,"changes":53,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpComponentRequestContext.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpComponentRequestContext.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpComponentRequestContext.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,53 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Security.Claims;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp;\n+\n+/// <summary>\n+/// Describes the current logical MCP component rendering operation.\n+/// </summary>\n+public sealed class McpComponentRequestContext\n+{\n+    private readonly Hosting.McpOperationContext _context;\n+\n+    internal McpComponentRequestContext(Hosting.McpOperationContext context) => _context = context;\n+\n+    /// <summary>\n+    /// Gets whether the current scope belongs to an MCP component operation.\n+    /// </summary>\n+    public bool IsActive => _context.IsActive;\n+\n+    /// <summary>\n+    /// Gets whether the application is rendering its resource document shell before tool data is available.\n+    /// </summary>\n+    /// <remarks>\n+    /// The phase is fixed for the operation scope. Defer data-dependent content in this phase,\n+    /// and declare the document's runtime script outside the conditional content.\n+    /// </remarks>\n+    public bool IsShellRendering => _context.IsShellRendering;\n+\n+    /// <summary>\n+    /// Gets the logical application location being rendered.\n+    /// </summary>\n+    public Uri Location => GetCurrent().Request.Location;\n+\n+    /// <summary>\n+    /// Gets the registered application base URI.\n+    /// </summary>\n+    public Uri BaseUri => GetCurrent().BaseUri;\n+\n+    /// <summary>\n+    /// Gets the principal supplied by the current MCP request.\n+    /// </summary>\n+    public ClaimsPrincipal User => GetCurrent().Request.User;\n+\n+    /// <summary>\n+    /// Gets the token that requests cooperative cancellation of the operation.\n+    /// </summary>\n+    public CancellationToken CancellationToken => GetCurrent().CancellationToken;\n+\n+    private Hosting.McpOperationContext GetCurrent()\n+        => _context.IsActive ? _context : throw new InvalidOperationException(\"The current scope does not contain an MCP component operation.\");\n+}"},{"sha":"c664f1a9e17f5f0f1b7dfaf6523e76ec9a9f7705","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Hosting/McpNavigationManager.cs","status":"added","additions":27,"deletions":0,"changes":27,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpNavigationManager.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpNavigationManager.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FMcpNavigationManager.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Hosting;\n+\n+internal sealed class McpNavigationManager : NavigationManager\n+{\n+    private readonly McpOperationContext _context;\n+\n+    public McpNavigationManager(McpOperationContext context)\n+    {\n+        _context = context;\n+        Initialize(context.BaseUri.AbsoluteUri, context.Request.Location.AbsoluteUri);\n+    }\n+\n+    protected override void NavigateToCore(string uri, NavigationOptions options)\n+    {\n+        var target = ToAbsoluteUri(uri);\n+        _context.Redirect = target;\n+        _context.ReplaceHistory = options.ReplaceHistoryEntry;\n+        if (!AppContext.TryGetSwitch(\"Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Endpoints.NavigationManager.DisableThrowNavigationException\", out var disableThrow)\n+            || !disableThrow)\n+        {\n+            throw new NavigationException(target.AbsoluteUri);\n+        }\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"4f3f01f4d17cda89de30d21324a2aefc9f282e22","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Hosting/RazorComponentMcpOptions.cs","status":"added","additions":50,"deletions":0,"changes":50,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FRazorComponentMcpOptions.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FRazorComponentMcpOptions.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FHosting%2FRazorComponentMcpOptions.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,50 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Logging;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp;\n+\n+/// <summary>\n+/// Configures a statically rendered Razor component application exposed through MCP Apps.\n+/// </summary>\n+public sealed class RazorComponentMcpOptions\n+{\n+    /// <summary>\n+    /// Gets or sets the application name. For a generated opening tool, this is also its name.\n+    /// The default is <c>blazor</c>, or the associated existing tool's name.\n+    /// </summary>\n+    public string Name { get; set; } = \"blazor\";\n+\n+    /// <summary>\n+    /// Gets or sets the absolute base URI of the component application.\n+    /// </summary>\n+    /// <remarks>\n+    /// The URI must end with a slash. Component routing and relative asset URLs use this\n+    /// application URI rather than the MCP transport endpoint or the containing iframe.\n+    /// </remarks>\n+    public Uri BaseUri { get; set; } = default!;\n+\n+    /// <summary>\n+    /// Gets or sets the initial path, relative to <see cref=\"BaseUri\"/>.\n+    /// The default is the application base URI.\n+    /// </summary>\n+    public string InitialPath { get; set; } = \"\";\n+\n+    /// <summary>\n+    /// Gets or sets whether rendered body updates preserve matching DOM elements.\n+    /// The default is <see langword=\"true\"/>.\n+    /// </summary>\n+    /// <remarks>\n+    /// This configures the MCP browser runtime. <see cref=\"ConfigureBrowser\"/> does not\n+    /// configure an MCP application because it requires a page HTTP context.\n+    /// The document head is synchronized in either mode so the application base URI remains active.\n+    /// </remarks>\n+    public bool PreserveDom { get; set; } = true;\n+\n+    /// <summary>\n+    /// Gets or sets the minimum level of messages emitted by the MCP browser runtime.\n+    /// The default is <see cref=\"Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.LogLevel.Information\"/>.\n+    /// </summary>\n+    public LogLevel LogLevel { get; set; } = LogLevel.Information;\n+}"},{"sha":"178135c2b27855a27d4109630473696c869f5ed7","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/JS/.gitignore","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2F.gitignore","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2F.gitignore","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2F.gitignore?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+/dist/"},{"sha":"b866bedcd61bc94d616730a66a99c09dbd45a196","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/JS/Boot.Mcp.ts","status":"added","additions":405,"deletions":0,"changes":405,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2FBoot.Mcp.ts","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2FBoot.Mcp.ts","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2FBoot.Mcp.ts?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,405 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+import { App, applyHostStyleVariables } from '@modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps';\n+import { synchronizeAttributes } from '../../../Web.JS/src/Rendering/DomMerging/AttributeSync';\n+import { synchronizeDomContent } from '../../../Web.JS/src/Rendering/DomMerging/DomSync';\n+\n+interface DocumentResult {\n+  viewId: string;\n+  location: string;\n+  baseUri: string;\n+  dispatchTool: string;\n+  document: string;\n+  redirected: boolean;\n+  replaceHistory: boolean;\n+  preserveDom: boolean;\n+  logLevel: number;\n+}\n+\n+interface FormFile {\n+  name: string;\n+  fileName: string;\n+  contentType: string;\n+  lastModified: number;\n+  data: string;\n+}\n+\n+const runtimeScript = getRuntimeScript();\n+\n+function getRuntimeScript(): HTMLScriptElement {\n+  const script = document.currentScript;\n+  if (!(script instanceof HTMLScriptElement)) {\n+    throw new Error('The MCP runtime must be loaded by an authored document script.');\n+  }\n+\n+  return script;\n+}\n+\n+const app = new App({ name: 'Blazor MCP', version: '1.0.0' }, {}, { strict: true, autoResize: true });\n+let current: DocumentResult | undefined;\n+let generation = 0;\n+let closing = false;\n+let connected = false;\n+let initialResult: unknown;\n+const pendingOperations = new Set<Promise<void>>();\n+const lifetime = new AbortController();\n+let minimumLogLevel = readInitialLogLevel();\n+\n+function readInitialLogLevel(): number {\n+  const configured = document.currentScript?.getAttribute('data-blazor-log-level');\n+  if (configured === undefined || configured === null) {\n+    return 2;\n+  }\n+\n+  const level = Number(configured);\n+  if (!Number.isInteger(level) || level < 0 || level > 6) {\n+    throw new Error('The MCP browser log level is invalid.');\n+  }\n+\n+  return level;\n+}\n+\n+function isObject(value: unknown): value is Record<string, unknown> {\n+  return value !== null && typeof value === 'object';\n+}\n+\n+function readDocument(result: unknown): DocumentResult {\n+  if (!isObject(result)) {\n+    throw new Error('The component tool returned an invalid result.');\n+  }\n+\n+  if (result.isError) {\n+    const messages = Array.isArray(result.content)\n+      ? result.content.filter(isObject).filter(item => item.type === 'text').map(item => item.text)\n+      : [];\n+    throw new Error(messages.join('\\n') || 'The component tool failed.');\n+  }\n+\n+  const document = isObject(result._meta) ? result._meta.blazor : undefined;\n+  if (!isObject(document)\n+    || typeof document.viewId !== 'string'\n+    || typeof document.location !== 'string'\n+    || typeof document.baseUri !== 'string'\n+    || typeof document.dispatchTool !== 'string'\n+    || typeof document.document !== 'string'\n+    || typeof document.redirected !== 'boolean'\n+    || typeof document.replaceHistory !== 'boolean') {\n+    throw new Error('The component tool returned an invalid document.');\n+  }\n+\n+  const browserOptions = document.browserOptions;\n+  if (!isObject(browserOptions)\n+    || typeof browserOptions.preserveDom !== 'boolean'\n+    || typeof browserOptions.logLevel !== 'number'\n+    || !Number.isInteger(browserOptions.logLevel)\n+    || browserOptions.logLevel < 0 || browserOptions.logLevel > 6) {\n+    throw new Error('The component tool returned invalid browser options.');\n+  }\n+\n+  return {\n+    viewId: document.viewId,\n+    location: document.location,\n+    baseUri: document.baseUri,\n+    dispatchTool: document.dispatchTool,\n+    document: document.document,\n+    redirected: document.redirected,\n+    replaceHistory: document.replaceHistory,\n+    preserveDom: browserOptions.preserveDom,\n+    logLevel: browserOptions.logLevel,\n+  };\n+}\n+\n+function showError(error: unknown): void {\n+  if (minimumLogLevel <= 4) {\n+    console.error(error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error));\n+  }\n+  let element = document.getElementById('blazor-mcp-error');\n+  if (!element) {\n+    element = document.createElement('div');\n+    element.id = 'blazor-mcp-error';\n+    element.setAttribute('role', 'alert');\n+    document.body.append(element);\n+  }\n+\n+  element.textContent = error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error);\n+}\n+\n+function updateBusyState(): void {\n+  document.documentElement.setAttribute('aria-busy', pendingOperations.size === 0 ? 'false' : 'true');\n+}\n+\n+function trackOperation(operation: Promise<void>, requestGeneration = generation): void {\n+  const observed: Promise<void> = operation.catch(error => {\n+    if (!closing && requestGeneration === generation) {\n+      showError(error);\n+    } else if (minimumLogLevel <= 1) {\n+      console.debug('Discarding completion from a superseded or closed component operation.', error);\n+    }\n+  }).finally(() => {\n+    pendingOperations.delete(observed);\n+    updateBusyState();\n+  });\n+  pendingOperations.add(observed);\n+  updateBusyState();\n+}\n+\n+function applyContext(context: ReturnType<App['getHostContext']>): void {\n+  if (context?.theme) {\n+    document.documentElement.style.colorScheme = context.theme;\n+  }\n+\n+  if (context?.styles?.variables) {\n+    applyHostStyleVariables(context.styles.variables);\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function isInternal(url: URL, base: URL): boolean {\n+  return url.origin === base.origin && url.pathname.startsWith(base.pathname);\n+}\n+\n+function applyDocument(result: unknown, replaceHistory = false, fromPost = false): void {\n+  const next = readDocument(result);\n+  minimumLogLevel = next.logLevel;\n+  if (current && next.viewId !== current.viewId) {\n+    throw new Error('A different component view cannot replace this view.');\n+  }\n+\n+  const location = new URL(next.location);\n+  const base = new URL(next.baseUri);\n+  if (!base.pathname.endsWith('/') || !isInternal(location, base)) {\n+    throw new Error('The component location is outside its registered application.');\n+  }\n+\n+  const incoming = new DOMParser().parseFromString(next.document, 'text/html');\n+  let baseElement = incoming.querySelector('base');\n+  if (!baseElement) {\n+    baseElement = incoming.createElement('base');\n+    incoming.head.prepend(baseElement);\n+  }\n+\n+  const assetBase = new URL(baseElement.getAttribute('href') ?? next.location, location);\n+  baseElement.href = assetBase.href;\n+  for (const script of incoming.querySelectorAll<HTMLScriptElement>('script[src]')) {\n+    const source = new URL(script.getAttribute('src')!, assetBase);\n+    if (source.pathname.endsWith('/blazor.mcp.js')) {\n+      script.replaceWith(runtimeScript.cloneNode(true));\n+    } else if (/\\/_framework\\/blazor\\.(web|server|webassembly)\\.js$/.test(source.pathname)) {\n+      script.remove();\n+    }\n+  }\n+\n+  const previousLocation = current?.location;\n+  if (next.preserveDom) {\n+    synchronizeDomContent(document, incoming);\n+  } else {\n+    synchronizeAttributes(document.documentElement, incoming.documentElement);\n+    synchronizeAttributes(document.head, incoming.head);\n+    synchronizeDomContent(document.head, incoming.head);\n+    document.body.replaceWith(document.importNode(incoming.body, true));\n+  }\n+\n+  current = next;\n+  updateBusyState();\n+  applyContext(app.getHostContext());\n+  if (replaceHistory || next.replaceHistory || history.state?.blazorMcp === undefined\n+    || (fromPost && (!next.redirected || previousLocation === next.location))) {\n+    history.replaceState({ blazorMcp: next.location }, '');\n+  } else {\n+    history.pushState({ blazorMcp: next.location }, '');\n+  }\n+\n+}\n+\n+async function dispatch(location: URL, method: 'GET' | 'POST', fields?: Record<string, string[]>, files?: FormFile[], replaceHistory = false, enctype?: string, requestGeneration = ++generation): Promise<void> {\n+  if (closing || !current) {\n+    throw new Error('The component view is not available.');\n+  }\n+\n+  if (requestGeneration !== generation) {\n+    return;\n+  }\n+\n+  const snapshot = current;\n+  try {\n+    const result = await app.callServerTool({\n+      name: snapshot.dispatchTool,\n+      arguments: {\n+        viewId: snapshot.viewId,\n+        location: location.href,\n+        method,\n+        fields,\n+        files,\n+        enctype,\n+      },\n+    }, { signal: lifetime.signal });\n+    if (!closing && generation === requestGeneration) {\n+      applyDocument(result, replaceHistory, method === 'POST');\n+    }\n+  } catch (error) {\n+    if (!closing && generation === requestGeneration) {\n+      throw error;\n+    }\n+\n+    if (minimumLogLevel <= 1) {\n+      console.debug('Discarding completion from a superseded or closed component operation.', error);\n+    }\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function getFormMethod(form: HTMLFormElement, submitter: HTMLElement | null): string {\n+  const control = submitter instanceof HTMLButtonElement || submitter instanceof HTMLInputElement ? submitter : undefined;\n+  return (control?.hasAttribute('formmethod') ? control.formMethod : form.method).toUpperCase();\n+}\n+\n+async function submit(form: HTMLFormElement, submitter: HTMLElement | null): Promise<void> {\n+  if (!current) {\n+    throw new Error('The component view has not received its initial document.');\n+  }\n+\n+  const requestGeneration = ++generation;\n+  const target = submitter?.getAttribute('formtarget') ?? form.getAttribute('target');\n+  if (target && target.toLowerCase() !== '_self') {\n+    throw new Error(`The component form target '${target}' is not supported by this host.`);\n+  }\n+\n+  const method = getFormMethod(form, submitter);\n+  if (method !== 'GET' && method !== 'POST') {\n+    throw new Error(`The component form method '${method}' is not supported.`);\n+  }\n+\n+  const action = submitter?.getAttribute('formaction') ?? form.getAttribute('action') ?? current.location;\n+  const location = action ? new URL(action, document.baseURI) : new URL(current.location);\n+  if (!isInternal(location, new URL(current.baseUri))) {\n+    throw new Error('The component form action is outside its registered application.');\n+  }\n+\n+  const data = new FormData(form, submitter);\n+  const control = submitter instanceof HTMLButtonElement || submitter instanceof HTMLInputElement ? submitter : undefined;\n+  const enctype = control?.hasAttribute('formenctype') ? control.formEnctype : form.enctype;\n+  if (method === 'POST' && enctype !== 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' && enctype !== 'multipart/form-data') {\n+    throw new Error(`The component form encoding '${enctype}' is not supported.`);\n+  }\n+\n+  const fields: Record<string, string[]> = Object.create(null);\n+  const files: FormFile[] = [];\n+  const query = new URLSearchParams();\n+  let totalFileBytes = 0;\n+  for (const [name, value] of data) {\n+    if (method === 'GET') {\n+      query.append(name, typeof value === 'string' ? value : value.name);\n+    } else if (typeof value === 'string' || enctype === 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded') {\n+      (fields[name] ??= []).push(typeof value === 'string' ? value : value.name);\n+    } else {\n+      if (value.name === '' && value.size === 0) {\n+        (fields[name] ??= []).push('');\n+        continue;\n+      }\n+\n+      totalFileBytes += value.size;\n+      if (totalFileBytes > 32 * 1024 * 1024) {\n+        throw new Error('Submitted files exceed the 32 MiB submission limit.');\n+      }\n+\n+      const bytes = new Uint8Array(await value.arrayBuffer());\n+      let binary = '';\n+      for (let offset = 0; offset < bytes.length; offset += 16384) {\n+        binary += String.fromCharCode(...bytes.subarray(offset, offset + 16384));\n+      }\n+\n+      files.push({ name, fileName: value.name, contentType: value.type, lastModified: value.lastModified, data: btoa(binary) });\n+    }\n+  }\n+\n+  if (method === 'GET') {\n+    location.search = query.toString();\n+    await dispatch(location, 'GET', undefined, undefined, false, undefined, requestGeneration);\n+  } else {\n+    if (fields._handler?.length !== 1) {\n+      throw new Error('A component POST must identify exactly one named form handler.');\n+    }\n+\n+    await dispatch(location, 'POST', fields, files, false, enctype, requestGeneration);\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+document.addEventListener('submit', event => {\n+  if (event.defaultPrevented || !(event.target instanceof HTMLFormElement)) {\n+    return;\n+  }\n+\n+  const form = event.target;\n+  const submitter = event.submitter;\n+  if (getFormMethod(form, submitter) === 'DIALOG') {\n+    return;\n+  }\n+\n+  event.preventDefault();\n+  trackOperation(submit(form, submitter));\n+}, { signal: lifetime.signal });\n+\n+document.addEventListener('click', event => {\n+  const link = event.target instanceof Element ? event.target.closest<HTMLAnchorElement>('a[href]') : null;\n+  if (!link || !current || event.defaultPrevented || event.button !== 0) {\n+    return;\n+  }\n+\n+  const location = new URL(link.href);\n+  const modified = event.ctrlKey || event.metaKey || event.altKey || event.shiftKey;\n+  event.preventDefault();\n+  if (link.hasAttribute('download')) {\n+    showError(new Error('The current component host has not enabled host-mediated downloads.'));\n+  } else if (modified || (link.target && link.target !== '_self') || !isInternal(location, new URL(current.baseUri))) {\n+    void app.openLink({ url: location.href }).catch(showError);\n+  } else {\n+    trackOperation(dispatch(location, 'GET'));\n+  }\n+}, { signal: lifetime.signal });\n+\n+window.addEventListener('popstate', event => {\n+  if (typeof event.state?.blazorMcp === 'string') {\n+    trackOperation(dispatch(new URL(event.state.blazorMcp), 'GET', undefined, undefined, true));\n+  }\n+}, { signal: lifetime.signal });\n+\n+app.ontoolresult = result => {\n+  if (!connected) {\n+    initialResult = result;\n+  } else if (!closing && generation === 0) {\n+    try {\n+      applyDocument(result, true);\n+    } catch (error) {\n+      showError(error);\n+    }\n+  }\n+};\n+app.ontoolcancelled = parameters => showError(new Error(parameters.reason || 'The component operation was canceled.'));\n+app.onhostcontextchanged = applyContext;\n+app.onteardown = async () => {\n+  closing = true;\n+  lifetime.abort();\n+  await Promise.all(pendingOperations);\n+  if (current) {\n+    const result = await app.callServerTool({\n+      name: current.dispatchTool,\n+      arguments: { viewId: current.viewId, method: 'CLOSE' },\n+    });\n+    if (result.isError) {\n+      throw new Error('The component view could not be closed.');\n+    }\n+  }\n+\n+  return {};\n+};\n+\n+async function start(): Promise<void> {\n+  await app.connect();\n+  connected = true;\n+  applyContext(app.getHostContext());\n+  if (initialResult !== undefined) {\n+    applyDocument(initialResult, true);\n+    initialResult = undefined;\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+void start().catch(showError);"},{"sha":"7ec5ca3001f628a58e742a51696d8d1c4b1b9642","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/JS/package.json","status":"added","additions":17,"deletions":0,"changes":17,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2Fpackage.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2Fpackage.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2Fpackage.json?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@\n+{\n+  \"private\": true,\n+  \"name\": \"@microsoft/aspnetcore-components-mcp\",\n+  \"scripts\": {\n+    \"clean\": \"rimraf ./dist/Debug ./dist/Release\",\n+    \"prebuild\": \"npm run clean\",\n+    \"build\": \"npm run build:debug && npm run build:production\",\n+    \"build:debug\": \"rollup -c --environment development --forceExit\",\n+    \"build:production\": \"rollup -c --environment production --forceExit\"\n+  },\n+  \"dependencies\": {\n+    \"@modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps\": \"2.0.3\",\n+    \"@modelcontextprotocol/client\": \"2.3.1\",\n+    \"@modelcontextprotocol/core\": \"2.3.1\",\n+    \"zod\": \"4.6.5\"\n+  }\n+}"},{"sha":"9a60003c1139bf16904049c760ca6c86b5545ebd","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/JS/rollup.config.mjs","status":"added","additions":15,"deletions":0,"changes":15,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2Frollup.config.mjs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2Frollup.config.mjs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2Frollup.config.mjs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@\n+import path from 'path';\n+import { fileURLToPath } from 'url';\n+import createBaseConfig from '../../../Shared.JS/rollup.config.mjs';\n+\n+const directory = path.dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url));\n+\n+export default createBaseConfig({\n+  inputOutputMap: {\n+    'blazor.mcp': './Boot.Mcp.ts',\n+  },\n+  dir: directory,\n+  updateConfig: (config) => {\n+    config.output.sourcemap = true;\n+  },\n+});"},{"sha":"5474aed11b931551d37477f668ab4c70b7bf5dc1","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/JS/tsconfig.json","status":"added","additions":10,"deletions":0,"changes":10,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2Ftsconfig.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2Ftsconfig.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FJS%2Ftsconfig.json?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@\n+{\n+  \"extends\": \"../../../Web.JS/tsconfig.json\",\n+  \"compilerOptions\": {\n+    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n+    \"rootDir\": \"../../..\",\n+    \"lib\": [ \"DOM\", \"DOM.Iterable\", \"ES2024\" ],\n+    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n+    \"noEmitOnError\": true\n+  }\n+}"},{"sha":"7999adb56c2d1ccdb62a9de73e660bd0c1ce5024","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.csproj","status":"added","additions":55,"deletions":0,"changes":55,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FMicrosoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.csproj","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FMicrosoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.csproj","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FMicrosoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.csproj?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,55 @@\n+<Project Sdk=\"Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Razor\">\n+  <PropertyGroup>\n+    <TargetFramework>$(DefaultNetCoreTargetFramework)</TargetFramework>\n+    <Description>Static server-side rendering of Razor components over MCP Apps.</Description>\n+    <IsShippingPackage>true</IsShippingPackage>\n+    <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>\n+    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>\n+    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>\n+    <StaticWebAssetBasePath>/</StaticWebAssetBasePath>\n+    <PackageThirdPartyNoticesFile>$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)..\\THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt</PackageThirdPartyNoticesFile>\n+    <!-- Preserve the resource identity of the shared Components form-mapping implementation. -->\n+    <RootNamespace>Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Endpoints</RootNamespace>\n+  </PropertyGroup>\n+\n+  <ItemGroup>\n+    <PackageVersion Update=\"Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Abstractions\" Version=\"10.8.3\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Components\\Authorization\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Authorization.csproj\" PrivateAssets=\"all\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Components\\Endpoints\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Endpoints.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Components\\Web\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web.csproj\" PrivateAssets=\"all\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Http\\Http.Features\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.Features.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Http\\Http\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Http\\WebUtilities\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.WebUtilities.csproj\" PrivateAssets=\"all\" />\n+    <PackageReference Include=\"ModelContextProtocol\" />\n+  </ItemGroup>\n+\n+  <PropertyGroup>\n+    <InteropWorkingDir>$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)JS\\</InteropWorkingDir>\n+  </PropertyGroup>\n+\n+  <Target Name=\"IncludeMcpBrowserRuntime\" BeforeTargets=\"ResolveProjectStaticWebAssets\" Condition=\"'$(NoBuild)' != 'true'\">\n+    <Error Condition=\"'$(DesignTimeBuild)' != 'true' and !Exists('$(InteropWorkingDir)dist\\$(Configuration)\\blazor.mcp.js')\"\n+           Text=\"The blazor.mcp.js browser runtime is missing. Run npm run build --workspace @microsoft/aspnetcore-components-mcp.\" />\n+    <ItemGroup>\n+      <_McpJsOutput Include=\"$(InteropWorkingDir)dist\\$(Configuration)\\blazor.mcp.js*\" />\n+      <Content Include=\"@(_McpJsOutput)\"\n+               Link=\"wwwroot\\%(_McpJsOutput.Filename)%(_McpJsOutput.Extension)\"\n+               ContentRoot=\"$(InteropWorkingDir)dist\\$(Configuration)\\\" />\n+    </ItemGroup>\n+  </Target>\n+\n+  <ItemGroup>\n+    <Content Remove=\"JS\\**\\*.ts;JS\\package.json;JS\\rollup.config.mjs;JS\\tsconfig.json\" />\n+  </ItemGroup>\n+\n+  <ItemGroup>\n+    <Compile Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Components\\Endpoints\\src\\FormMapping\\**\\*.cs\"\n+             Exclude=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Components\\Endpoints\\src\\FormMapping\\HttpContextFormDataProvider.cs;$(RepoRoot)src\\Components\\Endpoints\\src\\FormMapping\\HttpContextFormValueMapper.cs\"\n+             LinkBase=\"FormMapping\" />\n+    <Compile Include=\"$(SharedSourceRoot)ClosedGenericMatcher\\ClosedGenericMatcher.cs\" LinkBase=\"Shared\" />\n+    <Compile Include=\"$(SharedSourceRoot)PropertyHelper\\**\\*.cs\" LinkBase=\"Shared\" />\n+    <EmbeddedResource Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Components\\Endpoints\\src\\FormMapping\\FormDataResources.resx\"\n+                      Link=\"FormMapping\\FormDataResources.resx\" />\n+    <InternalsVisibleTo Include=\"Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Tests\" />\n+  </ItemGroup>\n+</Project>"},{"sha":"1cbdb34677e206b7e3edd703744a1f39a91a3094","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Protocol/McpComponentApplication.cs","status":"added","additions":200,"deletions":0,"changes":200,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentApplication.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentApplication.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentApplication.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,200 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis;\n+using System.Linq;\n+using System.Security.Claims;\n+using System.Security.Cryptography;\n+using System.Text.Json;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Logging;\n+using ModelContextProtocol;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Protocol;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Protocol;\n+\n+internal sealed class McpComponentApplication\n+{\n+    private const int MaximumViews = 1024;\n+    private readonly Dictionary<Guid, View> _views = new();\n+    private readonly object _lock = new();\n+\n+    public McpComponentApplication(\n+        string name,\n+        [DynamicallyAccessedMembers(DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.All)] Type componentType,\n+        Uri baseUri,\n+        Uri initialLocation,\n+        bool preserveDom = true,\n+        LogLevel logLevel = LogLevel.Information,\n+        string? openingToolName = null,\n+        Func<CallToolResult, IReadOnlyDictionary<string, object?>>? initialParametersFactory = null)\n+    {\n+        Name = name;\n+        ComponentType = componentType;\n+        BaseUri = baseUri;\n+        InitialLocation = initialLocation;\n+        ResourceUri = $\"ui://blazor/{Uri.EscapeDataString(name)}\";\n+        DispatchToolName = $\"{name}_dispatch\";\n+        PreserveDom = preserveDom;\n+        LogLevel = logLevel;\n+        OpeningToolName = openingToolName ?? name;\n+        InitialParametersFactory = initialParametersFactory;\n+    }\n+\n+    public string Name { get; }\n+    [DynamicallyAccessedMembers(DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.All)]\n+    public Type ComponentType { get; }\n+    public Uri BaseUri { get; }\n+    public Uri InitialLocation { get; }\n+    public string ResourceUri { get; }\n+    public string DispatchToolName { get; }\n+    public bool PreserveDom { get; }\n+    public LogLevel LogLevel { get; }\n+    public string OpeningToolName { get; }\n+    public Func<CallToolResult, IReadOnlyDictionary<string, object?>>? InitialParametersFactory { get; }\n+\n+    public async ValueTask<View> CreateViewAsync(ClaimsPrincipal owner, McpComponentParameters parameters)\n+    {\n+        View[] expired;\n+        lock (_lock)\n+        {\n+            var now = DateTimeOffset.UtcNow;\n+            expired = _views.Values.Where(view => view.Expires <= now && !view.HasActiveOperations).ToArray();\n+            foreach (var view in expired)\n+            {\n+                _views.Remove(view.Id);\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        await Task.WhenAll(expired.Select(view => view.CloseAsync()));\n+        lock (_lock)\n+        {\n+            if (_views.Count >= MaximumViews)\n+            {\n+                throw new McpException(\"The component application has reached its active view limit.\");\n+            }\n+\n+            var view = new View(GetPrincipalAssociation(owner), parameters);\n+            _views.Add(view.Id, view);\n+            return view;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    public View GetView(Guid id, ClaimsPrincipal owner)\n+    {\n+        lock (_lock)\n+        {\n+            if (!_views.TryGetValue(id, out var view) || view.Owner != GetPrincipalAssociation(owner) || view.Expires <= DateTimeOffset.UtcNow)\n+            {\n+                throw new McpException(\"The component view is not available for this request.\");\n+            }\n+\n+            return view;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    public async Task RemoveViewAsync(View view)\n+    {\n+        lock (_lock)\n+        {\n+            _views.Remove(view.Id);\n+        }\n+\n+        await view.CloseAsync();\n+    }\n+\n+    private static string GetPrincipalAssociation(ClaimsPrincipal principal)\n+    {\n+        var identities = principal.Identities.Select(identity => JsonSerializer.Serialize(new\n+        {\n+            identity.AuthenticationType,\n+            identity.IsAuthenticated,\n+            identity.NameClaimType,\n+            identity.RoleClaimType,\n+            Claims = identity.Claims.Select(claim => new { claim.Type, claim.Value, claim.ValueType, claim.Issuer, claim.OriginalIssuer })\n+                .OrderBy(claim => claim.Type, StringComparer.Ordinal)\n+                .ThenBy(claim => claim.Value, StringComparer.Ordinal)\n+                .ThenBy(claim => claim.ValueType, StringComparer.Ordinal)\n+                .ThenBy(claim => claim.Issuer, StringComparer.Ordinal)\n+                .ThenBy(claim => claim.OriginalIssuer, StringComparer.Ordinal),\n+        })).OrderBy(identity => identity, StringComparer.Ordinal).ToArray();\n+        return Convert.ToHexString(SHA256.HashData(JsonSerializer.SerializeToUtf8Bytes(identities)));\n+    }\n+\n+    internal sealed class View(string owner, McpComponentParameters parameters)\n+    {\n+        private readonly object _operationLock = new();\n+        private readonly HashSet<Task> _activeOperations = new();\n+        private readonly CancellationTokenSource _lifetime = new();\n+        private bool _closed;\n+        private Task? _closeTask;\n+\n+        public Guid Id { get; } = Guid.NewGuid();\n+        public string Owner { get; } = owner;\n+        public McpComponentParameters Parameters { get; } = parameters;\n+        public DateTimeOffset Expires { get; } = DateTimeOffset.UtcNow.AddMinutes(20);\n+\n+        public bool HasActiveOperations\n+        {\n+            get\n+            {\n+                lock (_operationLock)\n+                {\n+                    return _activeOperations.Count != 0;\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        public async Task<TResult> RunAsync<TResult>(Func<CancellationToken, Task<TResult>> operation, CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n+        {\n+            var finished = new TaskCompletionSource(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+            CancellationToken lifetime;\n+            lock (_operationLock)\n+            {\n+                if (_closed || Expires <= DateTimeOffset.UtcNow)\n+                {\n+                    throw new McpException(\"The component view has closed or expired.\");\n+                }\n+\n+                lifetime = _lifetime.Token;\n+                _activeOperations.Add(finished.Task);\n+            }\n+\n+            try\n+            {\n+                using var linked = CancellationTokenSource.CreateLinkedTokenSource(lifetime, cancellationToken);\n+                return await operation(linked.Token);\n+            }\n+            finally\n+            {\n+                lock (_operationLock)\n+                {\n+                    _activeOperations.Remove(finished.Task);\n+                }\n+\n+                finished.SetResult();\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        public Task CloseAsync()\n+        {\n+            lock (_operationLock)\n+            {\n+                _closed = true;\n+                return _closeTask ??= CompleteCloseAsync(_activeOperations.ToArray());\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        private async Task CompleteCloseAsync(Task[] pending)\n+        {\n+            try\n+            {\n+                await _lifetime.CancelAsync();\n+            }\n+            finally\n+            {\n+                await Task.WhenAll(pending);\n+                _lifetime.Dispose();\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"ce84b473f179a5a9e0e520bf3171ce012b4e75b5","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Protocol/McpComponentInvoker.cs","status":"added","additions":306,"deletions":0,"changes":306,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentInvoker.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentInvoker.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentInvoker.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,306 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Globalization;\n+using System.Linq;\n+using System.Security.Claims;\n+using System.Text.Json;\n+using System.Text.Json.Nodes;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Hosting;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Rendering;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives;\n+using ModelContextProtocol;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Protocol;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Server;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Protocol;\n+\n+internal sealed class McpComponentInvoker\n+{\n+    private static readonly JsonSerializerOptions JsonOptions = new(JsonSerializerDefaults.Web);\n+    private readonly McpComponentApplication _application;\n+    private readonly McpComponentHost _host;\n+    private readonly IServiceScopeFactory _scopeFactory;\n+\n+    public McpComponentInvoker(McpComponentApplication application, McpComponentHost host, IServiceScopeFactory scopeFactory)\n+    {\n+        _application = application;\n+        _host = host;\n+        _scopeFactory = scopeFactory;\n+    }\n+\n+    public async ValueTask<CallToolResult> DispatchAsync(\n+        McpComponentApplication.View viewState,\n+        RequestContext<CallToolRequestParams> request,\n+        CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n+    {\n+        var principal = request.User ?? new ClaimsPrincipal(new ClaimsIdentity());\n+        var arguments = request.Params!.Arguments!;\n+        try\n+        {\n+            var method = arguments[\"method\"].GetString();\n+            if (method == \"CLOSE\")\n+            {\n+                await _application.RemoveViewAsync(viewState);\n+                return new CallToolResult { Content = [new TextContentBlock { Text = \"Component view closed.\" }] };\n+            }\n+\n+            if (method is not (\"GET\" or \"POST\")\n+                || !arguments.TryGetValue(\"location\", out var locationElement)\n+                || locationElement.ValueKind != JsonValueKind.String\n+                || !Uri.TryCreate(locationElement.GetString(), UriKind.Absolute, out var location)\n+                || !_application.BaseUri.IsBaseOf(location))\n+            {\n+                throw new McpException(\"The component navigation must identify a location within the registered application.\");\n+            }\n+\n+            var enctype = \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\";\n+            if (arguments.TryGetValue(\"enctype\", out var enctypeElement))\n+            {\n+                if (enctypeElement.ValueKind != JsonValueKind.String)\n+                {\n+                    throw new McpException(\"The form encoding must be a string.\");\n+                }\n+\n+                enctype = enctypeElement.GetString();\n+            }\n+\n+            if (method == \"POST\" && enctype is not (\"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" or \"multipart/form-data\"))\n+            {\n+                throw new McpException(\"Only URL-encoded and multipart component forms are supported.\");\n+            }\n+\n+            var fields = new Dictionary<string, StringValues>(StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase);\n+            if (arguments.TryGetValue(\"fields\", out var fieldsElement) && fieldsElement.ValueKind != JsonValueKind.Null)\n+            {\n+                if (fieldsElement.ValueKind != JsonValueKind.Object)\n+                {\n+                    throw new McpException(\"Form fields must be an object containing arrays of strings.\");\n+                }\n+\n+                foreach (var field in fieldsElement.EnumerateObject())\n+                {\n+                    if (field.Value.ValueKind != JsonValueKind.Array\n+                        || field.Value.EnumerateArray().Any(value => value.ValueKind != JsonValueKind.String))\n+                    {\n+                        throw new McpException(\"Form fields must be arrays of strings.\");\n+                    }\n+\n+                    var values = new StringValues(field.Value.EnumerateArray().Select(value => value.GetString()).ToArray());\n+                    fields[field.Name] = fields.TryGetValue(field.Name, out var existing) ? StringValues.Concat(existing, values) : values;\n+                }\n+            }\n+\n+            string? handler = null;\n+            if (method == \"POST\")\n+            {\n+                if (!fields.TryGetValue(\"_handler\", out var handlers) || handlers.Count != 1 || string.IsNullOrEmpty(handlers[0]))\n+                {\n+                    throw new McpException(\"The form submission must identify exactly one named form handler.\");\n+                }\n+\n+                handler = handlers[0];\n+            }\n+\n+            using var submission = ReadFiles(arguments);\n+            if (method == \"GET\" && (fields.Count != 0 || submission.Files.Count != 0))\n+            {\n+                throw new McpException(\"GET component navigation cannot contain form data.\");\n+            }\n+\n+            if (enctype != \"multipart/form-data\" && submission.Files.Count != 0)\n+            {\n+                throw new McpException(\"File contents require a multipart component form.\");\n+            }\n+\n+            var rendered = await RenderFollowingRedirectsAsync(new McpComponentRequest(location, principal, handler, fields, submission.Files),\n+                viewState.Parameters, cancellationToken);\n+            return CreateResult(viewState, rendered.Result, rendered.Location, rendered.Redirected);\n+        }\n+        catch (McpFormSubmissionException exception)\n+        {\n+            return new CallToolResult { IsError = true, Content = [new TextContentBlock { Text = exception.Message }] };\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    public async ValueTask<CallToolResult> OpenFromToolAsync(\n+        RequestContext<CallToolRequestParams> request,\n+        CallToolResult? openingResult,\n+        CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n+    {\n+        var response = openingResult is null ? null : JsonSerializer.SerializeToElement(openingResult, McpJsonUtilities.DefaultOptions)\n+            .Deserialize<CallToolResult>(McpJsonUtilities.DefaultOptions)\n+                ?? throw new InvalidOperationException(\"The opening tool result could not be copied.\");\n+        var parameters = response is null\n+            ? McpComponentParameters.Empty\n+            : McpComponentParameters.Capture(_application.InitialParametersFactory!(response));\n+        if (response?.Meta?.ContainsKey(\"blazor\") == true)\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException(\"The opening tool result already contains reserved Blazor app metadata.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        var principal = request.User ?? new ClaimsPrincipal(new ClaimsIdentity());\n+        var rendered = await RenderFollowingRedirectsAsync(\n+            new McpComponentRequest(_application.InitialLocation, principal), parameters, cancellationToken);\n+        var view = await _application.CreateViewAsync(principal, parameters);\n+        return CreateResult(view, rendered.Result, rendered.Location, rendered.Redirected, response);\n+    }\n+\n+    private async Task<(McpRenderResult Result, Uri Location, bool Redirected)> RenderFollowingRedirectsAsync(\n+        McpComponentRequest request, McpComponentParameters parameters, CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n+    {\n+        var redirected = false;\n+        var replaceHistory = false;\n+        for (var count = 0; count < 10; count++)\n+        {\n+            McpRenderResult result;\n+            if (count == 0)\n+            {\n+                result = await _host.RenderAsync(_application, request, parameters, cancellationToken);\n+            }\n+            else\n+            {\n+                await using var scope = _scopeFactory.CreateAsyncScope();\n+                var host = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<McpComponentHost>();\n+                result = await host.RenderAsync(_application, request, parameters, cancellationToken);\n+            }\n+            if (result.Redirect is not { } target)\n+            {\n+                return (result with { ReplaceHistory = replaceHistory }, request.Location, redirected);\n+            }\n+\n+            if (!_application.BaseUri.IsBaseOf(target))\n+            {\n+                throw new McpException($\"The component application requested external navigation to '{target}'.\");\n+            }\n+\n+            redirected = true;\n+            replaceHistory |= result.ReplaceHistory;\n+            request = new McpComponentRequest(target, request.User);\n+        }\n+\n+        throw new McpException(\"The component application exceeded the redirect limit.\");\n+    }\n+\n+    private CallToolResult CreateResult(McpComponentApplication.View view, McpRenderResult result, Uri location, bool redirected, CallToolResult? openingResult = null)\n+    {\n+        if (result.Redirect is not null)\n+        {\n+            throw new McpException($\"The component application requested navigation to '{result.Redirect}'.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        var response = openingResult ?? new CallToolResult\n+        {\n+            Content = [new TextContentBlock { Text = $\"Rendered {_application.Name} at {location}.\" }],\n+        };\n+        response.Meta ??= new JsonObject();\n+        if (response.Meta.ContainsKey(\"blazor\"))\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException(\"The opening tool result already contains reserved Blazor app metadata.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        response.Meta[\"blazor\"] = new JsonObject\n+        {\n+            [\"viewId\"] = view.Id.ToString(),\n+            [\"location\"] = location.AbsoluteUri,\n+            [\"baseUri\"] = _application.BaseUri.AbsoluteUri,\n+            [\"dispatchTool\"] = _application.DispatchToolName,\n+            [\"document\"] = result.Html,\n+            [\"browserOptions\"] = new JsonObject\n+            {\n+                [\"preserveDom\"] = _application.PreserveDom,\n+                [\"logLevel\"] = (int)_application.LogLevel,\n+            },\n+            [\"redirected\"] = redirected,\n+            [\"replaceHistory\"] = result.ReplaceHistory,\n+        };\n+        return response;\n+    }\n+\n+    private static SubmissionFiles ReadFiles(IDictionary<string, JsonElement> arguments)\n+    {\n+        var result = new SubmissionFiles();\n+        try\n+        {\n+            if (!arguments.TryGetValue(\"files\", out var files) || files.ValueKind == JsonValueKind.Null)\n+            {\n+                return result;\n+            }\n+\n+            if (files.ValueKind != JsonValueKind.Array)\n+            {\n+                throw new McpException(\"Submitted files must be an array.\");\n+            }\n+\n+            long totalBytes = 0;\n+            foreach (var item in files.EnumerateArray())\n+            {\n+                var file = item.Deserialize<SubmittedFile>(JsonOptions) ?? throw new McpException(\"A submitted file is invalid.\");\n+                if (file.Name is null || file.FileName is null || file.ContentType is null || file.Data is null\n+                    || file.Data.Length > 48 * 1024 * 1024)\n+                {\n+                    throw new McpException(\"A submitted file is invalid or exceeds the submission limit.\");\n+                }\n+\n+                var bytes = new byte[file.Data.Length / 4 * 3 + 3];\n+                if (!Convert.TryFromBase64String(file.Data, bytes, out var length))\n+                {\n+                    throw new McpException(\"A submitted file contains invalid base64 data.\");\n+                }\n+\n+                totalBytes += length;\n+                if (totalBytes > 32 * 1024 * 1024)\n+                {\n+                    throw new McpException(\"Submitted files exceed the 32 MiB submission limit.\");\n+                }\n+\n+                if (length == 0 && file.FileName.Length == 0)\n+                {\n+                    continue;\n+                }\n+\n+                var stream = new MemoryStream(bytes, 0, length, writable: false);\n+                result.Streams.Add(stream);\n+                var formFile = new FormFile(stream, 0, length, file.Name, file.FileName)\n+                {\n+                    Headers = new HeaderDictionary(),\n+                    ContentType = file.ContentType,\n+                };\n+                formFile.Headers.LastModified = DateTimeOffset.FromUnixTimeMilliseconds(file.LastModified).ToString(\"R\", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture);\n+                result.Files.Add(formFile);\n+            }\n+\n+            return result;\n+        }\n+        catch\n+        {\n+            result.Dispose();\n+            throw;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class SubmissionFiles : IDisposable\n+    {\n+        public FormFileCollection Files { get; } = new();\n+        public List<MemoryStream> Streams { get; } = new();\n+\n+        public void Dispose()\n+        {\n+            foreach (var stream in Streams)\n+            {\n+                stream.Dispose();\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class SubmittedFile\n+    {\n+        public string? Name { get; set; }\n+        public string? FileName { get; set; }\n+        public string? ContentType { get; set; }\n+        public long LastModified { get; set; }\n+        public string? Data { get; set; }\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"9c63530e81d6c8db092c6359a9d4db3f4d562490","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Protocol/McpComponentOptionsSetup.cs","status":"added","additions":79,"deletions":0,"changes":79,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentOptionsSetup.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentOptionsSetup.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentOptionsSetup.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,79 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Linq;\n+using System.Text.Json.Nodes;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Options;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Server;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Protocol;\n+\n+internal sealed class McpComponentOptionsSetup(\n+    McpComponentApplication application,\n+    IEnumerable<McpServerTool> registeredTools,\n+    IEnumerable<McpServerResource> registeredResources,\n+    IServiceScopeFactory scopeFactory) : IPostConfigureOptions<McpServerOptions>\n+{\n+    public void PostConfigure(string? name, McpServerOptions options)\n+    {\n+        var openingTool = GetUniqueTool(options, application.OpeningToolName);\n+        GetUniqueTool(options, application.DispatchToolName);\n+        var resources = registeredResources.Where(resource => resource.ProtocolResourceTemplate.UriTemplate == application.ResourceUri)\n+            .Distinct(ReferenceEqualityComparer.Instance).Count();\n+        if (resources != 1)\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException($\"The component resource '{application.ResourceUri}' is registered more than once.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        var metadata = openingTool.ProtocolTool.Meta?.DeepClone().AsObject() ?? new JsonObject();\n+        var ui = metadata[\"ui\"] is null ? new JsonObject() : metadata[\"ui\"]!.AsObject();\n+        if (ui[\"resourceUri\"] is { } existing && existing.GetValue<string>() != application.ResourceUri)\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException($\"The tool '{application.OpeningToolName}' is already associated with another app resource.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        ui[\"resourceUri\"] = application.ResourceUri;\n+        if (metadata[\"ui\"] is null)\n+        {\n+            metadata[\"ui\"] = ui;\n+        }\n+\n+        openingTool.ProtocolTool.Meta = metadata;\n+        if (application.InitialParametersFactory is not null)\n+        {\n+            options.Filters.Request.CallToolFilters.Insert(0, next => async (request, cancellationToken) =>\n+            {\n+                var result = await next(request, cancellationToken);\n+                if (request.Params?.Name != application.OpeningToolName || result.IsError == true)\n+                {\n+                    return result;\n+                }\n+\n+                cancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n+                await using var scope = scopeFactory.CreateAsyncScope();\n+                var invoker = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredKeyedService<McpComponentInvoker>(application);\n+                return await invoker.OpenFromToolAsync(request, result, cancellationToken);\n+            });\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private McpServerTool GetUniqueTool(McpServerOptions options, string toolName)\n+    {\n+        var published = options.ToolCollection?.Where(tool => tool.ProtocolTool.Name == toolName).ToArray() ?? [];\n+        if (published.Length != 1)\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException($\"The component tool '{toolName}' must be registered exactly once in the MCP SDK tool catalog.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        var candidates = new HashSet<McpServerTool>(\n+            registeredTools.Where(tool => tool.ProtocolTool.Name == toolName), ReferenceEqualityComparer.Instance);\n+        candidates.Add(published[0]);\n+        if (candidates.Count != 1)\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException($\"Multiple MCP tools are registered with the component tool name '{toolName}'.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        return published[0];\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"eeaa4797eca265eb8b1a78b25bb55c8f1464f00d","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Protocol/McpComponentParameters.cs","status":"added","additions":54,"deletions":0,"changes":54,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentParameters.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentParameters.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentParameters.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,54 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Text.Json;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Protocol;\n+\n+internal sealed class McpComponentParameters\n+{\n+    private static readonly JsonSerializerOptions JsonOptions = new(JsonSerializerDefaults.Web);\n+    private readonly Entry[] _entries;\n+\n+    private McpComponentParameters(Entry[] entries) => _entries = entries;\n+\n+    public static McpComponentParameters Empty { get; } = new([]);\n+\n+    public static McpComponentParameters Capture(IReadOnlyDictionary<string, object?> parameters)\n+    {\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(parameters);\n+        var entries = new List<Entry>();\n+        var names = new HashSet<string>(StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase);\n+        foreach (var (name, value) in parameters)\n+        {\n+            ArgumentException.ThrowIfNullOrEmpty(name);\n+            if (!names.Add(name))\n+            {\n+                throw new ArgumentException($\"The component parameter '{name}' is supplied more than once.\", nameof(parameters));\n+            }\n+\n+            if (value is IComponent or Delegate or IServiceProvider)\n+            {\n+                throw new ArgumentException($\"The component parameter '{name}' must contain serializable data, not a component, callback, or service provider.\", nameof(parameters));\n+            }\n+\n+            var type = value?.GetType();\n+            entries.Add(new Entry(name, type, type is null ? default : JsonSerializer.SerializeToElement(value, type, JsonOptions)));\n+        }\n+\n+        return new(entries.ToArray());\n+    }\n+\n+    public Dictionary<string, object?> Restore()\n+    {\n+        var result = new Dictionary<string, object?>(StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase);\n+        foreach (var entry in _entries)\n+        {\n+            result.Add(entry.Name, entry.Type is null ? null : entry.Value.Deserialize(entry.Type, JsonOptions));\n+        }\n+\n+        return result;\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed record Entry(string Name, Type? Type, JsonElement Value);\n+}"},{"sha":"aa56caa4d48f4517b2934d61a560896c5d9f6fc2","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Protocol/McpComponentResource.cs","status":"added","additions":60,"deletions":0,"changes":60,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentResource.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentResource.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentResource.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,60 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Security.Claims;\n+using System.Text.Json.Nodes;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Hosting;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n+using ModelContextProtocol;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Protocol;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Server;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Protocol;\n+\n+internal sealed class McpComponentResource(McpComponentApplication application, IServiceScopeFactory scopeFactory) : McpServerResource\n+{\n+    public override ResourceTemplate ProtocolResourceTemplate { get; } = new()\n+    {\n+        UriTemplate = application.ResourceUri,\n+        Name = $\"{application.Name}_ui\",\n+        MimeType = \"text/html;profile=mcp-app\",\n+    };\n+\n+    public override IReadOnlyList<object> Metadata => [];\n+\n+    public override bool IsMatch(string uri) => string.Equals(uri, application.ResourceUri, StringComparison.Ordinal);\n+\n+    public override async ValueTask<ReadResourceResult> ReadAsync(RequestContext<ReadResourceRequestParams> request, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n+    {\n+        cancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n+        await using var scope = scopeFactory.CreateAsyncScope();\n+        var host = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<McpComponentHost>();\n+        var rendered = await host.RenderAsync(application, new McpComponentRequest(\n+            application.InitialLocation, request.User ?? new ClaimsPrincipal(new ClaimsIdentity()), IsShellRendering: true), cancellationToken);\n+        if (rendered.Redirect is not null)\n+        {\n+            throw new McpException(\"The application resource shell must render a document without navigation.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        return new ReadResourceResult\n+        {\n+            Contents = [new TextResourceContents\n+            {\n+                Uri = application.ResourceUri,\n+                MimeType = \"text/html;profile=mcp-app\",\n+                Text = rendered.Html!,\n+                Meta = new JsonObject\n+                {\n+                    [\"ui\"] = new JsonObject\n+                    {\n+                        [\"csp\"] = new JsonObject\n+                        {\n+                            [\"resourceDomains\"] = new JsonArray(application.BaseUri.GetLeftPart(UriPartial.Authority)),\n+                            [\"baseUriDomains\"] = new JsonArray(application.BaseUri.GetLeftPart(UriPartial.Authority)),\n+                        },\n+                    },\n+                },\n+            }],\n+        };\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"6e2b20661f79d2ab3f76cf118a36c049cc2fcec7","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Protocol/McpComponentTool.cs","status":"added","additions":92,"deletions":0,"changes":92,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentTool.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentTool.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentTool.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,92 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Text.Json;\n+using System.Text.Json.Nodes;\n+using System.Security.Claims;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n+using ModelContextProtocol;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Protocol;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Server;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Protocol;\n+\n+internal sealed class McpComponentTool : McpServerTool\n+{\n+    private readonly McpComponentApplication _application;\n+    private readonly IServiceScopeFactory _scopeFactory;\n+    private readonly bool _dispatch;\n+\n+    public McpComponentTool(McpComponentApplication application, IServiceScopeFactory scopeFactory, bool dispatch)\n+    {\n+        _application = application;\n+        _scopeFactory = scopeFactory;\n+        _dispatch = dispatch;\n+        ProtocolTool = new Tool\n+        {\n+            Name = dispatch ? application.DispatchToolName : application.Name,\n+            Description = dispatch ? \"Submits or navigates the component application.\" : \"Opens the component application.\",\n+            InputSchema = JsonSerializer.SerializeToElement(dispatch\n+                ? new JsonObject\n+                {\n+                    [\"type\"] = \"object\",\n+                    [\"properties\"] = new JsonObject\n+                    {\n+                        [\"viewId\"] = new JsonObject { [\"type\"] = \"string\" },\n+                        [\"location\"] = new JsonObject { [\"type\"] = \"string\" },\n+                        [\"method\"] = new JsonObject { [\"type\"] = \"string\", [\"enum\"] = new JsonArray(\"GET\", \"POST\", \"CLOSE\") },\n+                        [\"enctype\"] = new JsonObject { [\"type\"] = \"string\" },\n+                        [\"fields\"] = new JsonObject { [\"type\"] = \"object\" },\n+                        [\"files\"] = new JsonObject { [\"type\"] = \"array\" },\n+                    },\n+                    [\"required\"] = new JsonArray(\"viewId\", \"method\"),\n+                    [\"additionalProperties\"] = false,\n+                }\n+                : new JsonObject { [\"type\"] = \"object\", [\"properties\"] = new JsonObject(), [\"additionalProperties\"] = false }),\n+            Meta = new JsonObject\n+            {\n+                [\"ui\"] = new JsonObject\n+                {\n+                    [\"resourceUri\"] = application.ResourceUri,\n+                    [\"visibility\"] = dispatch ? new JsonArray(\"app\") : new JsonArray(\"model\", \"app\"),\n+                },\n+            },\n+        };\n+    }\n+\n+    public override Tool ProtocolTool { get; }\n+    public override IReadOnlyList<object> Metadata => [];\n+\n+    public override async ValueTask<CallToolResult> InvokeAsync(RequestContext<CallToolRequestParams> request, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n+    {\n+        if (!_dispatch)\n+        {\n+            await using var openingScope = _scopeFactory.CreateAsyncScope();\n+            var openingInvoker = openingScope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredKeyedService<McpComponentInvoker>(_application);\n+            return await openingInvoker.OpenFromToolAsync(request, openingResult: null, cancellationToken);\n+        }\n+\n+        var arguments = request.Params?.Arguments ?? throw new McpException(\"Component dispatch arguments are required.\");\n+        if (!arguments.TryGetValue(\"viewId\", out var idElement) || idElement.ValueKind != JsonValueKind.String\n+            || !Guid.TryParse(idElement.GetString(), out var id)\n+            || !arguments.TryGetValue(\"method\", out var methodElement) || methodElement.ValueKind != JsonValueKind.String)\n+        {\n+            throw new McpException(\"Component dispatch requires a view identifier and method.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        var view = _application.GetView(id, request.User ?? new ClaimsPrincipal(new ClaimsIdentity()));\n+        return methodElement.GetString() == \"CLOSE\"\n+            ? await DispatchAsync(view, request, cancellationToken)\n+            : await view.RunAsync(token => DispatchAsync(view, request, token), cancellationToken);\n+    }\n+\n+    private async Task<CallToolResult> DispatchAsync(\n+        McpComponentApplication.View view,\n+        RequestContext<CallToolRequestParams> request,\n+        CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n+    {\n+        await using var scope = _scopeFactory.CreateAsyncScope();\n+        var invoker = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredKeyedService<McpComponentInvoker>(_application);\n+        return await invoker.DispatchAsync(view, request, cancellationToken);\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"7dc5c58110bfa8486c4ddb75c89a99655c1adcf8","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/PublicAPI.Shipped.txt","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FPublicAPI.Shipped.txt","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FPublicAPI.Shipped.txt","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FPublicAPI.Shipped.txt?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+#nullable enable"},{"sha":"7baffc56f5894874c7da6aaf5dbac1ef4cf56a28","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/PublicAPI.Unshipped.txt","status":"added","additions":23,"deletions":0,"changes":23,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FPublicAPI.Unshipped.txt","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FPublicAPI.Unshipped.txt","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FPublicAPI.Unshipped.txt?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@\n+#nullable enable\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.RazorComponentMcpOptions\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.RazorComponentMcpOptions.RazorComponentMcpOptions() -> void\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.RazorComponentMcpOptions.Name.get -> string!\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.RazorComponentMcpOptions.Name.set -> void\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.RazorComponentMcpOptions.BaseUri.get -> System.Uri!\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.RazorComponentMcpOptions.BaseUri.set -> void\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.RazorComponentMcpOptions.InitialPath.get -> string!\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.RazorComponentMcpOptions.InitialPath.set -> void\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.RazorComponentMcpOptions.PreserveDom.get -> bool\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.RazorComponentMcpOptions.PreserveDom.set -> void\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.RazorComponentMcpOptions.LogLevel.get -> Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.LogLevel\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.RazorComponentMcpOptions.LogLevel.set -> void\n+Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.RazorComponentMcpServerBuilderExtensions\n+static Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.RazorComponentMcpServerBuilderExtensions.WithRazorComponents<TRootComponent>(this Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.IMcpServerBuilder! builder, System.Action<Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.RazorComponentMcpOptions!>! configure) -> Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.IMcpServerBuilder!\n+static Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.RazorComponentMcpServerBuilderExtensions.WithRazorComponents<TRootComponent>(this Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.IMcpServerBuilder! builder, string! openingToolName, System.Func<ModelContextProtocol.Protocol.CallToolResult!, System.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyDictionary<string!, object?>!>! initialParametersFactory, System.Action<Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.RazorComponentMcpOptions!>! configure) -> Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.IMcpServerBuilder!\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.McpComponentRequestContext\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.McpComponentRequestContext.IsActive.get -> bool\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.McpComponentRequestContext.IsShellRendering.get -> bool\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.McpComponentRequestContext.Location.get -> System.Uri!\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.McpComponentRequestContext.BaseUri.get -> System.Uri!\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.McpComponentRequestContext.User.get -> System.Security.Claims.ClaimsPrincipal!\n+Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.McpComponentRequestContext.CancellationToken.get -> System.Threading.CancellationToken"},{"sha":"5b1d4f816af32d5daf86a4a1a4ff9e19811a7605","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Rendering/McpFormSubmissionException.cs","status":"added","additions":6,"deletions":0,"changes":6,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FRendering%2FMcpFormSubmissionException.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FRendering%2FMcpFormSubmissionException.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FRendering%2FMcpFormSubmissionException.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Rendering;\n+\n+internal sealed class McpFormSubmissionException(string message) : Exception(message);"},{"sha":"7e1915569ec640de36a6a6d8d10431b250e2242d","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/src/Rendering/McpHtmlRenderer.cs","status":"added","additions":131,"deletions":0,"changes":131,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FRendering%2FMcpHtmlRenderer.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FRendering%2FMcpHtmlRenderer.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Fsrc%2FRendering%2FMcpHtmlRenderer.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,131 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis;\n+using System.Globalization;\n+using System.Linq;\n+using System.Text;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.HtmlRendering.Infrastructure;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.RenderTree;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Logging;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Rendering;\n+\n+internal sealed class McpHtmlRenderer(IServiceProvider services, ILoggerFactory loggerFactory)\n+    : StaticHtmlRenderer(services, loggerFactory)\n+{\n+    private readonly Dictionary<(int ComponentId, int FrameIndex), string> _namesByLocation = new();\n+    private readonly Dictionary<string, HashSet<(int ComponentId, int FrameIndex)>> _locationsByName = new(StringComparer.Ordinal);\n+\n+    public Task DispatchSubmitAsync(string handlerName)\n+    {\n+        Dispatcher.AssertAccess();\n+\n+        if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(handlerName))\n+        {\n+            throw new McpFormSubmissionException(\"The submission does not identify a named form. Specify @formname or EditForm.FormName.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        if (!_locationsByName.TryGetValue(handlerName, out var locations) || locations.Count == 0)\n+        {\n+            throw new McpFormSubmissionException($\"Cannot submit the form '{handlerName}' because no form on the page currently has that name.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        if (locations.Count > 1)\n+        {\n+            var message = new StringBuilder($\"There is more than one named submit event with the name '{handlerName}'. Ensure named submit events have unique names, or are in scopes with distinct names. The following components use this name:\");\n+            foreach (var location in locations)\n+            {\n+                var path = new Stack<string>();\n+                for (var state = GetComponentState(location.ComponentId); state is not null; state = state.ParentComponentState)\n+                {\n+                    path.Push(state.Component.GetType().Name);\n+                }\n+\n+                message.Append(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture, $\"\\n - {string.Join(\" > \", path)}\");\n+            }\n+\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException(message.ToString());\n+        }\n+\n+        var (componentId, frameIndex) = locations.Single();\n+        var frames = GetCurrentRenderTreeFrames(componentId);\n+        ref var frame = ref frames.Array[frameIndex];\n+        if (frame.FrameType != RenderTreeFrameType.NamedEvent || frame.NamedEventType != \"onsubmit\")\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException(\"The named form no longer corresponds to its tracked render-tree frame.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        for (var index = frameIndex - 1; index >= 0; index--)\n+        {\n+            ref var candidate = ref frames.Array[index];\n+            if (candidate.FrameType == RenderTreeFrameType.Element)\n+            {\n+                break;\n+            }\n+\n+            if (candidate.FrameType == RenderTreeFrameType.Attribute\n+                && candidate.AttributeEventHandlerId > 0\n+                && string.Equals(candidate.AttributeName, \"onsubmit\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase))\n+            {\n+                return DispatchEventAsync(candidate.AttributeEventHandlerId, null, EventArgs.Empty, waitForQuiescence: true);\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        return Task.CompletedTask;\n+    }\n+\n+    protected override Task UpdateDisplayAsync(in RenderBatch renderBatch)\n+    {\n+        if (renderBatch.NamedEventChanges is { } changes)\n+        {\n+            for (var index = 0; index < changes.Count; index++)\n+            {\n+                ref var change = ref changes.Array[index];\n+                if (change.ChangeType == NamedEventChangeType.Removed\n+                    && change.EventType == \"onsubmit\"\n+                    && _namesByLocation.Remove((change.ComponentId, change.FrameIndex), out var name))\n+                {\n+                    var locations = _locationsByName[name];\n+                    locations.Remove((change.ComponentId, change.FrameIndex));\n+                    if (locations.Count == 0)\n+                    {\n+                        _locationsByName.Remove(name);\n+                    }\n+                }\n+            }\n+\n+            for (var index = 0; index < changes.Count; index++)\n+            {\n+                ref var change = ref changes.Array[index];\n+                if (change.ChangeType == NamedEventChangeType.Added\n+                    && change.EventType == \"onsubmit\"\n+                    && TryCreateScopeQualifiedEventName(change.ComponentId, change.AssignedName, out var name))\n+                {\n+                    if (!_locationsByName.TryGetValue(name, out var locations))\n+                    {\n+                        locations = new();\n+                        _locationsByName.Add(name, locations);\n+                    }\n+\n+                    var location = (change.ComponentId, change.FrameIndex);\n+                    if (!locations.Add(location))\n+                    {\n+                        throw new InvalidOperationException(\"A named submit event was added twice at the same render-tree location.\");\n+                    }\n+\n+                    _namesByLocation.Add(location, name);\n+                }\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        return base.UpdateDisplayAsync(renderBatch);\n+    }\n+\n+    protected override IComponent ResolveComponentForRenderMode(\n+        [DynamicallyAccessedMembers(DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.All)] Type componentType,\n+        int? parentComponentId,\n+        IComponentActivator componentActivator,\n+        IComponentRenderMode renderMode)\n+        => throw new NotSupportedException($\"The MCP static rendering host does not support the interactive render mode '{renderMode.GetType().Name}' on '{componentType}'.\");\n+}"},{"sha":"24af8827c439e780fd9f87947a2e24db720496b8","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/test/FormMapping/McpFormValueMapperTests.cs","status":"added","additions":58,"deletions":0,"changes":58,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FFormMapping%2FMcpFormValueMapperTests.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FFormMapping%2FMcpFormValueMapperTests.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FFormMapping%2FMcpFormValueMapperTests.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,58 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Endpoints.FormMapping;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.FormMapping;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp;\n+\n+public class McpFormValueMapperTests\n+{\n+    [Theory]\n+    [InlineData(true, \"form\", \"\", null)]\n+    [InlineData(true, \"form\", \"\", \"form\")]\n+    [InlineData(false, \"form\", \"\", \"other\")]\n+    [InlineData(false, \"form\", \"scope\", \"form\")]\n+    [InlineData(true, \"[scope]form\", \"scope\", null)]\n+    [InlineData(true, \"[scope]form\", \"scope\", \"form\")]\n+    [InlineData(false, \"[scope]form\", \"scope\", \"other\")]\n+    [InlineData(false, \"[scope]form\", \"other\", null)]\n+    [InlineData(false, \"[scope]form\", \"other\", \"form\")]\n+    [InlineData(false, \"[scope]\", \"longer\", null)]\n+    [InlineData(false, \"[scope\", \"scope\", null)]\n+    [InlineData(false, \"[scope\", \"\", \"scope\")]\n+    [InlineData(false, \"scope]\", \"scope\", null)]\n+    [InlineData(false, \"scope]\", \"\", \"scope\")]\n+    [InlineData(false, \"[a][b]\", \"b\", null)]\n+    public void CanMap_MatchesScopeAndForm(bool expected, string handler, string scope, string? form)\n+    {\n+        var data = new McpFormDataProvider();\n+        data.Initialize(handler, new Dictionary<string, StringValues>(), new FormFileCollection());\n+        var mapper = new McpFormValueMapper(data, new FormDataMapperOptions());\n+\n+        Assert.Equal(expected, mapper.CanMap(typeof(string), scope, form));\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public void CanMap_WithoutSubmission_DoesNotSupplyAValue()\n+    {\n+        var mapper = new McpFormValueMapper(new McpFormDataProvider(), new FormDataMapperOptions());\n+\n+        Assert.False(mapper.CanMap(typeof(string), \"\", null));\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public void Initialize_RejectsReinitializationWithinAnOperation()\n+    {\n+        var data = new McpFormDataProvider();\n+        var originalEntries = new Dictionary<string, StringValues> { [\"Input\"] = \"original\" };\n+        data.Initialize(\"original\", originalEntries, new FormFileCollection());\n+\n+        Assert.Throws<InvalidOperationException>(\n+            () => data.Initialize(\"replacement\", new Dictionary<string, StringValues>(), new FormFileCollection()));\n+        Assert.Equal(\"original\", data.HandlerName);\n+        Assert.Same(originalEntries, data.Entries);\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"9c211a34f639f53daba0150045cb932e6bcf278c","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/test/Hosting/McpComponentHostTests.cs","status":"added","additions":311,"deletions":0,"changes":311,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FHosting%2FMcpComponentHostTests.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FHosting%2FMcpComponentHostTests.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FHosting%2FMcpComponentHostTests.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,311 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Collections.Concurrent;\n+using System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations;\n+using System.Linq;\n+using System.Security.Claims;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Authorization;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Forms;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Forms.Mapping;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.DependencyInjection;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.FormMapping;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Hosting;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Protocol;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Rendering;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Hosting;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.FileProviders;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives;\n+using Moq;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp;\n+\n+public class McpComponentHostTests\n+{\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task EachOperation_OwnsFreshComponentsAndScope_AndDisposesInOrder()\n+    {\n+        await using var services = CreateServices();\n+        var host = CreateHost<BoundOperation>(services);\n+        var probe = services.GetRequiredService<OperationProbe>();\n+\n+        var first = await host.RenderAsync(CreateRequest(\"first\"));\n+        var second = await host.RenderAsync(CreateRequest(\"second\"));\n+\n+        Assert.Contains(\"operation-form\", first.Html);\n+        Assert.Contains(\"operation-form\", second.Html);\n+        Assert.Null(first.Redirect);\n+        Assert.Null(second.Redirect);\n+        Assert.Equal(2, probe.ComponentIds.Distinct().Count());\n+        Assert.Equal(2, probe.ScopeIds.Distinct().Count());\n+        Assert.Equal(new[] { \"first\", \"second\" }, probe.Users);\n+        Assert.Equal(new[] { \"component\", \"scope\", \"component\", \"scope\" }, probe.DisposalEvents);\n+        Assert.Equal(0, probe.Effects);\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task ActualEditForm_ValidatesMappedInputBeforeBusinessEffects()\n+    {\n+        await using var services = CreateServices();\n+        var host = CreateHost<BoundOperation>(services);\n+        var probe = services.GetRequiredService<OperationProbe>();\n+\n+        var valid = await host.RenderAsync(CreateRequest(\"valid\", \"bound-value\"));\n+        var invalid = await host.RenderAsync(CreateRequest(\"invalid\", \"\"));\n+\n+        Assert.Contains(\"effect:bound-value\", valid.Html);\n+        Assert.Contains(\"The Name field is required.\", invalid.Html);\n+        Assert.DoesNotContain(\"effect:\", invalid.Html);\n+        Assert.Equal(1, probe.Effects);\n+        Assert.Equal(new[] { \"bound-value\", \"\" }, probe.InitializedValues);\n+        Assert.Equal(new[] { \"component\", \"scope\", \"component\", \"scope\" }, probe.DisposalEvents);\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task Cancellation_DoesNotDisposeScopeWhileInitializationStillUsesIt()\n+    {\n+        await using var services = CreateServices();\n+        var probe = services.GetRequiredService<OperationProbe>();\n+        probe.InitializationGate = new(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+        var host = CreateHost<BoundOperation>(services);\n+        using var cancellation = new CancellationTokenSource();\n+\n+        var operation = host.RenderAsync(CreateRequest(\"canceled\", \"not-submitted\"), cancellation.Token);\n+        await probe.InitializationStarted.Task.WaitAsync(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10));\n+        cancellation.Cancel();\n+\n+        Assert.False(operation.IsCompleted);\n+        Assert.Empty(probe.DisposalEvents);\n+\n+        probe.InitializationGate.SetResult();\n+        await Assert.ThrowsAnyAsync<OperationCanceledException>(() => operation);\n+\n+        Assert.Equal(0, probe.Effects);\n+        Assert.Equal(new[] { \"component\", \"scope\" }, probe.DisposalEvents);\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task CacheView_IsTransparentAndExecutesChildrenForEveryOperation()\n+    {\n+        await using var services = CreateServices();\n+        var host = CreateHost<CacheRoot>(services);\n+        var probe = services.GetRequiredService<OperationProbe>();\n+\n+        var first = await host.RenderAsync(CreateRequest(\"first\"));\n+        var second = await host.RenderAsync(CreateRequest(\"second\"));\n+\n+        Assert.Equal(\"cache-child:1\", first.Html);\n+        Assert.Equal(\"cache-child:2\", second.Html);\n+        Assert.Equal(2, probe.CacheChildExecutions);\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task OrdinaryHttpScopes_KeepTheirDefaultComponentServices()\n+    {\n+        await using var services = CreateServices();\n+        await using var httpScope = services.CreateAsyncScope();\n+        await using var mcpScope = services.CreateAsyncScope();\n+        var request = CreateRequest(\"mcp\");\n+        mcpScope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<McpOperationContext>().Initialize(\n+            request, new Uri(\"https://example.test/\"), CancellationToken.None);\n+\n+        Assert.IsNotType<McpNavigationManager>(httpScope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<NavigationManager>());\n+        Assert.IsNotType<McpFormValueMapper>(httpScope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<IFormValueMapper>());\n+        Assert.IsNotType<McpAuthenticationStateProvider>(httpScope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<AuthenticationStateProvider>());\n+        Assert.IsType<McpNavigationManager>(mcpScope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<NavigationManager>());\n+        Assert.IsType<McpFormValueMapper>(mcpScope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<IFormValueMapper>());\n+        var authentication = await mcpScope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<AuthenticationStateProvider>().GetAuthenticationStateAsync();\n+        Assert.Same(request.User, authentication.User);\n+        Assert.Equal(request.Location.AbsoluteUri, mcpScope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<NavigationManager>().Uri);\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task ShellPhase_DefersRequiredDataButDoesNotWeakenFullRendering()\n+    {\n+        await using var services = CreateServices();\n+        var application = new McpComponentApplication(\"required\", typeof(RequiredRoot),\n+            new Uri(\"https://example.test/\"), new Uri(\"https://example.test/form\"));\n+        await using (var shellScope = services.CreateAsyncScope())\n+        {\n+            var result = await shellScope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<McpComponentHost>().RenderAsync(\n+                application, CreateRequest(\"shell\") with { IsShellRendering = true });\n+            Assert.Equal(\"authored-loading\", result.Html);\n+        }\n+\n+        await using (var invalidScope = services.CreateAsyncScope())\n+        {\n+            await Assert.ThrowsAsync<ArgumentNullException>(() =>\n+                invalidScope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<McpComponentHost>().RenderAsync(application, CreateRequest(\"full\")));\n+        }\n+\n+        await using (var fullScope = services.CreateAsyncScope())\n+        {\n+            var result = await fullScope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<McpComponentHost>().RenderAsync(application,\n+                CreateRequest(\"full\"), McpComponentParameters.Capture(new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+                {\n+                    [nameof(RequiredRoot.InitialData)] = \"required-data\",\n+                }));\n+            Assert.Equal(\"required-data\", result.Html);\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class RequiredRoot : ComponentBase\n+    {\n+        [CascadingParameter] private McpComponentRequestContext Context { get; set; } = default!;\n+        [Parameter] public string InitialData { get; set; } = default!;\n+\n+        protected override void OnInitialized()\n+        {\n+            if (!Context.IsShellRendering)\n+            {\n+                ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(InitialData);\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        protected override void BuildRenderTree(RenderTreeBuilder builder)\n+            => builder.AddContent(0, Context.IsShellRendering ? \"authored-loading\" : InitialData);\n+    }\n+\n+    private static ServiceProvider CreateServices()\n+    {\n+        var services = new ServiceCollection();\n+        services.AddSingleton<IConfiguration>(new ConfigurationBuilder().Build());\n+        var environment = new Mock<IWebHostEnvironment>();\n+        environment.SetupGet(value => value.ApplicationName).Returns(nameof(McpComponentHostTests));\n+        environment.SetupGet(value => value.WebRootFileProvider).Returns(new NullFileProvider());\n+        services.AddSingleton(environment.Object);\n+        services.AddMcpComponentServices();\n+        services.AddSingleton<OperationProbe>();\n+        services.AddScoped<ScopeTracker>();\n+        return services.BuildServiceProvider(new ServiceProviderOptions { ValidateScopes = true });\n+    }\n+\n+    private static OperationHost CreateHost<TComponent>(IServiceProvider services) where TComponent : IComponent\n+        => new(services, new McpComponentApplication(\"test\", typeof(TComponent), new Uri(\"https://example.test/\"), new Uri(\"https://example.test/form\")));\n+\n+    private sealed class OperationHost(IServiceProvider services, McpComponentApplication application)\n+    {\n+        public async Task<McpRenderResult> RenderAsync(McpComponentRequest request, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n+        {\n+            await using var scope = services.CreateAsyncScope();\n+            return await scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<McpComponentHost>().RenderAsync(application, request, cancellationToken);\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private static McpComponentRequest CreateRequest(string user, string? name = null)\n+    {\n+        var principal = new ClaimsPrincipal(new ClaimsIdentity([new Claim(ClaimTypes.Name, user)], \"test\"));\n+        return new(new Uri(\"https://example.test/form\"), principal,\n+            name is null ? null : \"operation-form\",\n+            name is null ? null : new Dictionary<string, StringValues> { [\"Input.Name\"] = name });\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class OperationProbe\n+    {\n+        public ConcurrentQueue<Guid> ComponentIds { get; } = new();\n+        public ConcurrentQueue<Guid> ScopeIds { get; } = new();\n+        public ConcurrentQueue<string?> Users { get; } = new();\n+        public ConcurrentQueue<string> InitializedValues { get; } = new();\n+        public ConcurrentQueue<string> DisposalEvents { get; } = new();\n+        public TaskCompletionSource InitializationStarted { get; } = new(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+        public TaskCompletionSource? InitializationGate { get; set; }\n+        public int Effects;\n+        public int CacheChildExecutions;\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class ScopeTracker(OperationProbe probe) : IDisposable\n+    {\n+        public Guid Id { get; } = Guid.NewGuid();\n+\n+        public void Dispose() => probe.DisposalEvents.Enqueue(\"scope\");\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class BoundOperation : ComponentBase, IDisposable\n+    {\n+        private readonly Guid _id = Guid.NewGuid();\n+        private string? _effect;\n+\n+        [Inject] private OperationProbe Probe { get; set; } = default!;\n+        [Inject] private ScopeTracker Scope { get; set; } = default!;\n+        [Inject] private McpOperationContext Context { get; set; } = default!;\n+        [SupplyParameterFromForm] private OperationInput Input { get; set; } = default!;\n+\n+        protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()\n+        {\n+            Input ??= new();\n+            Probe.ComponentIds.Enqueue(_id);\n+            Probe.ScopeIds.Enqueue(Scope.Id);\n+            Probe.Users.Enqueue(Context.Request.User.Identity?.Name);\n+            if (Context.Request.HandlerName is not null)\n+            {\n+                Probe.InitializedValues.Enqueue(Input.Name);\n+            }\n+\n+            Probe.InitializationStarted.TrySetResult();\n+            if (Probe.InitializationGate is { } gate)\n+            {\n+                await gate.Task;\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        protected override void BuildRenderTree(RenderTreeBuilder builder)\n+        {\n+            builder.OpenComponent<EditForm>(0);\n+            builder.AddComponentParameter(1, nameof(EditForm.Model), Input);\n+            builder.AddComponentParameter(2, nameof(EditForm.FormName), \"operation-form\");\n+            builder.AddComponentParameter(3, nameof(EditForm.OnValidSubmit), EventCallback.Factory.Create<EditContext>(this, () =>\n+            {\n+                Interlocked.Increment(ref Probe.Effects);\n+                _effect = Input.Name;\n+            }));\n+            builder.AddComponentParameter(4, nameof(EditForm.ChildContent), (RenderFragment<EditContext>)(_ => content =>\n+            {\n+                content.OpenComponent<DataAnnotationsValidator>(0);\n+                content.CloseComponent();\n+                content.OpenComponent<ValidationSummary>(1);\n+                content.CloseComponent();\n+            }));\n+            builder.CloseComponent();\n+            if (_effect is not null)\n+            {\n+                builder.AddContent(5, $\"effect:{_effect}\");\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        public void Dispose() => Probe.DisposalEvents.Enqueue(\"component\");\n+    }\n+\n+    public sealed class OperationInput\n+    {\n+        [Required]\n+        public string Name { get; set; } = \"\";\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class CacheRoot : ComponentBase\n+    {\n+        protected override void BuildRenderTree(RenderTreeBuilder builder)\n+        {\n+            builder.OpenComponent<CacheView>(0);\n+            builder.AddComponentParameter(1, nameof(CacheView.ChildContent), (RenderFragment)(content =>\n+            {\n+                content.OpenComponent<CacheChild>(0);\n+                content.CloseComponent();\n+            }));\n+            builder.CloseComponent();\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class CacheChild : ComponentBase\n+    {\n+        private int _execution;\n+\n+        [Inject] private OperationProbe Probe { get; set; } = default!;\n+\n+        protected override void OnInitialized() => _execution = Interlocked.Increment(ref Probe.CacheChildExecutions);\n+\n+        protected override void BuildRenderTree(RenderTreeBuilder builder)\n+            => builder.AddContent(0, $\"cache-child:{_execution}\");\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"077107785ae741d0289ba98406cd2d046d475b18","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/test/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Tests.csproj","status":"added","additions":26,"deletions":0,"changes":26,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FMicrosoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Tests.csproj","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FMicrosoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Tests.csproj","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FMicrosoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Tests.csproj?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@\n+<Project Sdk=\"Microsoft.NET.Sdk\">\n+  <PropertyGroup>\n+    <TargetFramework>$(DefaultNetCoreTargetFramework)</TargetFramework>\n+    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>\n+  </PropertyGroup>\n+  <ItemGroup>\n+    <PackageVersion Update=\"Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Abstractions\" Version=\"10.8.3\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Components\\Mcp\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Components\\Endpoints\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Endpoints.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Components\\Web\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Antiforgery\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Antiforgery.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Hosting\\Abstractions\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Hosting.Abstractions.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Hosting\\Hosting\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Hosting.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Hosting\\Server.Abstractions\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Hosting.Server.Abstractions.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Html.Abstractions\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Html.Abstractions.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Http\\Http.Abstractions\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.Abstractions.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Http\\Http.Extensions\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.Extensions.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Http\\Http.Features\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.Features.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Http\\Http\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Http\\Routing.Abstractions\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing.Abstractions.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Http\\Routing\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Middleware\\Diagnostics.Abstractions\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Diagnostics.Abstractions.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Middleware\\Diagnostics\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Diagnostics.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\StaticAssets\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.StaticAssets.csproj\" />\n+  </ItemGroup>\n+</Project>"},{"sha":"9ebeb46876d909d711af25f8caeeaf8049d4233b","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/test/Protocol/McpComponentApplicationTests.cs","status":"added","additions":90,"deletions":0,"changes":90,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentApplicationTests.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentApplicationTests.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentApplicationTests.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,90 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Security.Claims;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Protocol;\n+using ModelContextProtocol;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp;\n+\n+public class McpComponentApplicationTests\n+{\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task Association_UsesTheCurrentPrincipalAndOpaqueViewCapability()\n+    {\n+        var application = CreateApplication(\"first\");\n+        var principal = new ClaimsPrincipal(new ClaimsIdentity(\n+            [new Claim(ClaimTypes.NameIdentifier, \"owner\"), new Claim(ClaimTypes.Role, \"editor\")], \"test\"));\n+        var view = await application.CreateViewAsync(principal, McpComponentParameters.Empty);\n+        var equivalentPrincipal = new ClaimsPrincipal(new ClaimsIdentity(\n+            [new Claim(ClaimTypes.Role, \"editor\"), new Claim(ClaimTypes.NameIdentifier, \"owner\")], \"test\"));\n+        var otherPrincipal = new ClaimsPrincipal(new ClaimsIdentity([new Claim(ClaimTypes.NameIdentifier, \"other\")], \"test\"));\n+\n+        Assert.Same(view, application.GetView(view.Id, equivalentPrincipal));\n+        Assert.Throws<McpException>(() => application.GetView(view.Id, otherPrincipal));\n+        Assert.Throws<McpException>(() => CreateApplication(\"second\").GetView(view.Id, principal));\n+        await application.RemoveViewAsync(view);\n+        Assert.Throws<McpException>(() => application.GetView(view.Id, principal));\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task AnonymousAssociation_DoesNotInventPhysicalClientIdentity()\n+    {\n+        var application = CreateApplication(\"anonymous\");\n+        var view = await application.CreateViewAsync(new ClaimsPrincipal(new ClaimsIdentity()), McpComponentParameters.Empty);\n+\n+        Assert.Same(view, application.GetView(view.Id, new ClaimsPrincipal(new ClaimsIdentity())));\n+        await application.RemoveViewAsync(view);\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task Close_CancelsButWaitsForOutstandingWork()\n+    {\n+        var view = new McpComponentApplication.View(\"owner\", McpComponentParameters.Empty);\n+        var started = new TaskCompletionSource(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+        var release = new TaskCompletionSource(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+        CancellationToken observed = default;\n+        var operation = view.RunAsync(async cancellationToken =>\n+        {\n+            observed = cancellationToken;\n+            started.SetResult();\n+            await release.Task;\n+            cancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n+            return \"finished\";\n+        }, CancellationToken.None);\n+        await started.Task;\n+        var cancellationObserved = new TaskCompletionSource(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+        using var registration = observed.Register(() => cancellationObserved.TrySetResult());\n+\n+        var close = view.CloseAsync();\n+        await cancellationObserved.Task.WaitAsync(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(5));\n+\n+        Assert.True(observed.IsCancellationRequested);\n+        Assert.False(operation.IsCompleted);\n+        Assert.False(close.IsCompleted);\n+        release.SetResult();\n+        await Assert.ThrowsAnyAsync<OperationCanceledException>(() => operation);\n+        await close;\n+        await Assert.ThrowsAsync<McpException>(() => view.RunAsync(_ => Task.FromResult(\"late\"), CancellationToken.None));\n+        Assert.Same(close, view.CloseAsync());\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task OperationFailure_DoesNotRetainACompletedOperation()\n+    {\n+        var view = new McpComponentApplication.View(\"owner\", McpComponentParameters.Empty);\n+        var expected = new InvalidOperationException(\"handler-failure\");\n+\n+        var exception = await Assert.ThrowsAsync<InvalidOperationException>(\n+            () => view.RunAsync<string>(_ => throw expected, CancellationToken.None));\n+\n+        Assert.Same(expected, exception);\n+        Assert.False(view.HasActiveOperations);\n+        await view.CloseAsync();\n+    }\n+\n+    private static McpComponentApplication CreateApplication(string name)\n+        => new(name, typeof(TestComponent), new Uri(\"https://example.test/\"), new Uri(\"https://example.test/form\"));\n+\n+    private sealed class TestComponent : ComponentBase;\n+}"},{"sha":"fd96139c021e48366ed70e2c4e1ba3b04a91ab5f","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/test/Protocol/McpComponentInvocationTests.cs","status":"added","additions":438,"deletions":0,"changes":438,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentInvocationTests.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentInvocationTests.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentInvocationTests.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,438 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Collections.Concurrent;\n+using System.IO.Pipelines;\n+using System.Linq;\n+using System.Text.Json.Nodes;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Forms;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Hosting;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Protocol;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Rendering;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Hosting;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.FileProviders;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Options;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Logging;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Client;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Protocol;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Server;\n+using Moq;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp;\n+\n+public class McpComponentInvocationTests\n+{\n+    [Theory]\n+    [InlineData(false)]\n+    [InlineData(true)]\n+    public async Task ActualSdkOperations_ResolveFreshExecutionPipelineInTheirOwnScope(bool existingTool)\n+    {\n+        var observation = new Observation();\n+        await using var services = CreateServices(observation, existingTool);\n+        var input = new Pipe();\n+        var output = new Pipe();\n+        await using var server = McpServer.Create(new StreamServerTransport(input.Reader.AsStream(), output.Writer.AsStream()),\n+            services.GetRequiredService<IOptions<McpServerOptions>>().Value, services.GetRequiredService<ILoggerFactory>(), services);\n+        using var lifetime = new CancellationTokenSource();\n+        var serverTask = server.RunAsync(lifetime.Token);\n+        try\n+        {\n+            await using var client = await McpClient.CreateAsync(new StreamClientTransport(input.Writer.AsStream(), output.Reader.AsStream()));\n+            var opened = await client.CallToolAsync(existingTool ? \"existing\" : \"lifecycle\");\n+            Assert.False(opened.IsError == true, string.Join(\"\\n\", observation.Errors));\n+            var view = opened.Meta![\"blazor\"]!.AsObject();\n+            var first = ReadScope(view);\n+            var posted = await client.CallToolAsync(\"lifecycle_dispatch\", new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+            {\n+                [\"viewId\"] = view[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"location\"] = view[\"location\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"method\"] = \"POST\",\n+                [\"fields\"] = new Dictionary<string, string[]> { [\"_handler\"] = [\"save\"], [\"Input.Value\"] = [\"saved\"] },\n+            });\n+            Assert.False(posted.IsError == true, string.Join(\"\\n\", posted.Content.OfType<TextContentBlock>().Select(block => block.Text)));\n+            var second = ReadScope(posted.Meta![\"blazor\"]!.AsObject());\n+            Assert.Contains(\"saved\", posted.Meta![\"blazor\"]![\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+            var fresh = await client.CallToolAsync(\"lifecycle_dispatch\", new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+            {\n+                [\"viewId\"] = view[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"location\"] = view[\"location\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"method\"] = \"GET\",\n+            });\n+            Assert.False(fresh.IsError == true);\n+            var third = ReadScope(fresh.Meta![\"blazor\"]!.AsObject());\n+            Assert.Equal(3, new[] { first, second, third }.Distinct().Count());\n+            Assert.Equal(new[] { \"component\", \"scope\", \"component\", \"scope\", \"component\", \"scope\" }, observation.Disposal);\n+            Assert.Equal(new[] { \"\", \"saved\", \"\" }, observation.InitialValues);\n+            Assert.Equal(1, observation.Effects);\n+            Assert.Equal(existingTool ? 1 : 0, observation.Openings);\n+            Assert.Equal(existingTool ? 1 : 0, observation.Projections);\n+            if (existingTool)\n+            {\n+                Assert.Equal(first, Assert.Single(observation.ProjectedScopes));\n+            }\n+            Assert.Equal(3, observation.Hosts.Count);\n+            Assert.Equal(3, observation.Hosts.Distinct(ReferenceEqualityComparer.Instance).Count());\n+            Assert.Equal(3, observation.Invokers.Count);\n+            Assert.Equal(3, observation.Invokers.Distinct(ReferenceEqualityComparer.Instance).Count());\n+            Assert.Contains(\"effect:1 value:\", fresh.Meta![\"blazor\"]![\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+            await client.CallToolAsync(\"lifecycle_dispatch\", new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+            {\n+                [\"viewId\"] = view[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"method\"] = \"CLOSE\",\n+            });\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            lifetime.Cancel();\n+            await serverTask;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task ActualSdkClose_WaitsForTheEntireInvocationScopeToFinishDisposing()\n+    {\n+        var observation = new Observation();\n+        await using var services = CreateServices(observation, existingTool: false);\n+        var input = new Pipe();\n+        var output = new Pipe();\n+        await using var server = McpServer.Create(new StreamServerTransport(input.Reader.AsStream(), output.Writer.AsStream()),\n+            services.GetRequiredService<IOptions<McpServerOptions>>().Value, services.GetRequiredService<ILoggerFactory>(), services);\n+        using var lifetime = new CancellationTokenSource();\n+        var serverTask = server.RunAsync(lifetime.Token);\n+        try\n+        {\n+            await using var client = await McpClient.CreateAsync(new StreamClientTransport(input.Writer.AsStream(), output.Reader.AsStream()));\n+            var opened = await client.CallToolAsync(\"lifecycle\");\n+            Assert.False(opened.IsError == true);\n+            var view = opened.Meta![\"blazor\"]!.AsObject();\n+            var posted = client.CallToolAsync(\"lifecycle_dispatch\", new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+            {\n+                [\"viewId\"] = view[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"location\"] = view[\"location\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"method\"] = \"POST\",\n+                [\"fields\"] = new Dictionary<string, string[]> { [\"_handler\"] = [\"save\"], [\"Input.Value\"] = [\"pending\"] },\n+            }).AsTask();\n+            await observation.ActionStarted.Task.WaitAsync(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10));\n+            var close = client.CallToolAsync(\"lifecycle_dispatch\", new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+            {\n+                [\"viewId\"] = view[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"method\"] = \"CLOSE\",\n+            }).AsTask();\n+            await observation.ActionCancellationObserved.Task.WaitAsync(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10));\n+\n+            Assert.False(posted.IsCompleted);\n+            Assert.False(close.IsCompleted);\n+            Assert.Equal(new[] { \"component\", \"scope\" }, observation.Disposal);\n+            observation.ActionRelease.SetResult();\n+            await observation.ScopeDisposalStarted.Task.WaitAsync(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10));\n+\n+            Assert.False(posted.IsCompleted);\n+            Assert.False(close.IsCompleted);\n+            Assert.Equal(new[] { \"component\", \"scope\", \"component\" }, observation.Disposal);\n+            observation.ScopeDisposalRelease.SetResult();\n+            await posted.WaitAsync(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10));\n+            var closed = await close.WaitAsync(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10));\n+\n+            Assert.False(closed.IsError == true);\n+            Assert.Equal(0, observation.Effects);\n+            Assert.Equal(new[] { \"component\", \"scope\", \"component\", \"scope\", \"scope\" }, observation.Disposal);\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            observation.ActionRelease.TrySetResult();\n+            observation.ScopeDisposalRelease.TrySetResult();\n+            lifetime.Cancel();\n+            await serverTask;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task ActualSdkResourceReads_RenderFreshScopedShellsWithoutOpeningOrProjection()\n+    {\n+        var observation = new Observation();\n+        await using var services = CreateServices(observation, existingTool: true);\n+        var input = new Pipe();\n+        var output = new Pipe();\n+        await using var server = McpServer.Create(new StreamServerTransport(input.Reader.AsStream(), output.Writer.AsStream()),\n+            services.GetRequiredService<IOptions<McpServerOptions>>().Value, services.GetRequiredService<ILoggerFactory>(), services);\n+        using var lifetime = new CancellationTokenSource();\n+        var serverTask = server.RunAsync(lifetime.Token);\n+        try\n+        {\n+            await using var client = await McpClient.CreateAsync(new StreamClientTransport(input.Writer.AsStream(), output.Reader.AsStream()));\n+            var first = Assert.IsType<TextResourceContents>(Assert.Single((await client.ReadResourceAsync(\"ui://blazor/lifecycle\")).Contents));\n+            var second = Assert.IsType<TextResourceContents>(Assert.Single((await client.ReadResourceAsync(\"ui://blazor/lifecycle\")).Contents));\n+            Assert.Contains(\"shell:True\", first.Text);\n+            Assert.Contains(\"shell:True\", second.Text);\n+            Assert.NotEqual(first.Text, second.Text);\n+            Assert.Equal(2, observation.Hosts.Distinct(ReferenceEqualityComparer.Instance).Count());\n+            Assert.Empty(observation.Invokers);\n+            Assert.Equal(0, observation.Openings);\n+            Assert.Equal(0, observation.Projections);\n+            Assert.Equal(0, observation.Effects);\n+            Assert.Equal(new[] { \"component\", \"scope\", \"component\", \"scope\" }, observation.Disposal);\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            lifetime.Cancel();\n+            await serverTask;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    [Theory]\n+    [InlineData(false)]\n+    [InlineData(true)]\n+    public async Task ActualSdkOpening_WaitsForInitializationAndInvocationScopeDisposal(bool existingTool)\n+    {\n+        var observation = new Observation\n+        {\n+            InitializationRelease = new(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously),\n+        };\n+        await using var services = CreateServices(observation, existingTool);\n+        var input = new Pipe();\n+        var output = new Pipe();\n+        await using var server = McpServer.Create(new StreamServerTransport(input.Reader.AsStream(), output.Writer.AsStream()),\n+            services.GetRequiredService<IOptions<McpServerOptions>>().Value, services.GetRequiredService<ILoggerFactory>(), services);\n+        using var lifetime = new CancellationTokenSource();\n+        var serverTask = server.RunAsync(lifetime.Token);\n+        try\n+        {\n+            await using var client = await McpClient.CreateAsync(new StreamClientTransport(input.Writer.AsStream(), output.Reader.AsStream()));\n+            var opening = client.CallToolAsync(existingTool ? \"existing\" : \"lifecycle\").AsTask();\n+            await observation.InitializationStarted.Task.WaitAsync(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10));\n+\n+            Assert.False(opening.IsCompleted);\n+            Assert.Empty(observation.Disposal);\n+            Assert.Single(observation.Hosts);\n+            Assert.Single(observation.Invokers);\n+            Assert.Equal(existingTool ? 1 : 0, observation.Projections);\n+            observation.InitializationRelease.SetResult();\n+            await observation.ScopeDisposalStarted.Task.WaitAsync(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10));\n+\n+            Assert.False(opening.IsCompleted);\n+            Assert.Equal(new[] { \"component\" }, observation.Disposal);\n+            observation.ScopeDisposalRelease.SetResult();\n+            var opened = await opening.WaitAsync(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10));\n+\n+            Assert.False(opened.IsError == true);\n+            Assert.Equal(new[] { \"component\", \"scope\" }, observation.Disposal);\n+            var view = opened.Meta![\"blazor\"]!.AsObject();\n+            await client.CallToolAsync(\"lifecycle_dispatch\", new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+            {\n+                [\"viewId\"] = view[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"method\"] = \"CLOSE\",\n+            });\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            observation.InitializationRelease.TrySetResult();\n+            observation.ScopeDisposalRelease.TrySetResult();\n+            lifetime.Cancel();\n+            await serverTask;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private static Guid ReadScope(JsonObject view)\n+    {\n+        var html = view[\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>();\n+        const string prefix = \"scope:\";\n+        var start = html.IndexOf(prefix, StringComparison.Ordinal) + prefix.Length;\n+        return Guid.Parse(html.Substring(start, 36));\n+    }\n+\n+    private static ServiceProvider CreateServices(Observation observation, bool existingTool)\n+    {\n+        var services = new ServiceCollection();\n+        services.AddSingleton<IConfiguration>(new ConfigurationBuilder().Build());\n+        var environment = new Mock<IWebHostEnvironment>();\n+        environment.SetupGet(value => value.ApplicationName).Returns(nameof(McpComponentInvocationTests));\n+        environment.SetupGet(value => value.WebRootFileProvider).Returns(new NullFileProvider());\n+        services.AddSingleton(environment.Object);\n+        services.AddSingleton(observation);\n+        services.AddLogging(builder => builder.AddProvider(new CaptureLogger(observation)));\n+        services.AddScoped<ScopeProbe>();\n+        var builder = services.AddMcpServer();\n+        if (existingTool)\n+        {\n+            builder.WithTools([McpServerTool.Create(() =>\n+            {\n+                observation.Openings++;\n+                return \"initial\";\n+            }, new() { Name = \"existing\" })])\n+                .WithRazorComponents<InvocationComponent>(\"existing\", _ =>\n+                {\n+                    var scope = Assert.IsType<ScopeProbe>(observation.ActivationScope.Value);\n+                    Assert.False(scope.Disposed);\n+                    observation.ProjectedScopes.Enqueue(scope.Id);\n+                    observation.Projections++;\n+                    return new Dictionary<string, object?>();\n+                }, Configure);\n+        }\n+        else\n+        {\n+            builder.WithRazorComponents<InvocationComponent>(Configure);\n+        }\n+\n+        services.AddScoped(provider =>\n+        {\n+            provider.GetRequiredService<ScopeProbe>();\n+            var host = new McpComponentHost(provider);\n+            observation.Hosts.Enqueue(host);\n+            provider.GetRequiredService<ScopeProbe>().Host = host;\n+            return host;\n+        });\n+        var invokerDescriptor = services.Single(descriptor => descriptor.ServiceType == typeof(McpComponentInvoker));\n+        services.Remove(invokerDescriptor);\n+        services.AddKeyedScoped<McpComponentInvoker>(invokerDescriptor.ServiceKey, (provider, key) =>\n+        {\n+            var invoker = (McpComponentInvoker)invokerDescriptor.KeyedImplementationFactory!(provider, key);\n+            observation.Invokers.Enqueue(invoker);\n+            var scope = provider.GetRequiredService<ScopeProbe>();\n+            scope.Invoker = invoker;\n+            observation.ActivationScope.Value = scope;\n+            return invoker;\n+        });\n+        return services.BuildServiceProvider(new ServiceProviderOptions { ValidateScopes = true });\n+\n+        static void Configure(RazorComponentMcpOptions options)\n+        {\n+            options.Name = \"lifecycle\";\n+            options.BaseUri = new Uri(\"https://example.test/\");\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class Observation\n+    {\n+        public ConcurrentQueue<McpComponentHost> Hosts { get; } = new();\n+        public ConcurrentQueue<McpComponentInvoker> Invokers { get; } = new();\n+        public ConcurrentQueue<string> Disposal { get; } = new();\n+        public ConcurrentQueue<string> InitialValues { get; } = new();\n+        public AsyncLocal<ScopeProbe?> ActivationScope { get; } = new();\n+        public ConcurrentQueue<Guid> ProjectedScopes { get; } = new();\n+        public TaskCompletionSource ActionStarted { get; } = new(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+        public TaskCompletionSource InitializationStarted { get; } = new(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+        public TaskCompletionSource? InitializationRelease { get; init; }\n+        public TaskCompletionSource ActionRelease { get; } = new(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+        public TaskCompletionSource ActionCancellationObserved { get; } = new(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+        public TaskCompletionSource ScopeDisposalStarted { get; } = new(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+        public TaskCompletionSource ScopeDisposalRelease { get; } = new(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+        public Guid PendingScopeId;\n+        public int Effects;\n+        public int Openings;\n+        public int Projections;\n+        public ConcurrentQueue<string> Errors { get; } = new();\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class ScopeProbe(Observation observation) : IAsyncDisposable\n+    {\n+        public Guid Id { get; } = Guid.NewGuid();\n+        public McpComponentHost Host { get; set; } = default!;\n+        public McpComponentInvoker Invoker { get; set; } = default!;\n+        public bool Disposed { get; private set; }\n+\n+        public async ValueTask DisposeAsync()\n+        {\n+            if (Id == observation.PendingScopeId)\n+            {\n+                observation.ScopeDisposalStarted.SetResult();\n+                await observation.ScopeDisposalRelease.Task;\n+            }\n+\n+            Disposed = true;\n+            observation.Disposal.Enqueue(\"scope\");\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class InvocationComponent : ComponentBase, IDisposable\n+    {\n+        [Inject] private ScopeProbe Scope { get; set; } = default!;\n+        [Inject] private IServiceProvider Services { get; set; } = default!;\n+        [Inject] private McpComponentRequestContext Context { get; set; } = default!;\n+        [CascadingParameter] private McpComponentRequestContext CascadedContext { get; set; } = default!;\n+        [Inject] private NavigationManager Navigation { get; set; } = default!;\n+        [Inject] private Observation Observation { get; set; } = default!;\n+        [SupplyParameterFromForm] private InputModel Input { get; set; } = default!;\n+\n+        protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()\n+        {\n+            Input ??= new();\n+            Assert.Same(Scope.Host, Services.GetRequiredService<McpComponentHost>());\n+            Assert.Same(Context, CascadedContext);\n+            if (Context.IsShellRendering)\n+            {\n+                Assert.True(Context.IsActive);\n+                Assert.Equal(Context.Location.AbsoluteUri, Navigation.Uri);\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            var application = Services.GetServices<McpComponentApplication>().Single();\n+            Assert.Same(Scope.Invoker, Services.GetRequiredKeyedService<McpComponentInvoker>(application));\n+            Assert.True(Context.IsActive);\n+            Assert.Equal(Context.Location.AbsoluteUri, Navigation.Uri);\n+            Observation.InitialValues.Enqueue(Input.Value);\n+            if (Observation.InitializationRelease is { } release)\n+            {\n+                Observation.PendingScopeId = Scope.Id;\n+                Observation.InitializationStarted.SetResult();\n+                await release.Task;\n+                Assert.False(Scope.Disposed);\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        protected override void BuildRenderTree(RenderTreeBuilder builder)\n+        {\n+            if (Context.IsShellRendering)\n+            {\n+                builder.AddContent(0, $\"shell:{Context.IsShellRendering} scope:{Scope.Id}\");\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            builder.AddContent(0, $\"scope:{Scope.Id} effect:{Observation.Effects} value:{Input.Value}\");\n+            builder.OpenComponent<EditForm>(1);\n+            builder.AddComponentParameter(2, nameof(EditForm.Model), Input);\n+            builder.AddComponentParameter(3, nameof(EditForm.FormName), \"save\");\n+            builder.AddComponentParameter(4, nameof(EditForm.OnSubmit), EventCallback.Factory.Create<EditContext>(this, SubmitAsync));\n+            builder.AddComponentParameter(5, nameof(EditForm.ChildContent), (RenderFragment<EditContext>)(_ => _ => { }));\n+            builder.CloseComponent();\n+        }\n+\n+        public void Dispose() => Observation.Disposal.Enqueue(\"component\");\n+\n+        private async Task SubmitAsync()\n+        {\n+            if (Input.Value == \"pending\")\n+            {\n+                Observation.PendingScopeId = Scope.Id;\n+                using var registration = Context.CancellationToken.Register(() => Observation.ActionCancellationObserved.TrySetResult());\n+                Observation.ActionStarted.SetResult();\n+                await Observation.ActionRelease.Task;\n+                Assert.False(Scope.Disposed);\n+                Context.CancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n+            }\n+\n+            Observation.Effects++;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    public sealed class InputModel\n+    {\n+        public string Value { get; set; } = \"\";\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class CaptureLogger(Observation observation) : ILoggerProvider, ILogger\n+    {\n+        public ILogger CreateLogger(string categoryName) => this;\n+        public void Dispose() { }\n+        public IDisposable? BeginScope<TState>(TState state) where TState : notnull => null;\n+        public bool IsEnabled(LogLevel logLevel) => logLevel >= LogLevel.Error;\n+        public void Log<TState>(LogLevel logLevel, EventId eventId, TState state, Exception? exception, Func<TState, Exception?, string> formatter)\n+        {\n+            if (logLevel >= LogLevel.Error)\n+            {\n+                observation.Errors.Enqueue(exception?.ToString() ?? formatter(state, exception));\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"4527eef3efa38f3faf3b46bf986d042101f61361","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/test/Protocol/McpComponentParametersTests.cs","status":"added","additions":65,"deletions":0,"changes":65,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentParametersTests.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentParametersTests.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentParametersTests.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,65 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Protocol;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp;\n+\n+public class McpComponentParametersTests\n+{\n+    [Fact]\n+    public void Capture_FreezesDataAndRestoresIndependentInstances()\n+    {\n+        var original = new ParameterModel { Name = \"original\", Values = [17, 29] };\n+        var snapshot = McpComponentParameters.Capture(new Dictionary<string, object?> { [\"Model\"] = original, [\"Optional\"] = null });\n+        original.Name = \"changed\";\n+        original.Values.Clear();\n+\n+        var first = snapshot.Restore();\n+        var firstModel = Assert.IsType<ParameterModel>(first[\"Model\"]);\n+        firstModel.Name = \"first-only\";\n+        firstModel.Values.Add(41);\n+        var second = snapshot.Restore();\n+        var secondModel = Assert.IsType<ParameterModel>(second[\"Model\"]);\n+\n+        Assert.NotSame(original, firstModel);\n+        Assert.NotSame(firstModel, secondModel);\n+        Assert.Equal(\"original\", secondModel.Name);\n+        Assert.Equal(new[] { 17, 29 }, secondModel.Values);\n+        Assert.Null(second[\"Optional\"]);\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public void Capture_RejectsCaseInsensitiveDuplicateParameters()\n+    {\n+        Assert.Throws<ArgumentException>(() => McpComponentParameters.Capture(\n+            new Dictionary<string, object?> { [\"Name\"] = \"first\", [\"name\"] = \"second\" }));\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public void Capture_RejectsComponentAndDelegateState()\n+    {\n+        Assert.Throws<ArgumentException>(() => McpComponentParameters.Capture(\n+            new Dictionary<string, object?> { [\"Component\"] = new TestComponent() }));\n+        Assert.Throws<ArgumentException>(() => McpComponentParameters.Capture(\n+            new Dictionary<string, object?> { [\"Callback\"] = (Action)(() => { }) }));\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public void Capture_RejectsServiceProviders()\n+    {\n+        using var services = new ServiceCollection().BuildServiceProvider();\n+\n+        Assert.Throws<ArgumentException>(() => McpComponentParameters.Capture(\n+            new Dictionary<string, object?> { [\"Services\"] = services }));\n+    }\n+\n+    public sealed class ParameterModel\n+    {\n+        public string Name { get; set; } = \"\";\n+        public List<int> Values { get; set; } = [];\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class TestComponent : ComponentBase;\n+}"},{"sha":"825967755a436eb6d7d388e6b6f5f64bea96781f","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/test/Protocol/McpComponentRegistrationTests.cs","status":"added","additions":82,"deletions":0,"changes":82,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentRegistrationTests.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentRegistrationTests.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FProtocol%2FMcpComponentRegistrationTests.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,82 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Text.Json.Nodes;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Options;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Server;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp;\n+\n+public class McpComponentRegistrationTests\n+{\n+    [Fact]\n+    public void ExistingToolAssociation_PreservesTheRegisteredPrimitiveAndSchema()\n+    {\n+        var services = new ServiceCollection();\n+        var tool = McpServerTool.Create((string value) => value, new() { Name = \"open\" });\n+        var other = McpServerTool.Create(() => \"other\", new() { Name = \"other\" });\n+        var metadata = new JsonObject { [\"business\"] = \"preserved\" };\n+        tool.ProtocolTool.Meta = metadata;\n+        other.ProtocolTool.Meta = metadata;\n+        var schema = tool.ProtocolTool.InputSchema.GetRawText();\n+        services.AddMcpServer().WithTools([tool, other])\n+            .WithRazorComponents<TestComponent>(\"open\", _ => new Dictionary<string, object?>(),\n+                options => options.BaseUri = new Uri(\"https://example.test/\"));\n+        using var provider = services.BuildServiceProvider();\n+\n+        var options = provider.GetRequiredService<IOptions<McpServerOptions>>().Value;\n+\n+        Assert.Same(tool, Assert.Single(options.ToolCollection!, candidate => candidate.ProtocolTool.Name == \"open\"));\n+        Assert.Equal(schema, tool.ProtocolTool.InputSchema.GetRawText());\n+        Assert.Equal(\"preserved\", tool.ProtocolTool.Meta![\"business\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+        Assert.NotNull(tool.ProtocolTool.Meta[\"ui\"]![\"resourceUri\"]);\n+        Assert.Null(other.ProtocolTool.Meta![\"ui\"]);\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public void MissingOpeningTool_FailsExplicitly()\n+    {\n+        var services = new ServiceCollection();\n+        services.AddMcpServer().WithRazorComponents<TestComponent>(\"missing\",\n+            _ => new Dictionary<string, object?>(), options => options.BaseUri = new Uri(\"https://example.test/\"));\n+        using var provider = services.BuildServiceProvider();\n+\n+        var exception = Assert.Throws<InvalidOperationException>(() => provider.GetRequiredService<IOptions<McpServerOptions>>().Value);\n+\n+        Assert.Contains(\"missing\", exception.Message);\n+        Assert.Contains(\"exactly once\", exception.Message);\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public void DifferentToolsWithTheSameOpeningName_AreNotSilentlyDeduplicated()\n+    {\n+        var services = new ServiceCollection();\n+        services.AddMcpServer().WithTools(\n+            [McpServerTool.Create(() => \"first\", new() { Name = \"open\" }), McpServerTool.Create(() => \"second\", new() { Name = \"open\" })])\n+            .WithRazorComponents<TestComponent>(\"open\", _ => new Dictionary<string, object?>(),\n+                options => options.BaseUri = new Uri(\"https://example.test/\"));\n+        using var provider = services.BuildServiceProvider();\n+\n+        var exception = Assert.Throws<InvalidOperationException>(() => provider.GetRequiredService<IOptions<McpServerOptions>>().Value);\n+\n+        Assert.Contains(\"Multiple MCP tools\", exception.Message);\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public void TheSameSdkToolInstanceCanAlreadyBeRegisteredMoreThanOnce()\n+    {\n+        var services = new ServiceCollection();\n+        var tool = McpServerTool.Create(() => \"value\", new() { Name = \"open\" });\n+        services.AddMcpServer().WithTools([tool, tool])\n+            .WithRazorComponents<TestComponent>(\"open\", _ => new Dictionary<string, object?>(),\n+                options => options.BaseUri = new Uri(\"https://example.test/\"));\n+        using var provider = services.BuildServiceProvider();\n+\n+        var options = provider.GetRequiredService<IOptions<McpServerOptions>>().Value;\n+\n+        Assert.Single(options.ToolCollection!, candidate => candidate.ProtocolTool.Name == \"open\");\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class TestComponent : ComponentBase;\n+}"},{"sha":"1e6060d5f2ca6ddc49bd4fc33684a302e5dfb760","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/test/Rendering/McpHtmlRendererTests.cs","status":"added","additions":233,"deletions":0,"changes":233,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FRendering%2FMcpHtmlRendererTests.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FRendering%2FMcpHtmlRendererTests.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftest%2FRendering%2FMcpHtmlRendererTests.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,233 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Linq;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Endpoints.FormMapping;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Forms;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Forms.Mapping;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.FormMapping;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.Rendering;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Rendering;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Logging;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives;\n+\n+namespace Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp;\n+\n+public class McpHtmlRendererTests\n+{\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task NamedEditForm_BindsDuringInitialization_AndDispatchesItsActualCallback()\n+    {\n+        await using var services = CreateServices();\n+        await using var scope = services.CreateAsyncScope();\n+        var probe = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<Probe>();\n+        scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<McpFormDataProvider>().Initialize(\n+            \"submit\", new Dictionary<string, StringValues>\n+            {\n+                [\"Input.Name\"] = \"bound-name\",\n+                [\"Input.Values[0]\"] = \"17\",\n+                [\"Input.Values[1]\"] = \"29\",\n+            }, new FormFileCollection());\n+        await using var renderer = CreateRenderer(scope.ServiceProvider);\n+\n+        await renderer.Dispatcher.InvokeAsync(async () =>\n+        {\n+            var root = renderer.BeginRenderingComponent(typeof(BoundForm), ParameterView.Empty);\n+            await root.QuiescenceTask;\n+            Assert.Equal(\"bound-name\", probe.InitializedName);\n+            Assert.Equal(new[] { 17, 29 }, probe.InitializedValues);\n+            Assert.Contains(\"name=\\\"_handler\\\" value=\\\"submit\\\"\", root.ToHtmlString());\n+            Assert.Equal(0, probe.SubmitCount);\n+\n+            await renderer.DispatchSubmitAsync(\"submit\");\n+\n+            Assert.Equal(1, probe.SubmitCount);\n+            Assert.Equal(\"bound-name\", probe.SubmittedName);\n+            Assert.Contains(\"submitted:bound-name\", root.ToHtmlString());\n+            Assert.Equal(0, probe.AfterRenderCount);\n+        });\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task AsyncFormProducer_IsDiscoverableAfterQuiescence()\n+    {\n+        await using var services = CreateServices();\n+        await using var scope = services.CreateAsyncScope();\n+        var probe = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<Probe>();\n+        probe.InitializationGate = new(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+        await using var renderer = CreateRenderer(scope.ServiceProvider);\n+\n+        var root = await renderer.Dispatcher.InvokeAsync(\n+            () => renderer.BeginRenderingComponent(typeof(BoundForm), ParameterView.Empty));\n+        Assert.False(root.QuiescenceTask.IsCompleted);\n+        await renderer.Dispatcher.InvokeAsync(async () =>\n+        {\n+            await Assert.ThrowsAsync<McpFormSubmissionException>(() => renderer.DispatchSubmitAsync(\"submit\"));\n+        });\n+\n+        probe.InitializationGate.SetResult();\n+        await root.QuiescenceTask;\n+        await renderer.Dispatcher.InvokeAsync(() => renderer.DispatchSubmitAsync(\"submit\"));\n+\n+        Assert.Equal(1, probe.SubmitCount);\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task MissingNamedForm_DoesNotInvokeAnotherCallback()\n+    {\n+        await using var services = CreateServices();\n+        await using var scope = services.CreateAsyncScope();\n+        var probe = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<Probe>();\n+        await using var renderer = CreateRenderer(scope.ServiceProvider);\n+\n+        await renderer.Dispatcher.InvokeAsync(async () =>\n+        {\n+            var root = renderer.BeginRenderingComponent(typeof(BoundForm), ParameterView.Empty);\n+            await root.QuiescenceTask;\n+\n+            var exception = await Assert.ThrowsAsync<McpFormSubmissionException>(() => renderer.DispatchSubmitAsync(\"missing\"));\n+\n+            Assert.Contains(\"no form on the page\", exception.Message);\n+            Assert.Equal(0, probe.SubmitCount);\n+        });\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task AmbiguousNamedForm_IsAnApplicationError()\n+    {\n+        await using var services = CreateServices();\n+        await using var scope = services.CreateAsyncScope();\n+        var probe = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<Probe>();\n+        await using var renderer = CreateRenderer(scope.ServiceProvider);\n+\n+        await renderer.Dispatcher.InvokeAsync(async () =>\n+        {\n+            var root = renderer.BeginRenderingComponent(typeof(DuplicateForms), ParameterView.Empty);\n+            await root.QuiescenceTask;\n+\n+            var exception = await Assert.ThrowsAsync<InvalidOperationException>(() => renderer.DispatchSubmitAsync(\"submit\"));\n+\n+            Assert.Contains(\"more than one named submit event\", exception.Message);\n+            Assert.Equal(0, probe.SubmitCount);\n+        });\n+    }\n+\n+    [Fact]\n+    public async Task DisposingRenderer_DisposesItsComponentTree()\n+    {\n+        await using var services = CreateServices();\n+        await using var scope = services.CreateAsyncScope();\n+        var probe = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<Probe>();\n+        var renderer = CreateRenderer(scope.ServiceProvider);\n+        await renderer.Dispatcher.InvokeAsync(async () =>\n+        {\n+            var root = renderer.BeginRenderingComponent(typeof(BoundForm), ParameterView.Empty);\n+            await root.QuiescenceTask;\n+        });\n+\n+        await renderer.DisposeAsync();\n+\n+        Assert.Equal(1, probe.DisposeCount);\n+        Assert.Equal(0, probe.SubmitCount);\n+    }\n+\n+    private static ServiceProvider CreateServices()\n+    {\n+        var services = new ServiceCollection();\n+        services.AddLogging();\n+        services.AddScoped<Probe>();\n+        services.AddScoped<McpFormDataProvider>();\n+        services.AddScoped(_ => new FormDataMapperOptions());\n+        services.AddScoped<IFormValueMapper, McpFormValueMapper>();\n+        services.AddSupplyValueFromFormProvider();\n+        services.AddScoped<NavigationManager, TestNavigationManager>();\n+        return services.BuildServiceProvider();\n+    }\n+\n+    private static McpHtmlRenderer CreateRenderer(IServiceProvider services)\n+        => new(services, services.GetRequiredService<ILoggerFactory>());\n+\n+    private sealed class TestNavigationManager : NavigationManager\n+    {\n+        public TestNavigationManager() => Initialize(\"https://example.test/\", \"https://example.test/form\");\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class Probe\n+    {\n+        public TaskCompletionSource? InitializationGate { get; set; }\n+        public string? InitializedName { get; set; }\n+        public int[] InitializedValues { get; set; } = [];\n+        public int SubmitCount { get; set; }\n+        public string? SubmittedName { get; set; }\n+        public int AfterRenderCount { get; set; }\n+        public int DisposeCount { get; set; }\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class BoundForm : ComponentBase, IDisposable\n+    {\n+        private bool _ready;\n+        private string? _submittedName;\n+\n+        [Inject] private Probe Probe { get; set; } = default!;\n+        [SupplyParameterFromForm] private InputModel Input { get; set; } = default!;\n+\n+        protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()\n+        {\n+            Input ??= new();\n+            Probe.InitializedName = Input.Name;\n+            Probe.InitializedValues = Input.Values.ToArray();\n+            if (Probe.InitializationGate is { } gate)\n+            {\n+                await gate.Task;\n+            }\n+\n+            _ready = true;\n+        }\n+\n+        protected override void OnAfterRender(bool firstRender) => Probe.AfterRenderCount++;\n+\n+        protected override void BuildRenderTree(RenderTreeBuilder builder)\n+        {\n+            if (!_ready)\n+            {\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            builder.OpenComponent<EditForm>(0);\n+            builder.AddComponentParameter(1, nameof(EditForm.Model), Input);\n+            builder.AddComponentParameter(2, nameof(EditForm.FormName), \"submit\");\n+            builder.AddComponentParameter(3, nameof(EditForm.OnValidSubmit), EventCallback.Factory.Create<EditContext>(this, () =>\n+            {\n+                Probe.SubmitCount++;\n+                Probe.SubmittedName = Input.Name;\n+                _submittedName = Input.Name;\n+            }));\n+            builder.CloseComponent();\n+            if (_submittedName is not null)\n+            {\n+                builder.AddContent(4, $\"submitted:{_submittedName}\");\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        public void Dispose() => Probe.DisposeCount++;\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class DuplicateForms : ComponentBase\n+    {\n+        protected override void BuildRenderTree(RenderTreeBuilder builder)\n+        {\n+            builder.OpenComponent<BoundForm>(0);\n+            builder.CloseComponent();\n+            builder.OpenComponent<BoundForm>(1);\n+            builder.CloseComponent();\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    public sealed class InputModel\n+    {\n+        public string Name { get; set; } = \"\";\n+        public List<int> Values { get; set; } = [];\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"4f7774c8d1cbba742895b18603aa968efc4e8cd9","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests/Components.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests.csproj","status":"added","additions":38,"deletions":0,"changes":38,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests.csproj","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests.csproj","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests.csproj?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,38 @@\n+<Project Sdk=\"Microsoft.NET.Sdk\">\n+  <Import Project=\"../../../Testing/eng/targets/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Testing.props\" />\n+\n+  <PropertyGroup>\n+    <TargetFramework>$(DefaultNetCoreTargetFramework)</TargetFramework>\n+    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>\n+    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>\n+    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>\n+    <EnableMSTestRunner>true</EnableMSTestRunner>\n+    <TestRunnerName>Microsoft.Testing.Platform</TestRunnerName>\n+    <TestCaptureOutput>false</TestCaptureOutput>\n+    <TestDependsOnPlaywright>true</TestDependsOnPlaywright>\n+    <TestRunnerAdditionalArguments>--timeout 15m --maximum-failed-tests 25 --minimum-expected-tests 1 --filter \"TestCategory!=Quarantined\"</TestRunnerAdditionalArguments>\n+    <IsPackable>false</IsPackable>\n+    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);NETSDK1023;MSTEST0001</NoWarn>\n+  </PropertyGroup>\n+\n+  <ItemGroup>\n+    <PackageVersion Update=\"Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Abstractions\" Version=\"10.8.3\" />\n+    <PackageReference Include=\"Microsoft.Playwright\" />\n+    <PackageReference Include=\"Microsoft.Testing.Extensions.TrxReport\" />\n+    <PackageReference Include=\"MSTest.TestFramework\" />\n+    <PackageReference Include=\"MSTest.TestAdapter\" />\n+    <PackageReference Include=\"ModelContextProtocol\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Components\\Mcp\\testassets\\Components.McpTestApp\\Components.McpTestApp.csproj\" E2EApp=\"true\" E2EAppMode=\"publish\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Components\\Testing\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Testing.csproj\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Components\\Testing\\gen\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Testing.Generators.csproj\"\n+                      OutputItemType=\"Analyzer\" ReferenceOutputAssembly=\"false\" />\n+  </ItemGroup>\n+\n+  <Import Project=\"../../../Testing/eng/targets/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Testing.targets\"\n+          Condition=\"'$(_ImportComponentsTestingTargets)' == 'true'\" />\n+\n+  <Target Name=\"_PreparePublishedE2EApps\" AfterTargets=\"Publish\" Condition=\"'$(_ImportComponentsTestingTargets)' == 'true'\">\n+    <MSBuild Projects=\"$(MSBuildProjectFullPath)\" Targets=\"PrepareE2EApps\"\n+             Properties=\"_E2EIsPublishing=true;E2EAppMode=publish;PublishDir=$(PublishDir)\" RemoveProperties=\"NoBuild\" />\n+  </Target>\n+</Project>"},{"sha":"abf0ad99e5ec7b444b69940e8cd5caaa9c3365ef","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests/Fixtures/TestRoot.cs","status":"added","additions":25,"deletions":0,"changes":25,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FFixtures%2FTestRoot.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FFixtures%2FTestRoot.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FFixtures%2FTestRoot.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Testing.Infrastructure;\n+using Microsoft.VisualStudio.TestTools.UnitTesting;\n+\n+namespace Components.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests.Fixtures;\n+\n+[TestClass]\n+public static class TestRoot\n+{\n+    public static ServerFactory<McpTestAssembly> Servers { get; private set; } = null!;\n+\n+    [AssemblyInitialize]\n+    public static async Task Initialize(TestContext _)\n+    {\n+        Servers = new ServerFactory<McpTestAssembly>();\n+        await Servers.InitializeAsync();\n+    }\n+\n+    public sealed class McpTestAssembly;\n+\n+    [AssemblyCleanup]\n+    public static Task Cleanup() => Servers.DisposeAsync().AsTask();\n+}"},{"sha":"3ec10862d82d8d29c4ac6d9a9276d37f3015dbbb","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests/Tests/McpBrowserTest.cs","status":"added","additions":482,"deletions":0,"changes":482,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FTests%2FMcpBrowserTest.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FTests%2FMcpBrowserTest.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FTests%2FMcpBrowserTest.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,482 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Collections.Concurrent;\n+using System.Diagnostics;\n+using System.Net.Http;\n+using System.Text.Json;\n+using Components.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests.Fixtures;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Testing.Infrastructure;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Testing.Playwright;\n+using Microsoft.Extensions.Logging;\n+using Microsoft.Playwright;\n+using Microsoft.VisualStudio.TestTools.UnitTesting;\n+using Assert = Microsoft.VisualStudio.TestTools.UnitTesting.Assert;\n+\n+namespace Components.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests.Tests;\n+\n+[UITest]\n+public partial class McpBrowserTest : BrowserTest\n+{\n+    private readonly ConcurrentQueue<string> _errors = new();\n+    private readonly ConcurrentQueue<string> _webSockets = new();\n+    private Uri _rootUri = null!;\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    [DataRow(true)]\n+    [DataRow(false)]\n+    public async Task AuthoredResource_ExecutesRuntimeOnceAcrossInitialResultAndFormUpdates(bool preserveDom)\n+    {\n+        var page = await CreatePageAsync(preserveDom);\n+        using var http = CreateClient();\n+        await using var client = await ModelContextProtocol.Client.McpClient.CreateAsync(\n+            new ModelContextProtocol.Client.HttpClientTransport(new()\n+            {\n+                Endpoint = new Uri(_rootUri, \"mcp\"),\n+                TransportMode = ModelContextProtocol.Client.HttpTransportMode.StreamableHttp,\n+            }));\n+        var resource = await client.ReadResourceAsync(\"ui://blazor/component_form\");\n+        var html = Microsoft.VisualStudio.TestTools.UnitTesting.Assert.IsInstanceOfType<ModelContextProtocol.Protocol.TextResourceContents>(\n+            Assert.ContainsSingle(resource.Contents)).Text;\n+        Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"authored-shell\\\"\", html);\n+        Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"authored-runtime\\\" src=\\\"blazor.mcp.js\\\"\", html);\n+        Assert.DoesNotContain(\"id=\\\"name\\\"\", html);\n+        using var asset = await http.GetAsync(\"blazor.mcp.js\");\n+        Assert.AreEqual(System.Net.HttpStatusCode.OK, asset.StatusCode);\n+        var runtimeFetches = new ConcurrentQueue<string>();\n+        var initialized = new ConcurrentQueue<string>();\n+        await page.AddInitScriptAsync(\"\"\"\n+            if (window === top) addEventListener(\"message\", event => {\n+                if (event.data?.method === \"ui/notifications/initialized\") {\n+                    console.info(\"MCP-AUTHORED-INITIALIZED\");\n+                }\n+            });\n+            \"\"\");\n+        page.Request += (_, request) =>\n+        {\n+            if (new Uri(request.Url).AbsolutePath.EndsWith(\"/blazor.mcp.js\", StringComparison.Ordinal))\n+            {\n+                runtimeFetches.Enqueue(request.Url);\n+            }\n+        };\n+        page.Console += (_, message) =>\n+        {\n+            if (message.Text == \"MCP-AUTHORED-INITIALIZED\")\n+            {\n+                initialized.Enqueue(message.Text);\n+            }\n+        };\n+        await ResetAsync(http, \"mcp\");\n+        var app = await OpenAsync(page);\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#authored-runtime\")).ToHaveAttributeAsync(\"src\", \"blazor.mcp.js\");\n+        await AssertSubmissionsAsync(app);\n+        await AssertDisposedAsync(http, \"mcp\", 1, minimumOperations: 3);\n+        await CloseAsync(page);\n+        Assert.HasCount(1, runtimeFetches);\n+        Assert.HasCount(1, initialized);\n+        Assert.IsEmpty(_errors, string.Join(Environment.NewLine, _errors));\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    public async Task ScriptOmission_LeavesTheAuthoredResourceWithoutAnInjectedRuntime()\n+    {\n+        var page = await CreatePageAsync();\n+        await using var client = await ModelContextProtocol.Client.McpClient.CreateAsync(\n+            new ModelContextProtocol.Client.HttpClientTransport(new()\n+            {\n+                Endpoint = new Uri(_rootUri, \"mcp\"),\n+                TransportMode = ModelContextProtocol.Client.HttpTransportMode.StreamableHttp,\n+            }));\n+        var resource = await client.ReadResourceAsync(\"ui://blazor/no_script\");\n+        var html = Assert.IsInstanceOfType<ModelContextProtocol.Protocol.TextResourceContents>(\n+            Assert.ContainsSingle(resource.Contents)).Text;\n+        Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"no-script-shell\\\"\", html);\n+        Assert.DoesNotContain(\"<script\", html);\n+        Assert.DoesNotContain(\"blazor.mcp.js\", html);\n+        await page.GotoAsync(new Uri(_rootUri, \"host?tool=no_script\").AbsoluteUri);\n+        await page.Locator(\"#open\").ClickAsync();\n+        var app = page.FrameLocator(\"#sandbox-frame\").FrameLocator(\"#app-frame\");\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#no-script-shell\")).ToBeVisibleAsync();\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"script\")).ToHaveCountAsync(0);\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    [DataRow(false)]\n+    [DataRow(true)]\n+    public async Task TypedAuthoredShell_DefersRequiredDataUntilTheOpeningResult(bool resultFirst)\n+    {\n+        var page = await CreatePageAsync();\n+        using var http = CreateClient();\n+        using var reset = await http.PostAsync(\"test/reset-initial\", content: null);\n+        reset.EnsureSuccessStatusCode();\n+        await page.GotoAsync(new Uri(_rootUri, $\"host?tool=open_initial_form&label=required-view&count=19&resultFirst={resultFirst.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()}\").AbsoluteUri);\n+        await page.Locator(\"#open\").ClickAsync();\n+        await Expect(page.Locator(\"#host-status\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"App ready\");\n+        var app = page.FrameLocator(\"#sandbox-frame\").FrameLocator(\"#app-frame\");\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#initial-label\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"required-view\");\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#initial-count\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"19\");\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#typed-shell\")).ToHaveCountAsync(0);\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#typed-runtime\")).ToHaveAttributeAsync(\"src\", \"blazor.mcp.js\");\n+        await app.Locator(\"input[name='Input.Name']\").FillAsync(\"typed-post\");\n+        await app.Locator(\"button[type=submit]\").ClickAsync();\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#typed-value\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"typed-post\");\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#initial-label\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"required-view:changed\");\n+        await CloseAsync(page);\n+        using var state = JsonDocument.Parse(await http.GetStringAsync(\"test/initial-observations\"));\n+        Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"openingCalls\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"projectionCalls\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(2, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"renders\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"submissions\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.IsEmpty(_errors, string.Join(Environment.NewLine, _errors));\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    public async Task FirstSubmission_BindsDispatchesAndRendersThroughMcp()\n+    {\n+        var page = await CreatePageAsync();\n+        using var http = CreateClient();\n+        await ResetAsync(http, \"http\");\n+        await ResetAsync(http, \"mcp\");\n+        await page.GotoAsync(new Uri(_rootUri, \"mcp-form?case=http\").AbsoluteUri);\n+        await AssertSubmissionsAsync(page.Locator(\"html\"));\n+        await AssertNativeConstraintAsync(page.Locator(\"html\"));\n+        await AssertDisposedAsync(http, \"http\", 1, minimumOperations: 3);\n+\n+        var app = await OpenAsync(page);\n+        await AssertSubmissionsAsync(app);\n+        await AssertNativeConstraintAsync(app);\n+        await AssertDisposedAsync(http, \"mcp\", 1, minimumOperations: 3);\n+        await CloseAsync(page);\n+        Assert.IsEmpty(_errors, string.Join(Environment.NewLine, _errors));\n+        Assert.IsFalse(_webSockets.Any(uri => uri.Contains(\"/_blazor\", StringComparison.Ordinal)));\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    [DataRow(false)]\n+    [DataRow(true)]\n+    public Task RelativeActions_UseTheDocumentBaseUri(bool useSubmitter)\n+        => AssertActionAsync(useSubmitter ? \"submitter-action\" : \"form-action\",\n+            useSubmitter ? \"base-submitter\" : \"base-form\", \"base-target\");\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    public Task EmptyAction_SubmitsToTheCurrentLogicalLocation()\n+        => AssertActionAsync(\"empty\", \"base-empty\", \"current-target\");\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    public Task DefaultAction_SubmitsToTheCurrentLogicalLocation()\n+        => AssertActionAsync(\"missing\", \"base-missing\", \"current-target\");\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    [DataRow(\"urlencoded\", \"upload-urlencoded\", true, false, false)]\n+    [DataRow(\"multipart\", \"upload-multipart\", true, false, true)]\n+    [DataRow(\"multipart\", \"upload-empty\", false, false, false)]\n+    [DataRow(\"urlencoded\", \"upload-override\", true, true, true)]\n+    public async Task FileControls_MatchHttpEncodingAndSubmitterSemantics(\n+        string encoding, string caseId, bool selectFile, bool useOverride, bool expectFile)\n+    {\n+        var page = await CreatePageAsync();\n+        using var http = CreateClient();\n+        await ResetAsync(http, \"http-\" + caseId);\n+        await ResetAsync(http, caseId);\n+        var file = new FilePayload { Name = \"mcp-upload.txt\", MimeType = \"text/plain\", Buffer = \"Mcp upload payload\"u8.ToArray() };\n+        await page.GotoAsync(new Uri(_rootUri, $\"mcp-upload?encoding={encoding}&case=http-{caseId}\").AbsoluteUri);\n+        await SubmitUploadAsync(page.Locator(\"html\"));\n+        await AssertEffectAsync(http, \"http-\" + caseId, expectFile ? \"file\" : \"none\");\n+\n+        var app = await OpenAsync(page);\n+        await app.Locator(\"#\" + (useOverride ? \"upload-override-link\" : caseId)).ClickAsync();\n+        await SubmitUploadAsync(app);\n+        await AssertEffectAsync(http, caseId, expectFile ? \"file\" : \"none\");\n+        await CloseAsync(page);\n+        Assert.IsEmpty(_errors, string.Join(Environment.NewLine, _errors));\n+\n+        async Task SubmitUploadAsync(ILocator root)\n+        {\n+            if (selectFile)\n+            {\n+                await root.Locator(\"#upload\").SetInputFilesAsync(file);\n+            }\n+\n+            await root.Locator(useOverride ? \"#upload-override\" : \"#upload-submit\").ClickAsync();\n+            await Expect(root.Locator(\"#upload-result\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"submitted\");\n+            await Expect(root.Locator(\"#uploaded-kind\")).ToHaveTextAsync(expectFile ? \"file\" : \"none\");\n+            await Expect(root.Locator(\"#uploaded-field\")).ToHaveTextAsync(!selectFile ? \"\" : expectFile ? \"(none)\" : file.Name);\n+            if (expectFile)\n+            {\n+                await Expect(root.Locator(\"#uploaded-name\")).ToHaveTextAsync(file.Name);\n+                await Expect(root.Locator(\"#uploaded-content-type\")).ToHaveTextAsync(file.MimeType);\n+                await Expect(root.Locator(\"#uploaded-bytes\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"4D63702075706C6F6164207061796C6F6164\");\n+            }\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    [DataRow(true)]\n+    [DataRow(false)]\n+    public async Task DomPreservation_UsesMcpOptionsWhileConfigureBrowserIsNoOp(bool preserveDom)\n+    {\n+        var page = await CreatePageAsync(preserveDom);\n+        using var http = CreateClient();\n+        await ResetAsync(http, \"mcp\");\n+        var app = await OpenAsync(page);\n+        await app.Locator(\"#configure-browser-link\").ClickAsync();\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#http-browser-configuration\")).ToBeAttachedAsync();\n+        await app.Locator(\"#permanent-input\").FillAsync(\"retained browser state\");\n+        await app.Locator(\"#name\").FillAsync(\"ProofValue\");\n+        await app.Locator(\"form button[type=submit]\").First.ClickAsync();\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#submitted-name\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"ProofValue\");\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#permanent-input\")).ToHaveValueAsync(preserveDom ? \"retained browser state\" : \"initial\");\n+        await CloseAsync(page);\n+        Assert.IsEmpty(_errors, string.Join(Environment.NewLine, _errors));\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    [DataRow(LogLevel.Information, true)]\n+    [DataRow(LogLevel.None, false)]\n+    public async Task LogLevel_ControlsFrameworkMessagesWithoutHidingVisibleErrors(LogLevel logLevel, bool expectConsoleError)\n+    {\n+        var page = await CreatePageAsync(logLevel: logLevel);\n+        var app = await OpenAsync(page);\n+        var reported = new TaskCompletionSource(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+        page.Console += (_, message) =>\n+        {\n+            if (message.Type == \"error\" && message.Text.Contains(\"exactly one named form handler\", StringComparison.Ordinal))\n+            {\n+                reported.TrySetResult();\n+            }\n+        };\n+        await app.Locator(\"#framework-error\").ClickAsync();\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#blazor-mcp-error\")).ToContainTextAsync(\"exactly one named form handler\");\n+        if (expectConsoleError)\n+        {\n+            await reported.Task.WaitAsync(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10));\n+            Assert.HasCount(1, _errors, string.Join(Environment.NewLine, _errors));\n+            Assert.Contains(\"exactly one named form handler\", _errors.Single(), StringComparison.Ordinal);\n+        }\n+        else\n+        {\n+            Assert.IsEmpty(_errors, string.Join(Environment.NewLine, _errors));\n+        }\n+\n+        await CloseAsync(page);\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    public async Task SupersedingGet_DoesNotReplayThePendingPostOrReplaceTheNewDocument()\n+    {\n+        var page = await CreatePageAsync();\n+        using var http = CreateClient();\n+        await ResetAsync(http, \"gated-navigation\");\n+        await ResetAsync(http, \"gated-next\");\n+        var app = await OpenAsync(page);\n+        try\n+        {\n+            await app.Locator(\"#gated-navigation-link\").ClickAsync();\n+            await app.Locator(\"#gated-submit\").ClickAsync();\n+            await WaitForGateAsync(http, \"gated-navigation\", cancellationExpected: false);\n+            await app.Locator(\"#gated-next\").ClickAsync();\n+            await Expect(app.Locator(\"#name\")).ToBeVisibleAsync();\n+            await AssertPendingScopeAsync(http, \"gated-navigation\");\n+            await ReleaseAsync(http, \"gated-navigation\");\n+            await Expect(app).ToHaveAttributeAsync(\"aria-busy\", \"false\");\n+            await app.Locator(\"#name\").FillAsync(\"ProofValue\");\n+            await app.Locator(\"form button[type=submit]\").First.ClickAsync();\n+            await Expect(app.Locator(\"#submitted-name\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"ProofValue\");\n+            await AssertDisposedAsync(http, \"gated-navigation\", 1);\n+            await AssertDisposedAsync(http, \"gated-next\", 1);\n+            await CloseAsync(page);\n+            Assert.IsEmpty(_errors, string.Join(Environment.NewLine, _errors));\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            await ReleaseAsync(http, \"gated-navigation\");\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    public async Task Teardown_CancelsAndWaitsForTheAdmittedActionBeforeDisposingItsScope()\n+    {\n+        var page = await CreatePageAsync();\n+        using var http = CreateClient();\n+        await ResetAsync(http, \"gated-close\");\n+        var app = await OpenAsync(page);\n+        try\n+        {\n+            await app.Locator(\"#gated-close-link\").ClickAsync();\n+            await app.Locator(\"#gated-submit\").ClickAsync();\n+            await WaitForGateAsync(http, \"gated-close\", cancellationExpected: false);\n+            await page.Locator(\"#close\").ClickAsync();\n+            await WaitForGateAsync(http, \"gated-close\", cancellationExpected: true);\n+            await AssertPendingScopeAsync(http, \"gated-close\");\n+            Assert.AreNotEqual(\"App closed\", await page.Locator(\"#host-status\").InnerTextAsync());\n+            await ReleaseAsync(http, \"gated-close\");\n+            await Expect(page.Locator(\"#host-status\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"App closed\");\n+            await AssertDisposedAsync(http, \"gated-close\", 0);\n+            Assert.IsEmpty(_errors, string.Join(Environment.NewLine, _errors));\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            await ReleaseAsync(http, \"gated-close\");\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private async Task<IPage> CreatePageAsync(bool preserveDom = true, LogLevel logLevel = LogLevel.Information)\n+    {\n+        var server = await StartServerAsync<McpTestAppMarker>(TestRoot.Servers, options =>\n+        {\n+            options.EnvironmentVariables[\"McpTest__PreserveDom\"] = preserveDom.ToString();\n+            options.EnvironmentVariables[\"McpTest__LogLevel\"] = logLevel.ToString();\n+        });\n+        _rootUri = new Uri(server.AppUrl);\n+        var context = await NewContext(new BrowserNewContextOptions().WithServerRouting(server));\n+        var page = await context.NewPageAsync();\n+        page.Console += (_, message) =>\n+        {\n+            if (message.Type == \"error\")\n+            {\n+                _errors.Enqueue(message.Text);\n+            }\n+        };\n+        page.PageError += (_, error) => _errors.Enqueue(error);\n+        page.WebSocket += (_, socket) => _webSockets.Enqueue(socket.Url);\n+        return page;\n+    }\n+\n+    private async Task<ILocator> OpenAsync(IPage page)\n+    {\n+        await page.GotoAsync(new Uri(_rootUri, \"host\").AbsoluteUri);\n+        await page.Locator(\"#open\").ClickAsync();\n+        await Expect(page.Locator(\"#host-status\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"App ready\");\n+        var app = page.FrameLocator(\"#sandbox-frame\").FrameLocator(\"#app-frame\").Locator(\"html\");\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#name\")).ToBeVisibleAsync();\n+        return app;\n+    }\n+\n+    private static async Task CloseAsync(IPage page)\n+    {\n+        await page.Locator(\"#close\").ClickAsync();\n+        await Expect(page.Locator(\"#host-status\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"App closed\");\n+    }\n+\n+    private async Task AssertActionAsync(string mode, string caseId, string expected)\n+    {\n+        var page = await CreatePageAsync();\n+        using var http = CreateClient();\n+        await ResetAsync(http, \"http-\" + caseId);\n+        await ResetAsync(http, caseId);\n+        await page.GotoAsync(new Uri(_rootUri, $\"forms/nested/edit?mode={mode}&case=http-{caseId}\").AbsoluteUri);\n+        await page.Locator(\"#relative-submit\").ClickAsync();\n+        await Expect(page.Locator(\"#action-result\")).ToHaveTextAsync(expected);\n+        await AssertEffectAsync(http, \"http-\" + caseId, expected);\n+\n+        var app = await OpenAsync(page);\n+        await app.Locator(\"#relative-\" + mode).ClickAsync();\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#relative-location\")).ToContainTextAsync(\"forms/nested/edit\");\n+        Assert.AreEqual(_rootUri.AbsoluteUri, await app.Locator(\"base\").GetAttributeAsync(\"href\"));\n+        await app.Locator(\"#relative-submit\").ClickAsync();\n+        await Expect(app.Locator(\"#action-result\")).ToHaveTextAsync(expected);\n+        await AssertEffectAsync(http, caseId, expected);\n+        await CloseAsync(page);\n+        Assert.IsEmpty(_errors, string.Join(Environment.NewLine, _errors));\n+    }\n+\n+    private static async Task AssertSubmissionsAsync(ILocator root)\n+    {\n+        var originalScope = await root.Locator(\"#scope-id\").InnerTextAsync();\n+        await root.Locator(\"#name\").FillAsync(\"ProofValue\");\n+        await root.Locator(\"form button[type=submit]\").First.ClickAsync();\n+        await Expect(root.Locator(\"#submitted-name\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"ProofValue\");\n+        await Expect(root.Locator(\"#effect-count\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"1\");\n+        await Expect(root.Locator(\"#last-effect\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"ProofValue\");\n+        Assert.AreNotEqual(originalScope, await root.Locator(\"#scope-id\").InnerTextAsync());\n+        var validScope = await root.Locator(\"#scope-id\").InnerTextAsync();\n+        await root.Locator(\"#name\").FillAsync(\"\");\n+        await root.Locator(\"form button[type=submit]\").First.ClickAsync();\n+        await Expect(root.Locator(\".validation-errors\")).ToContainTextAsync(\"The Name field is required.\");\n+        Assert.AreNotEqual(validScope, await root.Locator(\"#scope-id\").InnerTextAsync());\n+        await Expect(root.Locator(\"#effect-count\")).ToHaveTextAsync(\"1\");\n+    }\n+\n+    private static async Task AssertNativeConstraintAsync(ILocator root)\n+    {\n+        var scope = await root.Locator(\"#scope-id\").InnerTextAsync();\n+        await root.Locator(\"#native-submit\").ClickAsync();\n+        await Expect(root.Locator(\"#native-required\")).Not.ToHaveJSPropertyAsync(\"validationMessage\", \"\");\n+        Assert.AreEqual(scope, await root.Locator(\"#scope-id\").InnerTextAsync());\n+    }\n+\n+    private HttpClient CreateClient() => new() { BaseAddress = _rootUri };\n+\n+    private static async Task ResetAsync(HttpClient client, string caseId)\n+    {\n+        using var response = await client.PostAsync(\"test/reset/\" + caseId, content: null);\n+        response.EnsureSuccessStatusCode();\n+    }\n+\n+    private static async Task ReleaseAsync(HttpClient client, string caseId)\n+    {\n+        using var response = await client.PostAsync($\"test/gate/{caseId}/release\", content: null);\n+        response.EnsureSuccessStatusCode();\n+    }\n+\n+    private static async Task AssertEffectAsync(HttpClient client, string caseId, string expected)\n+    {\n+        using var state = JsonDocument.Parse(await client.GetStringAsync(\"observations/\" + caseId));\n+        Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"count\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(expected, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"value\").GetString());\n+    }\n+\n+    private static async Task AssertPendingScopeAsync(HttpClient client, string caseId)\n+    {\n+        using var state = JsonDocument.Parse(await client.GetStringAsync(\"observations/\" + caseId));\n+        Assert.AreEqual(0, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"count\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(2, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"componentsCreated\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"componentsDisposed\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"scopesDisposed\").GetInt32());\n+    }\n+\n+    private static async Task WaitForGateAsync(HttpClient client, string caseId, bool cancellationExpected)\n+    {\n+        var elapsed = Stopwatch.StartNew();\n+        while (true)\n+        {\n+            using var state = JsonDocument.Parse(await client.GetStringAsync(\"test/gate/\" + caseId));\n+            if (state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"started\").GetBoolean()\n+                && state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"cancellationObserved\").GetBoolean() == cancellationExpected)\n+            {\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            if (elapsed.Elapsed >= TimeSpan.FromSeconds(5))\n+            {\n+                Assert.Fail($\"The real form callback did not reach its expected gate state: {state.RootElement}\");\n+            }\n+\n+            await Task.Delay(50);\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private static async Task AssertDisposedAsync(HttpClient client, string caseId, int expectedEffects, int minimumOperations = 2)\n+    {\n+        var elapsed = Stopwatch.StartNew();\n+        while (true)\n+        {\n+            using var state = JsonDocument.Parse(await client.GetStringAsync(\"observations/\" + caseId));\n+            var value = state.RootElement;\n+            if (value.GetProperty(\"componentsCreated\").GetInt32() >= minimumOperations\n+                && value.GetProperty(\"componentsCreated\").GetInt32() == value.GetProperty(\"componentsDisposed\").GetInt32()\n+                && value.GetProperty(\"componentsCreated\").GetInt32() == value.GetProperty(\"scopesDisposed\").GetInt32())\n+            {\n+                Assert.AreEqual(expectedEffects, value.GetProperty(\"count\").GetInt32());\n+                return;\n+            }\n+\n+            if (elapsed.Elapsed >= TimeSpan.FromSeconds(15))\n+            {\n+                Assert.Fail($\"The operation did not dispose its complete render scope: {value}\");\n+            }\n+\n+            await Task.Delay(50);\n+        }\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"d878a4185032d75920a001ccb35892c6af991050","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests/Tests/McpFormRedirectTest.cs","status":"added","additions":93,"deletions":0,"changes":93,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FTests%2FMcpFormRedirectTest.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FTests%2FMcpFormRedirectTest.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FTests%2FMcpFormRedirectTest.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,93 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+#nullable enable\n+\n+using System.Net.Http;\n+using System.Text.Json;\n+using Components.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests.Fixtures;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Testing.Infrastructure;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Testing.Playwright;\n+using Microsoft.VisualStudio.TestTools.UnitTesting;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Client;\n+using Assert = Microsoft.VisualStudio.TestTools.UnitTesting.Assert;\n+\n+namespace Components.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests.Tests;\n+\n+[UITest]\n+public partial class McpFormRedirectTest : UITest\n+{\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    [DataRow(false)]\n+    [DataRow(true)]\n+    public async Task SubmittedMutation_RedirectsToAFreshGetWithoutReplayingTheHandler(bool disableThrow)\n+    {\n+        var server = await StartServerAsync<McpTestAppMarker>(TestRoot.Servers, options =>\n+        {\n+            options.EnvironmentVariables[\"McpTest__DisableThrowNavigationException\"] = disableThrow.ToString();\n+        });\n+        var root = new Uri(server.AppUrl);\n+        using var http = new HttpClient { BaseAddress = root };\n+        using var reset = await http.PostAsync(\"test/reset/redirect\", content: null);\n+        reset.EnsureSuccessStatusCode();\n+        await using var client = await McpClient.CreateAsync(new HttpClientTransport(new()\n+        {\n+            Endpoint = new Uri(root, \"mcp\"),\n+            TransportMode = HttpTransportMode.StreamableHttp,\n+        }));\n+        var opened = await client.CallToolAsync(\"component_form\");\n+        Assert.IsFalse(opened.IsError == true);\n+        var view = opened.Meta![\"blazor\"]!.AsObject();\n+        var dispatchTool = view[\"dispatchTool\"]!.GetValue<string>();\n+        var viewId = view[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>();\n+        try\n+        {\n+            var formLocation = new Uri(root, \"mcp-redirect?case=redirect\").AbsoluteUri;\n+            var form = await client.CallToolAsync(dispatchTool, new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+            {\n+                [\"viewId\"] = viewId,\n+                [\"location\"] = formLocation,\n+                [\"method\"] = \"GET\",\n+            });\n+            Assert.IsFalse(form.IsError == true);\n+            Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"redirect-submit\\\"\", form.Meta![\"blazor\"]![\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+\n+            var posted = await client.CallToolAsync(dispatchTool, new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+            {\n+                [\"viewId\"] = viewId,\n+                [\"location\"] = formLocation,\n+                [\"method\"] = \"POST\",\n+                [\"fields\"] = new Dictionary<string, string[]> { [\"_handler\"] = [\"redirect\"], [\"Case\"] = [\"redirect\"] },\n+            });\n+\n+            Assert.IsFalse(posted.IsError == true);\n+            var result = posted.Meta![\"blazor\"]!.AsObject();\n+            Assert.IsTrue(result[\"redirected\"]!.GetValue<bool>());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(new Uri(root, \"mcp-redirect-result?case=redirect\").AbsoluteUri, result[\"location\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+            Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"redirect-count\\\">1\", result[\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+            Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"redirect-form-data\\\">none\", result[\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+\n+            var fresh = await client.CallToolAsync(dispatchTool, new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+            {\n+                [\"viewId\"] = viewId,\n+                [\"location\"] = result[\"location\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"method\"] = \"GET\",\n+            });\n+            Assert.IsFalse(fresh.IsError == true);\n+            Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"redirect-count\\\">1\", fresh.Meta![\"blazor\"]![\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+            using var state = JsonDocument.Parse(await http.GetStringAsync(\"observations/redirect\"));\n+            Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"count\").GetInt32());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(4, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"componentsCreated\").GetInt32());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(4, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"componentsDisposed\").GetInt32());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(4, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"scopesDisposed\").GetInt32());\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            await client.CallToolAsync(dispatchTool, new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+            {\n+                [\"viewId\"] = viewId,\n+                [\"method\"] = \"CLOSE\",\n+            });\n+        }\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"3e4a741f42b300ad69587aaecd668d8288bd95da","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests/Tests/McpSdkIntegrationTest.cs","status":"added","additions":381,"deletions":0,"changes":381,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FTests%2FMcpSdkIntegrationTest.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FTests%2FMcpSdkIntegrationTest.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests%2FTests%2FMcpSdkIntegrationTest.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,381 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+#nullable enable\n+\n+using System.Linq;\n+using System.Net.Http;\n+using System.Text.Json;\n+using System.Text.Json.Nodes;\n+using Components.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests.Fixtures;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Testing.Infrastructure;\n+using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Testing.Playwright;\n+using Microsoft.VisualStudio.TestTools.UnitTesting;\n+using ModelContextProtocol;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Client;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Protocol;\n+using Assert = Microsoft.VisualStudio.TestTools.UnitTesting.Assert;\n+\n+namespace Components.McpTestApp.E2E.Tests.Tests;\n+\n+[UITest]\n+public partial class McpSdkIntegrationTest : UITest\n+{\n+    private Uri _rootUri = null!;\n+\n+    protected override async Task InitializeCoreAsync()\n+    {\n+        await base.InitializeCoreAsync();\n+        var server = await StartServerAsync<McpTestAppMarker>(TestRoot.Servers);\n+        _rootUri = new Uri(server.AppUrl);\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    public async Task ExistingTool_PreservesSdkContractAndReconstructsIndependentTypedParameters()\n+    {\n+        using var http = await ResetAsync();\n+        await using var first = await ConnectAsync();\n+        await using var second = await ConnectAsync();\n+        var tools = await first.ListToolsAsync();\n+        var associated = Assert.ContainsSingle(tools.Where(tool => tool.Name == \"open_initial_form\")).ProtocolTool;\n+        var baseline = Assert.ContainsSingle(tools.Where(tool => tool.Name == \"unassociated_initial_form\")).ProtocolTool;\n+        Assert.AreEqual(baseline.InputSchema.GetRawText(), associated.InputSchema.GetRawText());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(\"preserved\", associated.Meta![\"businessTool\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+        Assert.IsNull(baseline.Meta![\"ui\"]);\n+        var resourceUri = associated.Meta[\"ui\"]![\"resourceUri\"]!.GetValue<string>();\n+        var resource = await first.ReadResourceAsync(resourceUri);\n+        var html = Assert.IsInstanceOfType<TextResourceContents>(Assert.ContainsSingle(resource.Contents));\n+        Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"typed-shell\\\"\", html.Text);\n+        Assert.Contains(\"src=\\\"blazor.mcp.js\\\"\", html.Text);\n+        Assert.DoesNotContain(\"id=\\\"initial-label\\\"\", html.Text);\n+\n+        var firstResult = await first.CallToolAsync(\"open_initial_form\", Arguments(\"first-view\", 17));\n+        var firstView = GetView(firstResult);\n+        Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"initial-label\\\">first-view\", firstView[\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+        Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"initial-count\\\">17\", firstView[\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(\"Business result: first-view.\", Assert.IsInstanceOfType<TextContentBlock>(Assert.ContainsSingle(firstResult.Content)).Text);\n+        Assert.AreEqual(\"preserved\", firstResult.Meta![\"business\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(\"preserved\", firstResult.Meta[\"existingFilter\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+\n+        var secondResult = await second.CallToolAsync(\"open_initial_form\", Arguments(\"second-view\", 29));\n+        var secondView = GetView(secondResult);\n+        Assert.AreNotEqual(firstView[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>(), secondView[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+        Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"initial-label\\\">second-view\", secondView[\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+        Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"initial-label\\\">first-view\", firstView[\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(\"first-view\", firstResult.StructuredContent!.Value.GetProperty(\"label\").GetString());\n+\n+        var posted = await first.CallToolAsync(firstView[\"dispatchTool\"]!.GetValue<string>(), new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+        {\n+            [\"viewId\"] = firstView[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+            [\"location\"] = firstView[\"location\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+            [\"method\"] = \"POST\",\n+            [\"fields\"] = new Dictionary<string, string[]> { [\"_handler\"] = [\"typed-form\"], [\"Input.Name\"] = [\"posted-value\"] },\n+        });\n+        Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"typed-value\\\">posted-value\", GetView(posted)[\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+        Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"initial-label\\\">first-view:changed\", GetView(posted)[\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+\n+        var fresh = await first.CallToolAsync(firstView[\"dispatchTool\"]!.GetValue<string>(), new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+        {\n+            [\"viewId\"] = firstView[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+            [\"location\"] = firstView[\"location\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+            [\"method\"] = \"GET\",\n+        });\n+        Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"initial-label\\\">first-view\", GetView(fresh)[\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+        Assert.DoesNotContain(\"first-view:changed\", GetView(fresh)[\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+        using var state = JsonDocument.Parse(await http.GetStringAsync(\"test/initial-observations\"));\n+        Assert.AreEqual(2, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"openingCalls\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(2, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"projectionCalls\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(4, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"renders\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"submissions\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.IsFalse(state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"sharedResultHasViewMetadata\").GetBoolean());\n+        await CloseAsync(first, firstView);\n+        await CloseAsync(second, secondView);\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    public async Task ExistingResponseFilter_EnrichesInitialParametersBeforeProjection()\n+    {\n+        using var http = await ResetAsync();\n+        await using var client = await ConnectAsync();\n+        var result = await client.CallToolAsync(\"open_initial_form\", Arguments(\"filter-enrichment\", 1));\n+        var view = GetView(result);\n+        try\n+        {\n+            Assert.AreEqual(\"enriched-by-filter\", result.StructuredContent!.Value.GetProperty(\"label\").GetString());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(73, result.StructuredContent.Value.GetProperty(\"count\").GetInt32());\n+            Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"initial-label\\\">enriched-by-filter\", view[\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+            Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"initial-count\\\">73\", view[\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(\"Business result: filter-enrichment.\", Assert.IsInstanceOfType<TextContentBlock>(Assert.ContainsSingle(result.Content)).Text);\n+            Assert.AreEqual(\"preserved\", result.Meta![\"business\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(\"preserved\", result.Meta[\"existingFilter\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+            using var state = JsonDocument.Parse(await http.GetStringAsync(\"test/initial-observations\"));\n+            Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"openingCalls\").GetInt32());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"projectionCalls\").GetInt32());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"renders\").GetInt32());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(0, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"submissions\").GetInt32());\n+            Assert.IsFalse(state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"sharedResultHasViewMetadata\").GetBoolean());\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            await CloseAsync(client, view);\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    public async Task ExistingResponseFilter_ErrorDoesNotProjectRenderOrCreateAView()\n+    {\n+        using var http = await ResetAsync();\n+        await using var client = await ConnectAsync();\n+\n+        var result = await client.CallToolAsync(\"open_initial_form\", Arguments(\"filter-error\", 1));\n+\n+        Assert.IsTrue(result.IsError);\n+        Assert.AreEqual(\"Rejected by the existing SDK filter.\", Assert.IsInstanceOfType<TextContentBlock>(Assert.ContainsSingle(result.Content)).Text);\n+        Assert.AreEqual(\"preserved\", result.Meta![\"business\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(\"preserved\", result.Meta[\"existingFilter\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+        using var state = JsonDocument.Parse(await http.GetStringAsync(\"test/initial-observations\"));\n+        Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"openingCalls\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(0, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"projectionCalls\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(0, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"renders\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(0, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"submissions\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.IsNull(result.Meta[\"blazor\"]);\n+        Assert.IsFalse(state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"sharedResultHasViewMetadata\").GetBoolean());\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    public async Task OpeningError_DoesNotProjectParametersOrRenderComponents()\n+    {\n+        using var http = await ResetAsync();\n+        await using var client = await ConnectAsync();\n+\n+        var result = await client.CallToolAsync(\"open_initial_form\", Arguments(\"error\", 0, error: true));\n+\n+        Assert.IsTrue(result.IsError);\n+        Assert.AreEqual(\"Business error.\", Assert.IsInstanceOfType<TextContentBlock>(Assert.ContainsSingle(result.Content)).Text);\n+        Assert.IsNull(result.Meta?[\"blazor\"]);\n+        using var state = JsonDocument.Parse(await http.GetStringAsync(\"test/initial-observations\"));\n+        Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"openingCalls\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(0, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"projectionCalls\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(0, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"renders\").GetInt32());\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    public async Task OpeningException_PreservesSdkErrorAndDoesNotProjectOrRender()\n+    {\n+        using var http = await ResetAsync();\n+        await using var client = await ConnectAsync();\n+        var arguments = new Dictionary<string, object?> { [\"input\"] = new { label = \"exception\", count = 0, @throw = true } };\n+\n+        var baseline = await CaptureErrorAsync(client, \"unassociated_initial_form\", arguments);\n+        var associated = await CaptureErrorAsync(client, \"open_initial_form\", arguments);\n+\n+        Assert.IsTrue(baseline.IsError);\n+        Assert.IsTrue(associated.IsError);\n+        Assert.AreEqual(baseline.Kind, associated.Kind);\n+        Assert.AreEqual(\"An error occurred invoking 'unassociated_initial_form': The business opening tool failed.\", baseline.Message);\n+        Assert.AreEqual(\"An error occurred invoking 'open_initial_form': The business opening tool failed.\", associated.Message);\n+        using var state = JsonDocument.Parse(await http.GetStringAsync(\"test/initial-observations\"));\n+        Assert.AreEqual(2, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"openingCalls\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(0, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"projectionCalls\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(0, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"renders\").GetInt32());\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    [DataRow(\"fields-shape\", \"Form fields must be an object containing arrays of strings.\")]\n+    [DataRow(\"field-shape\", \"Form fields must be arrays of strings.\")]\n+    [DataRow(\"handler-count\", \"exactly one named form handler\")]\n+    [DataRow(\"empty-handler\", \"exactly one named form handler\")]\n+    [DataRow(\"enctype\", \"Only URL-encoded and multipart component forms are supported.\")]\n+    [DataRow(\"get-data\", \"GET component navigation cannot contain form data.\")]\n+    [DataRow(\"base64\", \"A submitted file contains invalid base64 data.\")]\n+    [DataRow(\"outside\", \"within the registered application\")]\n+    [DataRow(\"view-id\", \"The component view is not available for this request.\")]\n+    [DataRow(\"method\", \"within the registered application\")]\n+    public async Task InvalidDispatch_DoesNotRenderOrExecuteTheOpeningToolAgain(string scenario, string expectedMessage)\n+    {\n+        using var http = await ResetAsync();\n+        await using var client = await ConnectAsync();\n+        var view = GetView(await client.CallToolAsync(\"open_initial_form\", Arguments(\"input-errors\", 3)));\n+        try\n+        {\n+            var arguments = new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+            {\n+                [\"viewId\"] = view[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"location\"] = view[\"location\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"method\"] = \"POST\",\n+                [\"fields\"] = new Dictionary<string, string[]> { [\"_handler\"] = [\"typed-form\"], [\"Input.Name\"] = [\"must-not-submit\"] },\n+            };\n+            switch (scenario)\n+            {\n+                case \"fields-shape\":\n+                    arguments[\"fields\"] = \"not-a-field-object\";\n+                    break;\n+                case \"field-shape\":\n+                    arguments[\"fields\"] = new Dictionary<string, object?> { [\"_handler\"] = \"typed-form\" };\n+                    break;\n+                case \"handler-count\":\n+                    arguments[\"fields\"] = new Dictionary<string, string[]> { [\"_handler\"] = [\"typed-form\", \"typed-form\"] };\n+                    break;\n+                case \"empty-handler\":\n+                    arguments[\"fields\"] = new Dictionary<string, string[]> { [\"_handler\"] = [\"\"] };\n+                    break;\n+                case \"enctype\":\n+                    arguments[\"enctype\"] = \"text/plain\";\n+                    break;\n+                case \"get-data\":\n+                    arguments[\"method\"] = \"GET\";\n+                    break;\n+                case \"base64\":\n+                    arguments[\"enctype\"] = \"multipart/form-data\";\n+                    arguments[\"files\"] = new[] { new { name = \"Upload\", fileName = \"upload.txt\", contentType = \"text/plain\", data = \"!\", lastModified = 0 } };\n+                    break;\n+                case \"outside\":\n+                    arguments[\"location\"] = \"https://outside.example/form\";\n+                    break;\n+                case \"view-id\":\n+                    arguments[\"viewId\"] = Guid.NewGuid().ToString();\n+                    break;\n+                case \"method\":\n+                    arguments[\"method\"] = \"PATCH\";\n+                    break;\n+                default:\n+                    throw new InvalidOperationException($\"Unknown invalid-dispatch scenario '{scenario}'.\");\n+            }\n+\n+            var outcome = await CaptureErrorAsync(client, view[\"dispatchTool\"]!.GetValue<string>(), arguments);\n+\n+            Assert.IsTrue(outcome.IsError);\n+            Assert.Contains(expectedMessage, outcome.Message, StringComparison.Ordinal);\n+            using var state = JsonDocument.Parse(await http.GetStringAsync(\"test/initial-observations\"));\n+            Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"openingCalls\").GetInt32());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"projectionCalls\").GetInt32());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"renders\").GetInt32());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(0, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"submissions\").GetInt32());\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            await CloseAsync(client, view);\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    public async Task WrongApplicationAndClosedView_DoNotRenderOrExecuteEffects()\n+    {\n+        using var http = await ResetAsync();\n+        await using var client = await ConnectAsync();\n+        var view = GetView(await client.CallToolAsync(\"open_initial_form\", Arguments(\"view-errors\", 4)));\n+        var arguments = new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+        {\n+            [\"viewId\"] = view[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+            [\"location\"] = view[\"location\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+            [\"method\"] = \"GET\",\n+        };\n+\n+        var wrongApplication = await CaptureErrorAsync(client, \"component_form_dispatch\", arguments);\n+        await CloseAsync(client, view);\n+        var closed = await CaptureErrorAsync(client, view[\"dispatchTool\"]!.GetValue<string>(), arguments);\n+\n+        Assert.IsTrue(wrongApplication.IsError);\n+        Assert.IsTrue(closed.IsError);\n+        Assert.Contains(\"The component view is not available for this request.\", wrongApplication.Message, StringComparison.Ordinal);\n+        Assert.Contains(\"The component view is not available for this request.\", closed.Message, StringComparison.Ordinal);\n+        using var state = JsonDocument.Parse(await http.GetStringAsync(\"test/initial-observations\"));\n+        Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"openingCalls\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"projectionCalls\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"renders\").GetInt32());\n+        Assert.AreEqual(0, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"submissions\").GetInt32());\n+    }\n+\n+    [TestMethod]\n+    [DataRow(true, \"Cannot submit the form 'unknown' because no form on the page currently has that name.\")]\n+    [DataRow(false, \"The business form action failed.\")]\n+    public async Task FormDispatchError_DoesNotReplayOpeningOrPoisonTheView(bool missingHandler, string expectedMessage)\n+    {\n+        using var http = await ResetAsync();\n+        await using var client = await ConnectAsync();\n+        var view = GetView(await client.CallToolAsync(\"open_initial_form\", Arguments(\"form-errors\", 5)));\n+        try\n+        {\n+            var dispatchTool = view[\"dispatchTool\"]!.GetValue<string>();\n+            var outcome = await CaptureErrorAsync(client, dispatchTool, new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+            {\n+                [\"viewId\"] = view[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"location\"] = view[\"location\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"method\"] = \"POST\",\n+                [\"fields\"] = new Dictionary<string, string[]>\n+                {\n+                    [\"_handler\"] = [missingHandler ? \"unknown\" : \"typed-form\"],\n+                    [\"Input.Name\"] = [\"throw-action\"],\n+                },\n+            });\n+\n+            Assert.IsTrue(outcome.IsError);\n+            Assert.Contains(expectedMessage, outcome.Message, StringComparison.Ordinal);\n+            var fresh = await client.CallToolAsync(dispatchTool, new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+            {\n+                [\"viewId\"] = view[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"location\"] = view[\"location\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+                [\"method\"] = \"GET\",\n+            });\n+            Assert.Contains(\"id=\\\"initial-label\\\">form-errors\", GetView(fresh)[\"document\"]!.GetValue<string>());\n+            using var state = JsonDocument.Parse(await http.GetStringAsync(\"test/initial-observations\"));\n+            Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"openingCalls\").GetInt32());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(1, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"projectionCalls\").GetInt32());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(3, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"renders\").GetInt32());\n+            Assert.AreEqual(0, state.RootElement.GetProperty(\"submissions\").GetInt32());\n+        }\n+        finally\n+        {\n+            await CloseAsync(client, view);\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private async Task<HttpClient> ResetAsync()\n+    {\n+        var http = new HttpClient { BaseAddress = _rootUri };\n+        using var reset = await http.PostAsync(\"test/reset-initial\", content: null);\n+        reset.EnsureSuccessStatusCode();\n+        return http;\n+    }\n+\n+    private Task<McpClient> ConnectAsync()\n+        => McpClient.CreateAsync(new HttpClientTransport(new()\n+        {\n+            Endpoint = new Uri(_rootUri, \"mcp\"),\n+            TransportMode = HttpTransportMode.StreamableHttp,\n+        }));\n+\n+    private static Dictionary<string, object?> Arguments(string label, int count, bool error = false)\n+        => new()\n+        {\n+            [\"input\"] = new { label, count, error },\n+        };\n+\n+    private static JsonObject GetView(CallToolResult result)\n+    {\n+        Assert.IsFalse(result.IsError == true);\n+        return result.Meta![\"blazor\"]!.AsObject();\n+    }\n+\n+    private static ValueTask<CallToolResult> CloseAsync(McpClient client, JsonObject view)\n+        => client.CallToolAsync(view[\"dispatchTool\"]!.GetValue<string>(), new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+        {\n+            [\"viewId\"] = view[\"viewId\"]!.GetValue<string>(),\n+            [\"method\"] = \"CLOSE\",\n+        });\n+\n+    private static async Task<ErrorOutcome> CaptureErrorAsync(McpClient client, string tool, Dictionary<string, object?> arguments)\n+    {\n+        try\n+        {\n+            var result = await client.CallToolAsync(tool, arguments);\n+            return new(result.IsError == true, \"tool-result\", string.Join(\"\\n\", result.Content.OfType<TextContentBlock>().Select(block => block.Text)));\n+        }\n+        catch (McpException exception)\n+        {\n+            return new(true, exception.GetType().FullName!, exception.Message);\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed record ErrorOutcome(bool IsError, string Kind, string Message);\n+}"},{"sha":"6c651b8119cdd9caad864a846daa26284a4cc2bc","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Components.McpTestApp.csproj","status":"added","additions":23,"deletions":0,"changes":23,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents.McpTestApp.csproj","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents.McpTestApp.csproj","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents.McpTestApp.csproj?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@\n+<Project Sdk=\"Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Web\">\n+  <PropertyGroup>\n+    <TargetFramework>$(DefaultNetCoreTargetFramework)</TargetFramework>\n+    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>\n+    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>\n+    <BlazorDisableThrowNavigationException>true</BlazorDisableThrowNavigationException>\n+  </PropertyGroup>\n+  <ItemGroup>\n+    <PackageVersion Update=\"Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Abstractions\" Version=\"10.8.3\" />\n+    <PackageReference Include=\"ModelContextProtocol.AspNetCore\" />\n+    <ProjectReference Include=\"$(RepoRoot)src\\Components\\Mcp\\src\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.csproj\" />\n+  </ItemGroup>\n+  <Target Name=\"IncludeMcpConsumerBrowserRuntime\" BeforeTargets=\"ResolveProjectStaticWebAssets\" Condition=\"'$(NoBuild)' != 'true'\">\n+    <ItemGroup>\n+      <Content Include=\"JS\\dist\\$(Configuration)\\mcp-consumer.js\"\n+               Link=\"wwwroot\\mcp-consumer.js\"\n+               ContentRoot=\"$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)\\JS\\dist\\$(Configuration)\\\" />\n+    </ItemGroup>\n+  </Target>\n+  <ItemGroup>\n+    <Content Remove=\"JS\\**\\*.ts;JS\\package.json;JS\\rollup.config.mjs;JS\\tsconfig.json\" />\n+  </ItemGroup>\n+</Project>"},{"sha":"b80f83efdf5d1918b8ea23c4bcfe69352f3cdd9d","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Components/App.razor","status":"added","additions":41,"deletions":0,"changes":41,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FApp.razor","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FApp.razor","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FApp.razor?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,41 @@\n+@inject NavigationManager Navigation\n+\n+<!DOCTYPE html>\n+<html lang=\"en\">\n+<head>\n+    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n+    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"data:,\" />\n+    <base href=\"@Navigation.BaseUri\" />\n+    <HeadOutlet />\n+</head>\n+<body>\n+    @if (Context?.IsShellRendering == true)\n+    {\n+        <p id=\"authored-shell\">Loading the authored application...</p>\n+    }\n+    else\n+    {\n+    <Router AppAssembly=\"@typeof(App).Assembly\">\n+        <Found Context=\"routeData\">\n+            <RouteView RouteData=\"@routeData\" DefaultLayout=\"@typeof(ProofLayout)\" />\n+        </Found>\n+        <NotFound>\n+            <p id=\"not-found\">Not found</p>\n+        </NotFound>\n+    </Router>\n+    }\n+    @if (Context?.IsActive == true)\n+    {\n+        <script id=\"authored-runtime\" src=\"blazor.mcp.js\"></script>\n+    }\n+    else\n+    {\n+        <script src=\"_framework/blazor.web.js\"></script>\n+    }\n+</body>\n+</html>\n+\n+@code {\n+    [CascadingParameter]\n+    public Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.McpComponentRequestContext? Context { get; set; }\n+}"},{"sha":"ac7b6c3338a6b96302a54de33ee317ae68b5e61d","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Components/NoScriptApp.razor","status":"added","additions":7,"deletions":0,"changes":7,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FNoScriptApp.razor","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FNoScriptApp.razor","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FNoScriptApp.razor?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@\n+@inject NavigationManager Navigation\n+\n+<!DOCTYPE html>\n+<html>\n+<head><base href=\"@Navigation.BaseUri\" /></head>\n+<body><p id=\"no-script-shell\">An authored document without a runtime script.</p></body>\n+</html>"},{"sha":"b6fad020a85864bceefda5f9f0f6ac3d98300916","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Components/Pages/GatedForm.razor","status":"added","additions":43,"deletions":0,"changes":43,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FGatedForm.razor","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FGatedForm.razor","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FGatedForm.razor?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,43 @@\n+@page \"/mcp-gated\"\n+@using BlazorMcpProof\n+@using global::Components.McpTestApp.Hosting\n+@inject McpFormEffects Effects\n+@inject McpScopeProbe Scope\n+@inject FormActionGate Gate\n+@inject FormOperationCancellation Cancellation\n+@implements IDisposable\n+\n+<form method=\"post\" @formname=\"gated\" @onsubmit=\"Submit\">\n+    <AntiforgeryToken />\n+    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"Case\" value=\"@ActiveCase\" />\n+    <button id=\"gated-submit\" type=\"submit\">Run gated action</button>\n+</form>\n+<a id=\"gated-next\" href=\"mcp-form?case=gated-next\">Navigate while the action is pending</a>\n+<p id=\"gated-result\">@result</p>\n+\n+@code {\n+    private string? result;\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = \"case\")]\n+    public string? QueryCase { get; set; }\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromForm(Name = \"Case\")]\n+    private string? FormCase { get; set; }\n+\n+    private string ActiveCase => FormCase ?? QueryCase ?? \"gated\";\n+\n+    protected override void OnInitialized()\n+    {\n+        Scope.CaseId = ActiveCase;\n+        Effects.ComponentCreated(ActiveCase);\n+    }\n+\n+    private async Task Submit()\n+    {\n+        await Gate.WaitAsync(ActiveCase, Cancellation.CancellationToken);\n+        Effects.Record(ActiveCase, \"completed\");\n+        result = \"completed\";\n+    }\n+\n+    public void Dispose() => Effects.ComponentDisposed(ActiveCase);\n+}"},{"sha":"c9df912278bc8129d9c2e7a231ab8cc04cba713a","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Components/Pages/McpForm.razor","status":"added","additions":100,"deletions":0,"changes":100,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FMcpForm.razor","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FMcpForm.razor","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FMcpForm.razor?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,100 @@\n+@page \"/mcp-form\"\n+@namespace BlazorMcpProof\n+@using System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations\n+@inject McpFormEffects Effects\n+@inject McpScopeProbe Scope\n+@implements IDisposable\n+\n+<PageTitle>MCP form parity</PageTitle>\n+\n+<h1>MCP form parity</h1>\n+\n+<EditForm Model=\"Input\" FormName=\"mcp-parity\" OnValidSubmit=\"Submit\" Enhance>\n+    <DataAnnotationsValidator />\n+    <ValidationSummary />\n+    <label>\n+        Name\n+        <InputText id=\"name\" @bind-Value=\"Input.Name\" />\n+    </label>\n+    <button type=\"submit\">Submit</button>\n+</EditForm>\n+\n+<p id=\"submitted-name\">@submittedName</p>\n+<p id=\"effect-count\">@Effects.Read(CaseId!).Count</p>\n+<p id=\"last-effect\">@Effects.Read(CaseId!).Value</p>\n+<p id=\"scope-id\">@Scope.Id</p>\n+\n+<a id=\"configure-browser-link\" href=\"@($\"mcp-form?case={CaseId}&configure-browser=true\")\">Configure the HTTP browser component</a>\n+<a id=\"relative-form-action\" href=\"@(\"forms/nested/edit?mode=form-action&case=base-form\")\">Relative form action</a>\n+<a id=\"relative-submitter-action\" href=\"@(\"forms/nested/edit?mode=submitter-action&case=base-submitter\")\">Relative submitter action</a>\n+<a id=\"relative-empty\" href=\"@(\"forms/nested/edit?mode=empty&case=base-empty\")\">Empty form action</a>\n+<a id=\"relative-missing\" href=\"@(\"forms/nested/edit?mode=missing&case=base-missing\")\">Default form action</a>\n+<a id=\"upload-urlencoded\" href=\"@(\"mcp-upload?encoding=urlencoded&case=upload-urlencoded\")\">URL-encoded file control</a>\n+<a id=\"upload-multipart\" href=\"@(\"mcp-upload?encoding=multipart&case=upload-multipart\")\">Multipart file control</a>\n+<a id=\"upload-empty\" href=\"@(\"mcp-upload?encoding=multipart&case=upload-empty\")\">Empty file control</a>\n+<a id=\"upload-override-link\" href=\"@(\"mcp-upload?encoding=urlencoded&case=upload-override\")\">Multipart submitter override</a>\n+<a id=\"gated-close-link\" href=\"mcp-gated?case=gated-close\">Gated action for teardown</a>\n+<a id=\"gated-navigation-link\" href=\"mcp-gated?case=gated-navigation\">Gated action for navigation</a>\n+@if (ConfigureHttpBrowser)\n+{\n+    <ConfigureBrowser Options=\"@HttpOnlyOptions\" />\n+    <p id=\"http-browser-configuration\">HTTP browser options component rendered</p>\n+}\n+\n+<div id=\"permanent-content\" data-permanent>\n+    <input id=\"permanent-input\" value=\"initial\" />\n+</div>\n+\n+<form method=\"get\">\n+    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"case\" value=\"@CaseId\" />\n+    <label>\n+        Native constraint\n+        <input id=\"native-required\" name=\"native\" required />\n+    </label>\n+    <button id=\"native-submit\" type=\"submit\">Submit native form</button>\n+</form>\n+\n+<form method=\"post\">\n+    <button id=\"framework-error\" type=\"submit\">Submit without a named handler</button>\n+</form>\n+\n+@code {\n+    private string? submittedName;\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromForm]\n+    private FormInput Input { get; set; } = default!;\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = \"case\")]\n+    public string? CaseId { get; set; }\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = \"configure-browser\")]\n+    public bool ConfigureHttpBrowser { get; set; }\n+\n+    private BrowserOptions HttpOnlyOptions { get; } = new()\n+    {\n+        StaticServer = { PreserveDom = false },\n+    };\n+\n+    protected override void OnInitialized()\n+    {\n+        Input ??= new();\n+        CaseId ??= \"default\";\n+        Scope.CaseId = CaseId;\n+        Effects.ComponentCreated(CaseId);\n+    }\n+\n+    private void Submit()\n+    {\n+        submittedName = Input.Name;\n+        Effects.Record(CaseId!, Input.Name);\n+    }\n+\n+    public void Dispose() => Effects.ComponentDisposed(CaseId!);\n+\n+    public sealed class FormInput\n+    {\n+        [Required]\n+        [StringLength(30, MinimumLength = 2)]\n+        public string Name { get; set; } = \"\";\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"6a46ce9dcff9fe67df51f729ea40b2fa5fdc60e3","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Components/Pages/McpFormEffects.cs","status":"added","additions":66,"deletions":0,"changes":66,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FMcpFormEffects.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FMcpFormEffects.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FMcpFormEffects.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,66 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Collections.Concurrent;\n+\n+namespace BlazorMcpProof;\n+\n+public sealed class McpFormEffects\n+{\n+    private readonly ConcurrentDictionary<string, Observation> _observations = new();\n+\n+    public void Record(string caseId, string value)\n+    {\n+        var state = Get(caseId);\n+        lock (state)\n+        {\n+            state.Count++;\n+            state.Value = value;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    public Observation Read(string caseId)\n+    {\n+        var state = Get(caseId);\n+        lock (state)\n+        {\n+            return new Observation\n+            {\n+                Count = state.Count,\n+                Value = state.Value,\n+                ComponentsCreated = state.ComponentsCreated,\n+                ComponentsDisposed = state.ComponentsDisposed,\n+                ScopesDisposed = state.ScopesDisposed,\n+            };\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    public void ComponentCreated(string caseId) => Interlocked.Increment(ref Get(caseId).ComponentsCreated);\n+    public void ComponentDisposed(string caseId) => Interlocked.Increment(ref Get(caseId).ComponentsDisposed);\n+    public void ScopeDisposed(string caseId) => Interlocked.Increment(ref Get(caseId).ScopesDisposed);\n+    public void Reset(string caseId) => _observations.TryRemove(caseId, out _);\n+    private Observation Get(string caseId) => _observations.GetOrAdd(caseId, _ => new());\n+\n+    public sealed class Observation\n+    {\n+        public int Count;\n+        public string Value { get; set; } = \"\";\n+        public int ComponentsCreated;\n+        public int ComponentsDisposed;\n+        public int ScopesDisposed;\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+public sealed class McpScopeProbe(McpFormEffects effects) : IDisposable\n+{\n+    public Guid Id { get; } = Guid.NewGuid();\n+    public string? CaseId { get; set; }\n+\n+    public void Dispose()\n+    {\n+        if (CaseId is { } caseId)\n+        {\n+            effects.ScopeDisposed(caseId);\n+        }\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"5e33a0f84507db67a8b3202785a77fb0edbd2374","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Components/Pages/RedirectForm.razor","status":"added","additions":36,"deletions":0,"changes":36,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FRedirectForm.razor","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FRedirectForm.razor","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FRedirectForm.razor?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@\n+@page \"/mcp-redirect\"\n+@using BlazorMcpProof\n+@inject McpFormEffects Effects\n+@inject McpScopeProbe Scope\n+@inject NavigationManager Navigation\n+@implements IDisposable\n+\n+<form method=\"post\" @formname=\"redirect\" @onsubmit=\"Submit\">\n+    <AntiforgeryToken />\n+    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"Case\" value=\"@ActiveCase\" />\n+    <button id=\"redirect-submit\" type=\"submit\">Submit and redirect</button>\n+</form>\n+\n+@code {\n+    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = \"case\")]\n+    public string? QueryCase { get; set; }\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromForm(Name = \"Case\")]\n+    private string? FormCase { get; set; }\n+\n+    private string ActiveCase => FormCase ?? QueryCase ?? \"redirect\";\n+\n+    protected override void OnInitialized()\n+    {\n+        Scope.CaseId = ActiveCase;\n+        Effects.ComponentCreated(ActiveCase);\n+    }\n+\n+    private void Submit()\n+    {\n+        Effects.Record(ActiveCase, \"redirected\");\n+        Navigation.NavigateTo($\"mcp-redirect-result?case={Uri.EscapeDataString(ActiveCase)}\");\n+    }\n+\n+    public void Dispose() => Effects.ComponentDisposed(ActiveCase);\n+}"},{"sha":"47d38a7b0aea60b2ed57ea96af51a79afe8fcc41","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Components/Pages/RedirectResult.razor","status":"added","additions":26,"deletions":0,"changes":26,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FRedirectResult.razor","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FRedirectResult.razor","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FRedirectResult.razor?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@\n+@page \"/mcp-redirect-result\"\n+@using BlazorMcpProof\n+@inject McpFormEffects Effects\n+@inject McpScopeProbe Scope\n+@implements IDisposable\n+\n+<p id=\"redirect-count\">@Effects.Read(ActiveCase).Count</p>\n+<p id=\"redirect-form-data\">@(FormCase is null ? \"none\" : \"retained\")</p>\n+\n+@code {\n+    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = \"case\")]\n+    public string? QueryCase { get; set; }\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromForm(Name = \"Case\")]\n+    private string? FormCase { get; set; }\n+\n+    private string ActiveCase => QueryCase ?? \"redirect\";\n+\n+    protected override void OnInitialized()\n+    {\n+        Scope.CaseId = ActiveCase;\n+        Effects.ComponentCreated(ActiveCase);\n+    }\n+\n+    public void Dispose() => Effects.ComponentDisposed(ActiveCase);\n+}"},{"sha":"eb2fe1c68f6ae4bb20a8758f1e4b1c58122d654e","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Components/Pages/RelativeActionForm.razor","status":"added","additions":53,"deletions":0,"changes":53,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FRelativeActionForm.razor","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FRelativeActionForm.razor","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FRelativeActionForm.razor?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,53 @@\n+@page \"/forms/nested/edit\"\n+@page \"/forms/nested/save\"\n+@page \"/save\"\n+@using BlazorMcpProof\n+@inject NavigationManager Navigation\n+@inject McpFormEffects Effects\n+\n+<p id=\"relative-location\">@Navigation.ToBaseRelativePath(Navigation.Uri)</p>\n+<form id=\"relative-form\" method=\"post\" action=\"@FormAction\" @formname=\"relative-save\" @onsubmit=\"SubmitHandler\">\n+    <AntiforgeryToken />\n+    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"Case\" value=\"@ActiveCase\" />\n+    <button id=\"relative-submit\" type=\"submit\" formaction=\"@SubmitterAction\">Save</button>\n+</form>\n+<p id=\"action-result\">@result</p>\n+\n+@code {\n+    private string? result;\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = \"mode\")]\n+    public string? Mode { get; set; }\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = \"case\")]\n+    public string? QueryCase { get; set; }\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromForm(Name = \"Case\")]\n+    private string? FormCase { get; set; }\n+\n+    private string ActiveCase => FormCase ?? QueryCase ?? \"relative-action\";\n+    private string? FormAction => Mode switch\n+    {\n+        \"form-action\" => \"save\",\n+        \"submitter-action\" => \"forms/nested/save\",\n+        \"empty\" => \"\",\n+        _ => null,\n+    };\n+    private string? SubmitterAction => Mode == \"submitter-action\" ? \"save\" : null;\n+    private Action SubmitHandler => Navigation.ToBaseRelativePath(Navigation.Uri).Split('?')[0] switch\n+    {\n+        \"save\" => SaveAtBase,\n+        \"forms/nested/save\" => SaveAtNestedPath,\n+        _ => SaveAtCurrentLocation,\n+    };\n+\n+    private void SaveAtBase() => Record(\"base-target\");\n+    private void SaveAtNestedPath() => Record(\"nested-target\");\n+    private void SaveAtCurrentLocation() => Record(\"current-target\");\n+\n+    private void Record(string destination)\n+    {\n+        result = destination;\n+        Effects.Record(ActiveCase, destination);\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"5cbcfa4247618eccea36470190a290e5ce639c86","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Components/Pages/UploadForm.razor","status":"added","additions":61,"deletions":0,"changes":61,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FUploadForm.razor","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FUploadForm.razor","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FPages%2FUploadForm.razor?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,61 @@\n+@page \"/mcp-upload\"\n+@using BlazorMcpProof\n+@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http\n+@inject McpFormEffects Effects\n+\n+<form method=\"post\" enctype=\"@Encoding\" @formname=\"upload\" @onsubmit=\"Submit\">\n+    <AntiforgeryToken />\n+    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"Case\" value=\"@ActiveCase\" />\n+    <input id=\"upload\" type=\"file\" name=\"Upload\" />\n+    <button id=\"upload-submit\" type=\"submit\">Submit upload</button>\n+    <button id=\"upload-override\" type=\"submit\" formenctype=\"multipart/form-data\">Submit multipart override</button>\n+</form>\n+<p id=\"upload-result\">@result</p>\n+<p id=\"uploaded-kind\">@kind</p>\n+<p id=\"uploaded-name\">@fileName</p>\n+<p id=\"uploaded-content-type\">@contentType</p>\n+<p id=\"uploaded-bytes\">@bytes</p>\n+<p id=\"uploaded-field\">@(PostedField ?? \"(none)\")</p>\n+\n+@code {\n+    private string? result;\n+    private string kind = \"none\";\n+    private string? fileName;\n+    private string? contentType;\n+    private string? bytes;\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = \"encoding\")]\n+    public string? RequestedEncoding { get; set; }\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = \"case\")]\n+    public string? QueryCase { get; set; }\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromForm(Name = \"Case\")]\n+    private string? FormCase { get; set; }\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromForm(Name = \"Upload\")]\n+    private IFormFile? Upload { get; set; }\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromForm(Name = \"Upload\")]\n+    private string? PostedField { get; set; }\n+\n+    private string ActiveCase => FormCase ?? QueryCase ?? \"upload\";\n+    private string Encoding => RequestedEncoding == \"urlencoded\" ? \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" : \"multipart/form-data\";\n+\n+    private async Task Submit()\n+    {\n+        if (Upload is { } file)\n+        {\n+            kind = \"file\";\n+            fileName = file.FileName;\n+            contentType = file.ContentType;\n+            await using var stream = file.OpenReadStream();\n+            using var output = new MemoryStream();\n+            await stream.CopyToAsync(output);\n+            bytes = Convert.ToHexString(output.ToArray());\n+        }\n+\n+        result = \"submitted\";\n+        Effects.Record(ActiveCase, kind);\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"8d7256067501521de1754c71a6e6f6fb967ef923","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Components/ProofLayout.razor","status":"added","additions":5,"deletions":0,"changes":5,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FProofLayout.razor","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FProofLayout.razor","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FProofLayout.razor?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@\n+@inherits LayoutComponentBase\n+\n+<main id=\"proof-layout\">\n+    @Body\n+</main>"},{"sha":"63c6a11af610a936aa86a2c4fdbbdf824feafc32","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Components/TypedApp.razor","status":"added","additions":72,"deletions":0,"changes":72,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FTypedApp.razor","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FTypedApp.razor","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2FTypedApp.razor?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,72 @@\n+@using global::Components.McpTestApp.Hosting\n+@inject NavigationManager Navigation\n+@inject InitialFormState State\n+\n+<!DOCTYPE html>\n+<html lang=\"en\">\n+<head>\n+    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n+    <base href=\"@Navigation.BaseUri\" />\n+</head>\n+<body>\n+    @if (Context?.IsShellRendering == true)\n+    {\n+        <p id=\"typed-shell\">Loading typed application...</p>\n+    }\n+    else\n+    {\n+    <p id=\"initial-label\">@InitialData.Label</p>\n+    <p id=\"initial-count\">@InitialData.Count</p>\n+    <p id=\"typed-value\">@submittedValue</p>\n+    <p id=\"render-id\">@renderId</p>\n+    <EditForm Model=\"Input\" FormName=\"typed-form\" OnSubmit=\"Submit\">\n+        <InputText @bind-Value=\"Input.Name\" />\n+        <button type=\"submit\">Submit</button>\n+    </EditForm>\n+    }\n+    <script id=\"typed-runtime\" src=\"blazor.mcp.js\"></script>\n+</body>\n+</html>\n+\n+@code {\n+    private readonly Guid renderId = Guid.NewGuid();\n+    private string? submittedValue;\n+\n+    [CascadingParameter]\n+    public Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.McpComponentRequestContext? Context { get; set; }\n+\n+    [Parameter]\n+    public InitialFormData InitialData { get; set; } = default!;\n+\n+    [SupplyParameterFromForm]\n+    private TypedInput Input { get; set; } = default!;\n+\n+    protected override void OnInitialized()\n+    {\n+        if (Context?.IsShellRendering == true)\n+        {\n+            return;\n+        }\n+\n+        ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(InitialData);\n+        Input ??= new();\n+        State.Rendered();\n+    }\n+\n+    private void Submit()\n+    {\n+        if (Input.Name == \"throw-action\")\n+        {\n+            throw new ModelContextProtocol.McpException(\"The business form action failed.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        State.Submitted();\n+        submittedValue = Input.Name;\n+        InitialData.Label += \":changed\";\n+    }\n+\n+    public sealed class TypedInput\n+    {\n+        public string Name { get; set; } = \"\";\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"d1071fc5f3f940bb90db9b96117fc5800b56267c","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Components/_Imports.razor","status":"added","additions":5,"deletions":0,"changes":5,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2F_Imports.razor","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2F_Imports.razor","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FComponents%2F_Imports.razor?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@\n+@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components\n+@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Forms\n+@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Routing\n+@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web\n+@using global::Components.McpTestApp.Components"},{"sha":"ef056f07c332a10b85ea0eefe1fcd6b7244a8ddb","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Hosting/FormActionGate.cs","status":"added","additions":44,"deletions":0,"changes":44,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FHosting%2FFormActionGate.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FHosting%2FFormActionGate.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FHosting%2FFormActionGate.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,44 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Collections.Concurrent;\n+\n+namespace Components.McpTestApp.Hosting;\n+\n+public sealed class FormActionGate\n+{\n+    private readonly ConcurrentDictionary<string, Gate> _gates = new();\n+\n+    public async Task WaitAsync(string caseId, CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n+    {\n+        var gate = _gates.GetOrAdd(caseId, _ => new());\n+        using var registration = cancellationToken.Register(() => Interlocked.Exchange(ref gate.CancellationObserved, 1));\n+        Interlocked.Exchange(ref gate.Started, 1);\n+        await gate.Release.Task;\n+        cancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n+    }\n+\n+    public void Release(string caseId) => _gates.GetOrAdd(caseId, _ => new()).Release.TrySetResult();\n+\n+    public object Read(string caseId)\n+    {\n+        var gate = _gates.GetOrAdd(caseId, _ => new());\n+        return new\n+        {\n+            Started = Volatile.Read(ref gate.Started) != 0,\n+            CancellationObserved = Volatile.Read(ref gate.CancellationObserved) != 0,\n+        };\n+    }\n+\n+    private sealed class Gate\n+    {\n+        public TaskCompletionSource Release { get; } = new(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);\n+        public int Started;\n+        public int CancellationObserved;\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+public sealed class FormOperationCancellation(CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n+{\n+    public CancellationToken CancellationToken { get; } = cancellationToken;\n+}"},{"sha":"e24f560caa37632b960163d73c8128bbac3b8800","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Hosting/InitialDataTools.cs","status":"added","additions":106,"deletions":0,"changes":106,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FHosting%2FInitialDataTools.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FHosting%2FInitialDataTools.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FHosting%2FInitialDataTools.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,106 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Text.Json;\n+using System.Text.Json.Nodes;\n+using ModelContextProtocol;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Protocol;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Server;\n+\n+namespace Components.McpTestApp.Hosting;\n+\n+public sealed class InitialDataTools(InitialFormState state)\n+{\n+    [McpServerTool(Name = \"open_initial_form\")]\n+    public CallToolResult Open(InitialToolArguments input) => state.Open(input);\n+\n+    [McpServerTool(Name = \"unassociated_initial_form\")]\n+    public CallToolResult Unassociated(InitialToolArguments input) => state.Open(input);\n+}\n+\n+public sealed class InitialToolArguments\n+{\n+    public string Label { get; set; } = \"\";\n+    public int Count { get; set; }\n+    public bool Error { get; set; }\n+    public bool Throw { get; set; }\n+}\n+\n+public sealed class InitialFormData\n+{\n+    public string Label { get; set; } = \"\";\n+    public int Count { get; set; }\n+}\n+\n+public sealed class InitialFormState\n+{\n+    private readonly object _lock = new();\n+    private CallToolResult _sharedResult = CreateResult();\n+    private int _openingCalls;\n+    private int _projectionCalls;\n+    private int _renders;\n+    private int _submissions;\n+\n+    public CallToolResult Open(InitialToolArguments input)\n+    {\n+        Interlocked.Increment(ref _openingCalls);\n+        if (input.Throw)\n+        {\n+            throw new McpException(\"The business opening tool failed.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        lock (_lock)\n+        {\n+            _sharedResult.IsError = input.Error;\n+            _sharedResult.Content = [new TextContentBlock { Text = input.Error ? \"Business error.\" : $\"Business result: {input.Label}.\" }];\n+            _sharedResult.StructuredContent = JsonSerializer.SerializeToElement(\n+                new InitialFormData { Label = input.Label, Count = input.Count }, McpJsonUtilities.DefaultOptions);\n+            return _sharedResult;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    public InitialFormData Project(CallToolResult result)\n+    {\n+        Interlocked.Increment(ref _projectionCalls);\n+        return result.StructuredContent is { } content\n+            ? content.Deserialize<InitialFormData>(McpJsonUtilities.DefaultOptions)!\n+            : throw new InvalidOperationException(\"The opening tool did not return initial data.\");\n+    }\n+\n+    public void Rendered() => Interlocked.Increment(ref _renders);\n+    public void Submitted() => Interlocked.Increment(ref _submissions);\n+\n+    public object Read()\n+    {\n+        lock (_lock)\n+        {\n+            return new\n+            {\n+                OpeningCalls = Volatile.Read(ref _openingCalls),\n+                ProjectionCalls = Volatile.Read(ref _projectionCalls),\n+                Renders = Volatile.Read(ref _renders),\n+                Submissions = Volatile.Read(ref _submissions),\n+                SharedResultHasViewMetadata = _sharedResult.Meta?.ContainsKey(\"blazor\") == true,\n+            };\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    public void Reset()\n+    {\n+        lock (_lock)\n+        {\n+            _sharedResult = CreateResult();\n+            _openingCalls = 0;\n+            _projectionCalls = 0;\n+            _renders = 0;\n+            _submissions = 0;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    private static CallToolResult CreateResult()\n+        => new()\n+        {\n+            Content = [],\n+            Meta = new JsonObject { [\"business\"] = \"preserved\" },\n+        };\n+}"},{"sha":"c57e70a1e5df61cf14156244b76eed2dfa52973d","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Hosting/McpTestConsumer.cs","status":"added","additions":141,"deletions":0,"changes":141,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FHosting%2FMcpTestConsumer.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FHosting%2FMcpTestConsumer.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FHosting%2FMcpTestConsumer.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,141 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Collections.Concurrent;\n+using System.Text.Json;\n+using System.Text.Json.Nodes;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Client;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Protocol;\n+\n+namespace Components.McpTestApp.Hosting;\n+\n+public sealed class McpTestConsumer : IAsyncDisposable\n+{\n+    private readonly ConcurrentDictionary<Guid, Connection> _connections = new();\n+\n+    public async Task<OpenedApp> OpenAsync(Uri producer, string hostOrigin, bool resultFirst, string openingToolName, Dictionary<string, object?> arguments, CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n+    {\n+        var client = await McpClient.CreateAsync(new HttpClientTransport(new()\n+        {\n+            Endpoint = producer,\n+            TransportMode = HttpTransportMode.StreamableHttp,\n+        }), new McpClientOptions\n+        {\n+            ClientInfo = new Implementation { Name = \"Components MCP test consumer\", Version = \"1.0.0\" },\n+            Capabilities = new ClientCapabilities\n+            {\n+                Extensions = new Dictionary<string, object>\n+                {\n+                    [\"io.modelcontextprotocol/ui\"] = new JsonObject\n+                    {\n+                        [\"mimeTypes\"] = new JsonArray(\"text/html;profile=mcp-app\"),\n+                    },\n+                },\n+            },\n+        }, cancellationToken: cancellationToken);\n+        var connection = new Connection(client, hostOrigin);\n+        if (!_connections.TryAdd(connection.Id, connection))\n+        {\n+            await client.DisposeAsync();\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException(\"The consumer connection identifier is already in use.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        try\n+        {\n+            await client.ListResourcesAsync(cancellationToken: cancellationToken);\n+            var tools = await client.ListToolsAsync(cancellationToken: cancellationToken);\n+            var tool = tools.Select(candidate => candidate.ProtocolTool).Single(candidate =>\n+                candidate.Name == openingToolName && candidate.Meta?[\"ui\"]?[\"resourceUri\"] is not null\n+                && IsVisible(candidate, \"model\"));\n+            connection.Tools = tools.Select(candidate => candidate.ProtocolTool).ToArray();\n+            var uri = tool.Meta![\"ui\"]![\"resourceUri\"]!.GetValue<string>();\n+            ReadResourceResult resourceResult;\n+            CallToolResult initialResult;\n+            if (resultFirst)\n+            {\n+                initialResult = await client.CallToolAsync(tool.Name, arguments, cancellationToken: cancellationToken);\n+                resourceResult = await client.ReadResourceAsync(uri, cancellationToken: cancellationToken);\n+            }\n+            else\n+            {\n+                resourceResult = await client.ReadResourceAsync(uri, cancellationToken: cancellationToken);\n+                initialResult = await client.CallToolAsync(tool.Name, arguments, cancellationToken: cancellationToken);\n+            }\n+\n+            var resource = resourceResult.Contents.OfType<TextResourceContents>().Single(content =>\n+                content.Uri == uri && content.MimeType == \"text/html;profile=mcp-app\");\n+            return new(connection.Id, tool, resource, initialResult, arguments);\n+        }\n+        catch\n+        {\n+            _connections.TryRemove(connection.Id, out _);\n+            await client.DisposeAsync();\n+            throw;\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    public Connection Get(Guid id)\n+        => _connections.TryGetValue(id, out var connection) ? connection : throw new InvalidOperationException(\"The consumer connection is not available.\");\n+\n+    public async Task<object> ForwardAsync(Guid id, BrokerRequest request, CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n+    {\n+        var connection = Get(id);\n+        return request.Method switch\n+        {\n+            \"tools/list\" => new ListToolsResult { Tools = connection.Tools.ToList() },\n+            \"tools/call\" => await CallAsync(connection, request.Parameters, cancellationToken),\n+            \"resources/list\" => new ListResourcesResult\n+            {\n+                Resources = (await connection.Client.ListResourcesAsync(cancellationToken: cancellationToken)).Select(resource => resource.ProtocolResource).ToList(),\n+            },\n+            \"resources/read\" => await connection.Client.ReadResourceAsync(request.Parameters.GetProperty(\"uri\").GetString()!, cancellationToken: cancellationToken),\n+            _ => throw new InvalidOperationException($\"The test consumer does not implement '{request.Method}'.\"),\n+        };\n+    }\n+\n+    private static async Task<CallToolResult> CallAsync(Connection connection, JsonElement parameters, CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n+    {\n+        var name = parameters.GetProperty(\"name\").GetString()!;\n+        var tool = connection.Tools.Single(tool => tool.Name == name);\n+        if (!IsVisible(tool, \"app\"))\n+        {\n+            throw new InvalidOperationException(\"The tool is not app-visible on the owning connection.\");\n+        }\n+\n+        var arguments = parameters.TryGetProperty(\"arguments\", out var supplied)\n+            ? supplied.Deserialize<Dictionary<string, object?>>()!\n+            : new Dictionary<string, object?>();\n+        return await connection.Client.CallToolAsync(name, arguments, cancellationToken: cancellationToken);\n+    }\n+\n+    private static bool IsVisible(Tool tool, string visibility)\n+        => tool.Meta?[\"ui\"]?[\"visibility\"] is not { } specified\n+            || specified.AsArray().Any(value => value?.GetValue<string>() == visibility);\n+\n+    public async Task CloseAsync(Guid id)\n+    {\n+        if (_connections.TryRemove(id, out var connection))\n+        {\n+            await connection.Client.DisposeAsync();\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    public async ValueTask DisposeAsync()\n+    {\n+        foreach (var id in _connections.Keys)\n+        {\n+            await CloseAsync(id);\n+        }\n+    }\n+\n+    public sealed record OpenedApp(Guid Id, Tool Tool, TextResourceContents Resource, CallToolResult Result, Dictionary<string, object?> Arguments);\n+    public sealed record BrokerRequest(string Method, JsonElement Parameters);\n+\n+    public sealed class Connection(McpClient client, string hostOrigin)\n+    {\n+        public Guid Id { get; } = Guid.NewGuid();\n+        public McpClient Client { get; } = client;\n+        public string HostOrigin { get; } = hostOrigin;\n+        public Tool[] Tools { get; set; } = [];\n+    }\n+}"},{"sha":"178135c2b27855a27d4109630473696c869f5ed7","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/JS/.gitignore","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2F.gitignore","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2F.gitignore","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2F.gitignore?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+/dist/"},{"sha":"66339e1f661257374ce95dfd0df353076058fada","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/JS/Consumer.ts","status":"added","additions":125,"deletions":0,"changes":125,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2FConsumer.ts","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2FConsumer.ts","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2FConsumer.ts?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,125 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+import { AppBridge, McpUiResourceMetaSchema, PostMessageTransport } from '@modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps/app-bridge';\n+import { CallToolResultSchema, ListResourcesResultSchema, ListToolsResultSchema, ReadResourceResultSchema, TextResourceContentsSchema, ToolSchema } from '@modelcontextprotocol/core';\n+import { z } from 'zod';\n+\n+const OpenedAppSchema = z.object({\n+  id: z.string(),\n+  tool: ToolSchema,\n+  resource: TextResourceContentsSchema,\n+  result: CallToolResultSchema,\n+  arguments: z.record(z.string(), z.unknown()),\n+  sandboxUri: z.string(),\n+});\n+\n+const status = document.getElementById('host-status')!;\n+const view = document.getElementById('view')!;\n+let bridge: AppBridge | undefined;\n+let connectionId: string | undefined;\n+\n+function showError(error: unknown): void {\n+  console.error(error);\n+  status.textContent = error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error);\n+  status.setAttribute('data-error', 'true');\n+}\n+\n+async function waitFor<T>(promise: Promise<T>, stage: string): Promise<T> {\n+  let timer: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout>;\n+  try {\n+    return await Promise.race([\n+      promise,\n+      new Promise<never>((_, reject) => {\n+        timer = setTimeout(() => reject(new Error(`${stage} timed out.`)), 20000);\n+      }),\n+    ]);\n+  } finally {\n+    clearTimeout(timer!);\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function broker(method: string, parameters: unknown, signal: AbortSignal): Promise<unknown> {\n+  const response = await fetch(`/consumer/${connectionId}/rpc`, {\n+    method: 'POST',\n+    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n+    body: JSON.stringify({ method, parameters }),\n+    signal,\n+  });\n+  if (!response.ok) {\n+    throw new Error(await response.text());\n+  }\n+\n+  return await response.json();\n+}\n+\n+async function open(): Promise<void> {\n+  if (bridge) {\n+    throw new Error('Close the existing application before opening another one.');\n+  }\n+\n+  status.textContent = 'Discovering tools and reading the app resource...';\n+  const parameters = new URLSearchParams(location.search);\n+  const response = await fetch(`/consumer/open?${parameters}`, { method: 'POST' });\n+  if (!response.ok) {\n+    throw new Error(await response.text());\n+  }\n+\n+  const opened = OpenedAppSchema.parse(await response.json());\n+  connectionId = opened.id;\n+  const frame = document.createElement('iframe');\n+  frame.id = 'sandbox-frame';\n+  frame.setAttribute('sandbox', 'allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms');\n+  frame.style.cssText = 'border:0;width:100%;height:1000px';\n+  view.append(frame);\n+  const sandboxReady = Promise.withResolvers<void>();\n+  const initialized = Promise.withResolvers<void>();\n+  bridge = new AppBridge(null, { name: 'C# standard Apps test consumer', version: '1.0.0' },\n+    { serverTools: {}, serverResources: {} },\n+    { hostContext: { toolInfo: { tool: opened.tool }, platform: 'web', theme: 'light', displayMode: 'inline' } });\n+  bridge.onsandboxready = () => sandboxReady.resolve();\n+  bridge.oninitialized = () => initialized.resolve();\n+  bridge.onerror = showError;\n+  bridge.oncalltool = async (parameters, extra) => CallToolResultSchema.parse(await broker('tools/call', parameters, extra.mcpReq.signal));\n+  bridge.setRequestHandler('tools/list', async (request, extra) =>\n+    ListToolsResultSchema.parse(await broker('tools/list', request.params, extra.mcpReq.signal)));\n+  bridge.onreadresource = async (parameters, extra) => {\n+    const result = await broker('resources/read', parameters, extra.mcpReq.signal);\n+    return ReadResourceResultSchema.parse(result);\n+  };\n+  bridge.onlistresources = async (parameters, extra) => ListResourcesResultSchema.parse(await broker('resources/list', parameters, extra.mcpReq.signal));\n+  await bridge.connect(new PostMessageTransport(frame.contentWindow!, frame.contentWindow!));\n+  frame.src = `${opened.sandboxUri}/sandbox/${opened.id}`;\n+  await waitFor(sandboxReady.promise, 'Sandbox readiness');\n+  const metadata = opened.resource._meta?.ui === undefined\n+    ? undefined\n+    : McpUiResourceMetaSchema.parse(opened.resource._meta.ui);\n+  await bridge.sendSandboxResourceReady({ html: opened.resource.text, csp: metadata?.csp, permissions: metadata?.permissions });\n+  await waitFor(initialized.promise, 'App initialization');\n+  await bridge.sendToolInput({ arguments: opened.arguments });\n+  await bridge.sendToolResult(opened.result);\n+  status.textContent = 'App ready';\n+}\n+\n+async function close(): Promise<void> {\n+  if (bridge) {\n+    await bridge.teardownResource({}, { timeout: 10000 });\n+    await bridge.close();\n+    bridge = undefined;\n+  }\n+\n+  if (connectionId) {\n+    const response = await fetch(`/consumer/${connectionId}`, { method: 'DELETE' });\n+    if (!response.ok) {\n+      throw new Error(await response.text());\n+    }\n+\n+    connectionId = undefined;\n+  }\n+\n+  view.replaceChildren();\n+  status.textContent = 'App closed';\n+}\n+\n+document.getElementById('open')!.addEventListener('click', () => void open().catch(showError));\n+document.getElementById('close')!.addEventListener('click', () => void close().catch(showError));"},{"sha":"7819d6ee9f2498131696c664a394ed80d9bd763a","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/JS/package.json","status":"added","additions":13,"deletions":0,"changes":13,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2Fpackage.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2Fpackage.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2Fpackage.json?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@\n+{\n+  \"private\": true,\n+  \"name\": \"@microsoft/aspnetcore-components-mcp-test-consumer\",\n+  \"scripts\": {\n+    \"build\": \"rollup -c --environment development --forceExit && rollup -c --environment production --forceExit\"\n+  },\n+  \"dependencies\": {\n+    \"@modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps\": \"2.0.3\",\n+    \"@modelcontextprotocol/client\": \"2.3.1\",\n+    \"@modelcontextprotocol/core\": \"2.3.1\",\n+    \"zod\": \"4.6.5\"\n+  }\n+}"},{"sha":"eed1a86e6ed85df11cef9849743d23e3df3a13b9","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/JS/rollup.config.mjs","status":"added","additions":15,"deletions":0,"changes":15,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2Frollup.config.mjs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2Frollup.config.mjs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2Frollup.config.mjs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@\n+import path from 'path';\n+import { fileURLToPath } from 'url';\n+import createBaseConfig from '../../../../Shared.JS/rollup.config.mjs';\n+\n+const directory = path.dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url));\n+\n+export default createBaseConfig({\n+  inputOutputMap: {\n+    'mcp-consumer': './Consumer.ts',\n+  },\n+  dir: directory,\n+  updateConfig: (config) => {\n+    config.output.format = 'es';\n+  },\n+});"},{"sha":"1d0769f408bc6687dc1383d19bcfae4971b24713","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/JS/tsconfig.json","status":"added","additions":9,"deletions":0,"changes":9,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2Ftsconfig.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2Ftsconfig.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FJS%2Ftsconfig.json?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@\n+{\n+  \"extends\": \"../../../../Shared.JS/tsconfig.json\",\n+  \"compilerOptions\": {\n+    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n+    \"lib\": [ \"DOM\", \"DOM.Iterable\", \"ES2024\" ],\n+    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n+    \"noEmitOnError\": true\n+  }\n+}"},{"sha":"15abea03d1f56129a1c3fbcf1e7a5bfd65e08fa4","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Components.McpTestApp/Program.cs","status":"added","additions":203,"deletions":0,"changes":203,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FProgram.cs","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FProgram.cs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FComponents.McpTestApp%2FProgram.cs?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,203 @@\n+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.\n+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.\n+\n+using System.Text.Json;\n+using BlazorMcpProof;\n+using Components.McpTestApp.Components;\n+using Components.McpTestApp.Hosting;\n+using ModelContextProtocol;\n+using ModelContextProtocol.Server;\n+using System.Text.Json.Nodes;\n+\n+var builder = WebApplication.CreateBuilder(args);\n+AppContext.SetSwitch(\"Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Endpoints.NavigationManager.DisableThrowNavigationException\",\n+    builder.Configuration.GetValue(\"McpTest:DisableThrowNavigationException\", false));\n+var configuredUrl = builder.Configuration[\"urls\"]?.Split(';', StringSplitOptions.RemoveEmptyEntries).FirstOrDefault()\n+    ?? throw new InvalidOperationException(\"The MCP test app requires an explicit listener URL.\");\n+var baseUri = new Uri(configuredUrl.TrimEnd('/') + \"/\");\n+builder.Services.AddRazorComponents(options => options.DisableClientValidation = true);\n+builder.Services.AddSingleton<McpFormEffects>();\n+builder.Services.AddScoped<McpScopeProbe>();\n+builder.Services.AddSingleton<McpTestConsumer>();\n+builder.Services.AddSingleton<FormActionGate>();\n+builder.Services.AddHttpContextAccessor();\n+builder.Services.AddScoped(provider =>\n+{\n+    var context = provider.GetRequiredService<Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Mcp.McpComponentRequestContext>();\n+    var token = context.IsActive ? context.CancellationToken\n+        : provider.GetRequiredService<IHttpContextAccessor>().HttpContext?.RequestAborted ?? CancellationToken.None;\n+    return new FormOperationCancellation(token);\n+});\n+var initialState = new InitialFormState();\n+builder.Services.AddSingleton(initialState);\n+var toolMetadata = new JsonObject { [\"businessTool\"] = \"preserved\" };\n+builder.Services.PostConfigure<McpServerOptions>(options =>\n+{\n+    foreach (var tool in options.ToolCollection!.Where(tool => tool.ProtocolTool.Name is \"open_initial_form\" or \"unassociated_initial_form\"))\n+    {\n+        tool.ProtocolTool.Meta = toolMetadata;\n+    }\n+});\n+builder.Services.AddMcpServer().WithTools<InitialDataTools>()\n+    .WithRequestFilters(filters => filters.AddCallToolFilter(next => async (request, cancellationToken) =>\n+    {\n+        var result = await next(request, cancellationToken);\n+        if (request.Params?.Name == \"open_initial_form\" && result.IsError != true)\n+        {\n+            result.Meta ??= new JsonObject();\n+            result.Meta[\"existingFilter\"] = \"preserved\";\n+            var label = result.StructuredContent?.GetProperty(\"label\").GetString();\n+            if (label == \"filter-enrichment\")\n+            {\n+                result.StructuredContent = JsonSerializer.SerializeToElement(\n+                    new InitialFormData { Label = \"enriched-by-filter\", Count = 73 }, McpJsonUtilities.DefaultOptions);\n+            }\n+            else if (label == \"filter-error\")\n+            {\n+                result.IsError = true;\n+                result.Content = [new ModelContextProtocol.Protocol.TextContentBlock { Text = \"Rejected by the existing SDK filter.\" }];\n+            }\n+        }\n+\n+        return result;\n+    }))\n+    .WithRazorComponents<App>(options =>\n+{\n+    options.Name = \"component_form\";\n+    options.BaseUri = baseUri;\n+    options.InitialPath = \"mcp-form?case=mcp\";\n+    options.PreserveDom = builder.Configuration.GetValue(\"McpTest:PreserveDom\", true);\n+    options.LogLevel = builder.Configuration.GetValue(\"McpTest:LogLevel\", LogLevel.Information);\n+})\n+    .WithRazorComponents<TypedApp>(\"open_initial_form\", result => new Dictionary<string, object?>\n+    {\n+        [nameof(TypedApp.InitialData)] = initialState.Project(result),\n+    }, options =>\n+    {\n+        options.Name = \"typed_form\";\n+        options.BaseUri = baseUri;\n+        options.InitialPath = \"mcp-typed\";\n+    })\n+    .WithHttpTransport();\n+\n+builder.Services.AddMcpServer().WithRazorComponents<NoScriptApp>(options =>\n+{\n+    options.Name = \"no_script\";\n+    options.BaseUri = baseUri;\n+});\n+\n+var app = builder.Build();\n+var consumer = app.Services.GetRequiredService<McpTestConsumer>();\n+var sandboxBuilder = WebApplication.CreateSlimBuilder();\n+var sandbox = sandboxBuilder.Build();\n+sandbox.Urls.Clear();\n+sandbox.Urls.Add(\"http://127.0.0.1:0\");\n+sandbox.MapGet(\"/sandbox/{id:guid}\", (Guid id) =>\n+{\n+    var connection = consumer.Get(id);\n+    var hostOrigin = JsonSerializer.Serialize(connection.HostOrigin);\n+    return Results.Text(\"\"\"\n+        <!DOCTYPE html><html><body style=\"margin:0\">\n+        <script>\n+        const hostOrigin = HOST_ORIGIN;\n+        let inner;\n+        addEventListener(\"message\", event => {\n+          if (event.source === parent && event.origin === hostOrigin) {\n+            const message = event.data;\n+            if (message?.method === \"ui/notifications/sandbox-resource-ready\") {\n+              const domains = message.params.csp?.resourceDomains ?? [];\n+              const bases = message.params.csp?.baseUriDomains ?? [];\n+              const policy = `default-src 'none'; script-src 'unsafe-inline' ${domains.join(\" \")}; style-src 'unsafe-inline' ${domains.join(\" \")}; img-src data: blob: ${domains.join(\" \")}; font-src ${domains.join(\" \")}; base-uri ${bases.join(\" \") || \"'self'\"}; frame-src 'none'`;\n+              inner = document.createElement(\"iframe\");\n+              inner.id = \"app-frame\";\n+              inner.setAttribute(\"sandbox\", \"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms\");\n+              inner.style.cssText = \"border:0;width:100%;height:900px\";\n+              const parsed = new DOMParser().parseFromString(message.params.html, \"text/html\");\n+              const csp = parsed.createElement(\"meta\");\n+              csp.httpEquiv = \"Content-Security-Policy\";\n+              csp.content = policy;\n+              parsed.head.prepend(csp);\n+              inner.srcdoc = \"<!DOCTYPE html>\" + parsed.documentElement.outerHTML;\n+              document.body.append(inner);\n+            } else if (inner && !message?.method?.startsWith(\"ui/notifications/sandbox-\")) {\n+              inner.contentWindow.postMessage(message, \"*\");\n+            }\n+          } else if (inner && event.source === inner.contentWindow && !event.data?.method?.startsWith(\"ui/notifications/sandbox-\")) {\n+            parent.postMessage(event.data, hostOrigin);\n+          }\n+        });\n+        parent.postMessage({jsonrpc:\"2.0\",method:\"ui/notifications/sandbox-proxy-ready\",params:{}}, hostOrigin);\n+        </script></body></html>\n+        \"\"\".Replace(\"HOST_ORIGIN\", hostOrigin, StringComparison.Ordinal), \"text/html\");\n+});\n+await sandbox.StartAsync();\n+var sandboxUri = sandbox.Urls.Single();\n+\n+app.UseAntiforgery();\n+app.MapStaticAssets();\n+app.MapMcp(\"/mcp\");\n+app.MapRazorComponents<App>();\n+app.MapGet(\"/host\", () => Results.Text(\"\"\"\n+    <!DOCTYPE html><html><head><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"data:,\"></head><body>\n+    <h1>Standard MCP Apps test consumer</h1>\n+    <button id=\"open\">Open application</button>\n+    <button id=\"close\">Close application</button>\n+    <p id=\"host-status\">Not opened</p>\n+    <div id=\"view\"></div>\n+    <script src=\"/mcp-consumer.js\" type=\"module\"></script>\n+    </body></html>\n+    \"\"\", \"text/html\"));\n+app.MapPost(\"/consumer/open\", async (HttpContext context, bool? resultFirst, string? tool, string? label, int? count) =>\n+{\n+    var producer = builder.Configuration[\"McpProducerEndpoint\"] is { } configuredProducer ? new Uri(configuredProducer) : new Uri(baseUri, \"mcp\");\n+    var arguments = tool == \"open_initial_form\"\n+        ? new Dictionary<string, object?> { [\"input\"] = new InitialToolArguments\n+        {\n+            Label = label ?? throw new InvalidOperationException(\"The typed test consumer requires an explicit label.\"),\n+            Count = count ?? throw new InvalidOperationException(\"The typed test consumer requires an explicit count.\"),\n+        } }\n+        : new Dictionary<string, object?>();\n+    var opened = await consumer.OpenAsync(producer, baseUri.GetLeftPart(UriPartial.Authority), resultFirst == true, tool ?? \"component_form\", arguments, context.RequestAborted);\n+    return Results.Json(new { opened.Id, opened.Tool, opened.Resource, opened.Result, opened.Arguments, sandboxUri }, McpJsonUtilities.DefaultOptions);\n+});\n+app.MapPost(\"/consumer/{id:guid}/rpc\", async (Guid id, McpTestConsumer.BrokerRequest request, HttpContext context) =>\n+    Results.Json(await consumer.ForwardAsync(id, request, context.RequestAborted), McpJsonUtilities.DefaultOptions));\n+app.MapDelete(\"/consumer/{id:guid}\", async (Guid id) =>\n+{\n+    await consumer.CloseAsync(id);\n+    return Results.Ok();\n+});\n+app.MapGet(\"/observations/{caseId}\", (string caseId, McpFormEffects effects) =>\n+{\n+    var state = effects.Read(caseId);\n+    return new { state.Count, state.Value, state.ComponentsCreated, state.ComponentsDisposed, state.ScopesDisposed };\n+});\n+app.MapPost(\"/test/reset/{caseId}\", (string caseId, McpFormEffects effects) =>\n+{\n+    effects.Reset(caseId);\n+    return Results.NoContent();\n+});\n+app.MapGet(\"/test/initial-observations\", () => initialState.Read());\n+app.MapPost(\"/test/reset-initial\", () =>\n+{\n+    initialState.Reset();\n+    return Results.NoContent();\n+});\n+app.MapGet(\"/test/gate/{caseId}\", (string caseId, FormActionGate gate) => gate.Read(caseId));\n+app.MapPost(\"/test/gate/{caseId}/release\", (string caseId, FormActionGate gate) =>\n+{\n+    gate.Release(caseId);\n+    return Results.NoContent();\n+});\n+\n+try\n+{\n+    await app.RunAsync();\n+}\n+finally\n+{\n+    await sandbox.StopAsync();\n+    await sandbox.DisposeAsync();\n+}\n+\n+public sealed class McpTestAppMarker;"},{"sha":"81bb42742f7a300c1a0b5a1ef0b264e30d3eb3e3","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Directory.Build.props","status":"added","additions":26,"deletions":0,"changes":26,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FDirectory.Build.props","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FDirectory.Build.props","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FDirectory.Build.props?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@\n+<Project>\n+  <Import Project=\"$([MSBuild]::GetPathOfFileAbove('Directory.Build.props', '$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)../'))\" />\n+\n+  <PropertyGroup Condition=\" $(IsTestProject) \">\n+    <GenerateLoggingTestingAssemblyAttributes>false</GenerateLoggingTestingAssemblyAttributes>\n+    <_ImportComponentsTestingTargets>true</_ImportComponentsTestingTargets>\n+    <_ImportComponentsTestingTargets Condition=\"'$(ExcludeFromBuild)' == 'true' or '$(SkipTestBuild)' == 'true' or '$(DotNetBuildSourceOnly)' == 'true' or ('$(DotNetBuild)' == 'true' and '$(DotNetBuildTests)' != 'true')\">false</_ImportComponentsTestingTargets>\n+  </PropertyGroup>\n+\n+  <ItemGroup Condition=\" $(IsTestProject) \">\n+    <ProjectReference Remove=\"$(RepoRoot)src/Testing/src/Microsoft.AspNetCore.InternalTesting.csproj\" />\n+    <PackageReference Remove=\"Moq\" />\n+    <Compile Remove=\"$(SharedSourceRoot)test\\SuccessfulTests.cs\" />\n+    <FrameworkReference Include=\"Microsoft.AspNetCore.App\" />\n+  </ItemGroup>\n+\n+  <PropertyGroup>\n+    <UseAspNetCoreSharedRuntime>true</UseAspNetCoreSharedRuntime>\n+    <DoNotApplyWorkaroundsToMicrosoftAspNetCoreApp>true</DoNotApplyWorkaroundsToMicrosoftAspNetCoreApp>\n+  </PropertyGroup>\n+\n+  <PropertyGroup Condition=\" $(IsTestProject) and '$(_ImportComponentsTestingTargets)' == 'true' \">\n+    <_E2ETasksProject>$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)..\\..\\Testing\\tasks\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Testing.Tasks.csproj</_E2ETasksProject>\n+    <_E2ETasksAssembly Condition=\"'$(_E2ETasksAssembly)' == ''\">$(ArtifactsBinDir)Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Testing.Tasks\\$(Configuration)\\netstandard2.0\\Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Testing.Tasks.dll</_E2ETasksAssembly>\n+  </PropertyGroup>\n+</Project>"},{"sha":"3fb1d08b816037b5bc88635372801e7bb225b766","filename":"src/Components/Mcp/testassets/Directory.Build.targets","status":"added","additions":7,"deletions":0,"changes":7,"blob_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FDirectory.Build.targets","raw_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/raw/f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FDirectory.Build.targets","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/contents/src%2FComponents%2FMcp%2Ftestassets%2FDirectory.Build.targets?ref=f7a8fe5ac01d86f84069747efce39832620f08b4","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@\n+<Project>\n+  <Import Project=\"$([MSBuild]::GetPathOfFileAbove('Directory.Build.targets', '$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)../'))\" />\n+\n+  <ItemGroup Condition=\" $(IsTestProject) \">\n+    <Using Remove=\"Xunit\" />\n+  </ItemGroup>\n+</Project>"}]]